window.FWN_REBORN_BOOT_CAMP_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_REBORN_BOOT_CAMP_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4301,"title":"Chapter 4301: Divide The Soldiers","paragraphs":["This time, they were carrying out a decapitation strike to decapitate an illegal militant leader who had a secret relationship with a Western country.","Mission codename: Operation Sandstorm.","It was unknown if it was because of the negotiations between the representatives of the United Nations, but the fighting in Yeni had become much weaker. Of course, it could not be ruled out that most of the government forces had been destroyed. Only the stubborn soldiers had not been dealt with.","The black shadows shuttled through the city like ghosts. They were so fast that their heels didn’t even touch the ground. They seemed to be floating all the way and disappeared without a trace in the blink of an eye.","A transport plane made three test landings under the guidance of the flash stick, and finally succeeded in the fourth landing. Commissioner Miao, Commissioner Tao, the three PhD students, and Yang Heng, the interpreter, boarded the civilian transport plane that was returning to the country at 6:27 pm. However, they needed to transit halfway.","Yang Heng boarded the plane from the back. When he was a few steps away from the cabin, he turned around and looked behind him. The sky was already dark. The figures standing in the hazy night sky were roughly outlined, and their faces were blurred. Even so, Yang Heng could still see Ye Jian’s figure among the male soldiers.","She was 1.68 meters tall, but among the male soldiers, she looked exceptionally petite. She had a petite body, but she was holding the same rifle in the male soldiers’ hands. As she stood there, her figure was as straight as an arrow that pierced into the clouds. Her aura was not inferior to the male soldiers at all. Instead, she looked even colder and more stubborn than the male soldiers.","This version of Ye Jian was completely unfamiliar to him. It was like a version of Ye Jian that no student knew about... not even her friends.","In a high-risk profession, she fought alongside a group of male special forces soldiers while still being a student. This Ye Jian was very different from the Ye Jian Yang Heng was familiar with. She was becoming more and more different.","’Take care and be sure to return to the country!’","Yang Heng didn’t know if she would notice him, but his gaze was still fixed on her. He nodded slightly and muttered in his heart.","He turned around and walked into the cabin. He took the special materials and embarked on the journey back to his country.","Soon, the transport plane took off again. The rumbling sound was earth-shattering. It carried a strong wind as it returned to the sky. Just like that, it turned into a black dot. The wing lights on both sides flickered like stars before disappearing from the night sky.","\"Call the command center, call the command center. Our plane has taken off safely. We will land at the airport in eight hours. We will land at the airport in eight hours.\"","\"Roger, Roger. Complete radar lock. Complete radar lock.\"","In the sky, the captain called the command center. On the ground, Li Jinnian contacted the commander-in-chief of the navy to report their latest news.","They had already left the temporary landing point of the transport plane and were heading to the mine to rescue the workers of the two countries who were being subdued by the illegal militants.","Lieutenant Colonel Zhu finally received the best news about the mine. The two troops of soldiers sent out rushed back and reported everything they knew about the mine.","\"There are more than 70 illegal militants controlling the mine. The radios are blocked, so there’s no way to contact the outside world at all. There are also illegal militants on the way...","\"We temporarily drove the vehicles into the forest to hide. In the end, we came back on foot. Lieutenant Colonel, we need to send soldiers as soon as possible!\"","The soldier’s report made Lieutenant Colonel Zhu frown. There were more than 70 illegal militants and they met them again on the road. In that case, the special forces soldiers who went to rescue the workers would have to fight again!"]},{"number":4302,"title":"Chapter 4302: Hardships","paragraphs":["After listening to the soldier’s report, Lieutenant Colonel Zhu frowned. After pondering for a moment, he suddenly turned around and stopped in front of a military map. This was the military map of the entire Yeni, including the rainforest where the mine was located.","\"Where is the vehicle parked?\" he asked the soldier.","The soldier pointed out the approximate location of the vehicle on the military map. A look of joy flashed past Lieutenant Colonel Zhu’s eyes. He couldn’t wait any longer. He entered the tent and asked the soldier to contact the company that was going to rescue the hostages.","After several rounds of communication, Lieutenant Colonel Zhu finally contacted the Storm Commando Brigade whose members had entered the tropical rainforest.","The mine in the northwest of Yeni was located in a primitive tropical rainforest. The tropical rainforest was split into two. 59% was Libyan territory, and 41% was neighboring territory. It was especially rich in minerals.","Libya had abundant mineral and forest resources. However, because it was one of the poorest countries, it didn’t have the ability to develop, mine, and use these resources well. The Chinese mine company and the Libyan mine company signed a five-year contract. Both sides developed and shared resources.","While Li Jinnian was talking to Lieutenant Colonel Zhu, Big Shark pointed at a red sandalwood tree and said to Ye Jian, \"Only Libya has such a big red sandalwood tree. Unfortunately, to the Libyan people, it’s just a tree. It can’t change anything.\"","Red sandalwood was a top-notch furniture material in the world. In China, there was the saying that one inch of red sandalwood was worth one inch of gold. This showed how precious red sandalwood was.","During a short rest, Ye Jian used her hands as fans to fan herself. The air was a little stuffy. Yeni, which had been sunny for four days, quickly welcomed heavy rain. It was the same in the rainforest.","She raised her head and looked at the red sandalwood tree. Two men could hug the circumference of the bark. This was the first time she saw a red sandalwood tree. If Big Shark hadn’t pointed it out to her, she wouldn’t have known that she had come into close contact with a red sandalwood tree.","She touched the rough bark and sighed softly.","The resources were obviously abundant, but because the country was poor, they couldn’t make use of these resources. It was unknown if it was a blessing or a pity that the expensive red sandalwood tree could survive here.","From the looks of it... the sorrow was greater than the blessing.","Big Shark seemed to have thought of something. After he finished speaking, he fell silent.","Three minutes later, Li Jinnian ended the call and spoke to Sea Anemone in a low voice. After another two minutes, the water ghosts received good news.","There was a hidden truck, and it was fully fueled. If they were lucky, they would be able to drive the truck to their destination.","Every vehicle in the peacekeeping camp was equipped with a GPS device. At the moment, the vehicle was still at the same spot. It hadn’t been driven away by the illegal militants or the original military unit in the tropical rainforest.","This was good news. Although they needed to take a detour, it was better than walking on two legs.","The group of 16 people continued their march. They were 64 kilometers away from the mine. The price of being so close was that they had to walk in the rainforest. They had to take a path that no one else would take.","Actually, there was no path. They had to rely on their own feet to create a path. They walked straight through the dense forest. The mosquitoes in this rainforest were huge, as though they had mutated.","The rainforest here was different from the forest at the border of Yunnan Province in China. Sometimes, large areas of trees soared into the sky in the primeval forest in Yunnan Province. Because of the lack of sunlight, there were very short bushes on the ground.","As for this place, there were all kinds of unknown trees that were taller than humans. There were dense bushes between the trees, and there were thorny vines entangled in the bushes. When one stepped on them... one would disappear."]},{"number":4303,"title":"Chapter 4303: Assassination","paragraphs":["They wielded the military bayonet in their hands and used them to slash both sides. Just like that, they created a path.","It was already 7:32 pm.","The power generation equipment in the mine was reactivated, illuminating the entire mine as if it was daytime. The illegal militants with guns and live ammunition were guarding the surroundings. The people inside couldn’t go out, and it was difficult for the people outside to enter.","The peacekeeping soldiers, who had been staring at the mine, hid behind the broad leaves of a wild banana tree. Their hands that were holding rifles were tense as they stared ahead.","Two peacekeeping soldiers had taken the risk to enter the mine. Now... the power equipment was turned on and the power grid was working again. There was no way they could come out.","They didn’t know if their comrades would arrive safely and if the government would send soldiers to support them. To be honest, they didn’t have much hope that the government would send soldiers.","Yeni was in such a mess that the government couldn’t even take care of themselves. How could they send any more soldiers?","They would have to see if the Libyan mine company has a countermeasure.","The rain finally started. It wasn’t a drizzle. Instead, it was heavy rain that came crashing on the leaves and the ground.","Port Saks, which was located in the northwest of Yeni, seemed to have been abandoned from the outside. It was so dilapidated that weeds were growing everywhere. A few underworld gang members flashed past in the heavy rain and entered the port silently.","There were countless large ships parked at the port that had not been used for a long time. The decks were mottled with rust. There were also a few large ships that were placed in the maintenance bay. On a rainy night like this, they were like dormant beasts waiting to wake up.","The leader of the illegal militants, Kulo Caesar, was hiding in Port Saks. No one would have thought that the leader of the illegal militants, who would start wars from time to time, had always been here and had never left.","These abandoned ships weren’t really abandoned. They were all used by Kulo Caesar. All the reinforcements needed to enter Yeni, including the betrayer, Alva, were dispatched from here.","This was an important port that led to the Atlantic Ocean. Along the coastline, one could enter all the ports in the Libyan country. Kulo Caesar used the port to send the illegal armed forces who had captured Yeni into the city.","After entering the port, Sniper E6 and Observer Y6 immediately left the team and found their high ground. This was their comrades’ path of retreat. They had to guard it well.","\"Sniper in position. Observer in position.\"","The two people hiding under the tarpaulin reported their location. The heavy sniper rifles were already set up. The photoelectric scope was adjusted and aimed at a certain spot.","There, Kulo Caesar’s sentinels were watching him closely.","The rainy night was a very convenient time to commit murder. The rainwater fell with a whoosh. Even if they accidentally made a small movement, the sound would be covered by the rain.","According to the information provided by the government forces, Kulo Caesar was in the abandoned ship with the number ’11662’ in the middle. All the black shadows infiltrated the abandoned ship at their fastest speed. Even the covert sentries were not alerted.","With the appearance of anti-interference, Z7 immediately went into electromagnetic silence. He split the communication and network into multiple locations and expanded the frequency to hide their wireless communication bands.","The infrared light that could pass through walls was activated. A few green figures appeared on the screen. Z7 reached out his hand and clenched his fist, which meant that they would deal with five people at once.","King’s Water was poured on the iron door. After a puff of smoke, a huge hole was formed in the locked iron door. Then, it was gently pushed open bit by bit. Three black shadows instantly killed the three people on the other side with a quiet but fierce momentum."]},{"number":4304,"title":"Chapter 4304: Layer After Layer","paragraphs":["There was no sound or struggle. They slit the other party’s throats from behind and eliminated their targets.","\"Go forward, turn left. Take down the two people...\"","Z7 spoke softly. He took down the three black shadows and cleared his targets before continuing to move. Unexpectedly, he saw that the remaining two targets were also cleared.","Assassinations were meant to be carried out silently. They didn’t alert anyone, including the targets, and they would complete the assassination silently. From the operation to the evacuation, they had to come and go without a trace.","Although the port where Kulo Caesar was hiding looked calm, it was actually filled with danger. As the captain, Xia Jinyuan couldn’t guarantee that everything would go smoothly. Hence, he arranged for heavy snipers in advance to conserve their strength until the end.","\"Roger that.\"","K7’s cold and monotonous voice came from the earpiece. He was the most suitable person to do this kind of raid.","The comrades who went in couldn’t see their targets anymore. They were all dragged to a corner by the assaulters to avoid being discovered.","The five people were not sentinels or patrolling soldiers. They were like slackers who blocked the entrance of the special forces. As for the real entrance... Well, Xia Jinyuan had no choice.","If they wanted to enter through the real entrance, they needed to kill the sentinel. It was easy to kill the sentinel, but what if they were discovered?","Hence, during every assassination mission, Xia Jinyuan would never consider entering from the real entrance. Instead, he would open another entrance so that no one would know.","However, after entering the cabin, Xia Jinyuan quickly realized that the information provided by the Libyan government might not be accurate.","The information indicated that Kulo Caesar was a rather cunning leader of the illegal militants who had high-tech weapons around him. But the other party didn’t have any other high-tech weapons. Apart from the radio waves captured by Z7, they didn’t even have basic infrared equipment.","Even though there was a surveillance camera, it was useless since Z7 had hacked into it.","\"Reconnaissance!\"","Realizing that the information was inaccurate, Xia Jinyuan made a prompt decision and asked Z7 to hack into the detector to see if he could find any clues.","Z7 was in charge of electronic information combat, and his comrades were covering him. His fingers moved quickly as he quickly hacked into the equipment database. When checking the cameras, Z7 discovered the situation after several screenings.","Kulo Caesar wasn’t hiding in the abandoned ship with the number ’11662’. Instead, he had hidden at the entrance of the abandoned ship before entering another.","Fortunately, the two ships were side by side. There was no need to change their combat deployment at the last minute.","\"You’re cunning. Unfortunately, you met us,\" Z7 said in a low voice. A cold smile appeared on his face. \"Let’s go, comrades. This time, we’ll really attack the thieves’ nest.\"","The black shadows hiding in the crew room rushed out one by one and headed for the entrance to the real thieves’ nest.","Outside, the wind and rain intertwined. Huge waves rose on the sea one after another. The huge waves hit the high hull of the freighter and created waves that could make people dizzy. The waves were huge, but the abandoned ship didn’t move or shake. It seemed to have taken root.","They were all big abandoned boats that could carry up to 400,000 tons. Now, they were like small islands on the beach. The waves couldn’t shake them.","Instead of entering from the abandoned ship numbered 1162, they walked back outside the abandoned ship and entered the ship where Kulo Caesar was really hiding.","20 minutes later, Xia Jinyuan successfully entered the cabin with his team members. This time, Z7 didn’t follow them."]},{"number":4305,"title":"Chapter 4305: Drenched In Sweat","paragraphs":["Just like what the information said, Kulo Caesar had high-tech weapons around him. Z7, who had hacked into the surveillance camera database, first hacked into the other party’s wireless communication. Then, he silently communicated with the other party.","By controlling all the surveillance cameras on the ship, Z7 provided timely information to his comrades who had entered the cabin, including the directions to Kulo Caesar’s lounge.","The soldiers were no longer facing the dark. From time to time, there would be a few dim yellow lights shining on the ground of the cabin. Illegal militants with guns could be seen everywhere. It was especially difficult for the special forces soldiers of the Xueyu unit to take a step forward. Every step they took, they had to bend down again. They used infrared equipment to avoid the sentries one by one. With the help of individual combat thermal imaging equipment, they avoided the sentries that were hiding in the dark.","As they walked in the dark, the special forces soldiers, who were covered in layers of sweat, were all grateful that they were carrying individual combat systems. Without these good fellows, they wouldn’t have been able to enter the cabin tonight. Even if they did, they wouldn’t have been able to get out alive!","There were whistles, infrared cameras, and cameras everywhere.","\"F*ck, do they really think they’re the rulers?\"","Z7 didn’t enter the cabin, but he was sweating too. He gritted his teeth and cursed, \"When you guys go out later, you’ll find a hidden camera and two thermal imaging infrared cameras. F*ck, do you want to be the next Pentagon?\"","\"Stop talking nonsense. Hurry up and focus!\"","V8 spoke in a low voice. At this moment, his entire body was hooked around a cabin pipe. Sweat dripped down from the back of his neck like a leak.","Z7, whose ten fingers had already turned into afterimages, bit his cheek and said, \"I regret not keeping X by my side. If the two of us hacked into the system together, we could save at least half the time.\"","From deciphering the firewall to blocking it, it took eight minutes.","X, who graduated from the National Science University’s computing department, didn’t say anything. He and Y had other things to do!","Next, it was time to destroy the signal of the infrared sensors. Z7 was too good at doing this. He captured the signal frequency received by the infrared sensors and regenerated the frequency. The hidden infrared sensors were temporarily useless.","After another five minutes, Z7’s voice was heard. \"Done.\"","A new batch of black shadows appeared. They held their breaths and finally passed the turn. They seemed to be reaching the end of the cabin.","\"The third anchor... That’s right. From here, you can reach Kulo Caesar’s lounge.\"","\"Move forward three meters. There are two sentinels. You can clear them directly.\"","The two soldiers had already taken care of the two covert sentries. There were still two targets behind the wall.","\"Deal with them directly!\"","Xia Jinyuan clenched his fists and sped up.","In front was Kulo Caesar’s lounge. They had completed 999 steps. There was only one last step left!","He and K7 attacked at the same time and broke the necks of the two targets who were attracted by the small commotion. Before they could come down, the soldiers had already rushed up to. The sentinels instantly stopped breathing. Then, the soldiers carried them to the side.","X and Y were already squatting at the door that led to Kulo Caesar’s lounge. This was a password-locked door. It wasn’t an ordinary fingerprint or numerical password. There were a total of four sets of passwords that needed to be entered, and the four locks had to be deciphered before the door could be opened."]},{"number":4306,"title":"Chapter 4306: Speak English! Thank You","paragraphs":["X and Y were both top students in the computing department. It was a coincidence that they entered the Xueyu unit. When they were young, they entered websites that they shouldn’t have. In the end, they were targeted. From then on, they walked out of school and were thrown into the mountains. Half a year later, they reintegrated into society like savages.","After that, they held hands and ran on the path of the military. After a few years, they became unyielding special forces soldiers.","Being a special forces soldier didn’t mean that their ’craftsmanship’ was wasted. On the contrary, their craftsmanship became more and more proficient year by year. There was nothing they couldn’t do.","The two of them appeared. One translated and calculated while the other operated the password axis. The two of them squatted on the left and right respectively. Time seemed to pass extremely slowly. After a few moments, Xia Jinyuan and the rest received an ’OK’ gesture from the two of them.","Done!","\"You’re amazing! Three minutes and 47 seconds,\" Z7, who was using a camera to monitor the surveillance cameras on the other side of the screen, said with a smile. He secretly wiped his sweat. His comrades weren’t able to see him like this.","Damn it!","He was too f*cking nervous!","He was sweating profusely.","It was said that a cunning rabbit had three burrows. Hence, the lounge wasn’t the final hiding place of the target, Kulo Caesar. This place was usually used by Kulo Caesar to receive the so-called ’generals’ below him. The reclusive Kulo Caesar treasured his life, so there were all kinds of checkpoints and defenses. In Z7’s words, the level of security he intended to adopt was like that of the Pentagon.","However, no matter how vigilant he was, he couldn’t stop the Xueyu unit from invading silently.","The moment the door was pushed open, Y’s expression changed. He saw a data cable half-exposed on the side of the door.","\"Z7, stop talking nonsense. There’s a group of independent cameras inside!\"","Y’s words made everyone’s expression change. Z7, who was not with them, smiled and said, \"It’s okay. Walk in boldly. I’ll protect you! I’ll be with you.\"","...","F*ck!","\"Don’t say such cheesy words!\" Y’s features were twisted. Only then did he calm down.","It meant that Z7 had discovered it in advance and had already settled it.","Xia Jinyuan, who was bringing up the rear, was so shocked by this scene that his back was sweating. Hearing what was said, he heaved a sigh of relief and gestured to G3, who was also bringing up the rear. More than ten special forces soldiers quickly entered the lounge.","Z7’s deep voice came from the earpieces. He told his comrades that there was something else behind the lounge. The guy who provided information to the government had a rotten conscience. The information he gave wasn’t even half-truths. Besides telling the government where Kulo Caesar was hiding, the rest of the information... was all fake!","At 9:00 pm Libya time, Kulo Caesar ended his call with a certain Western country. Three days later, another batch of new weapons would arrive at the port. There were only two things he needed to do—destroy all the Chinese mines in Libya, let the Libyan government take the initiative, let the Libyan mineral companies unilaterally terminate their contracts with the Chinese, and let the Chinese mine company leave Libya.","Secondly, they would provide all the minerals that China had mined in Libya in the past month. In the future, it would be even better if there were some documents.","He only needed to complete these two things. After that, he would immediately replenish the armed forces that arrived at Port Saks in two batches.","Kulo Caesar happily agreed to cooperate. If he wanted to become the president of Libya, he needed the support of the country behind him. It didn’t matter which country it was. The prerequisite was that they had to provide him with weapons."]},{"number":4307,"title":"Chapter 4307: Shot","paragraphs":["Of course, he wouldn’t let the weapons-providing country suffer. He would work hard to maintain their cooperation and ultimately achieve mutual benefits.","Kulo Caesar was waiting for the new weapons to arrive three days later, but he didn’t know that he would never be able to guard them.","Outside, a massacre was going on. This time, the special forces soldiers of the Xueyu unit were like Gods of Death. They used the fastest and most brutal methods to deal with the personal soldiers protecting Kulo Caesar.","In the depths of the huge cargo ship, sticky blood flowed all over the ground and seeped into the cracks at the corners. The illegal militants who fell to the ground were all tall and strong. They were not comparable to the long-armed but weak illegal militants outside. These people were all Kulo Caesar’s personal soldiers. Now, they fell to the ground one after another with hideous expressions and looks of disbelief.","All the alarm bells were ineffective. The only exit was locked, and they couldn’t leave at all. They couldn’t even escape when they shouted for help. They didn’t even know how these soldiers entered the cabin.","\"Clear!\"","\"Clear!\"","\"Let’s go!\"","\"Alert!\"","\"Bring up the rear!\"","After entering the lounge, all the commands turned into hand signals. The assault team was the first to clear a bloody path.","Z7 stared at the screen and gritted his teeth.","If he hadn’t hacked into the surveillance cameras in advance, he wouldn’t have thought that the guy who provided information to the government had formed a backup plan for himself. He had betrayed Kulo Caesar, but he was afraid that the government forces wouldn’t have the ability to kill Kulo Caesar. Hence, he didn’t dare to tell the whole truth. Besides the hiding place, all the other information was fake!","\"To the right, four targets!\"","Adjusting the position of the probe, Z7 reported the targets he saw to the assault team one by one. As for the things he could not see, that was targeted through the individual combat system.","Xia Jinyuan and G3, who were bringing up the rear, dealt with two people with the help of the infrared laser. When they passed by a bend, Xia Jinyuan slit the neck of a guy holding an iron pipe from behind. The moment he fell, rapid breathing suddenly came from a dark corner opposite the bend...","At that moment, Xia Jinyuan realized something and glanced over coldly. At the same time, he quickly took out the pistol from his waist and was about to fire. G3 fired faster than Xia Jinyuan.","It was an illegal militant who had just come out of the toilet. He noticed something amiss and fired quickly.","Bang!","The sudden sound of a gun alarmed the entire cabin. Someone shouted, \"Why are there gunshots? What happened?!\"","Now, the soldiers were in the basement of the cabin. Through the infrared and thermal images, they could detect that there were about 50 illegal militants guarding this place. Previously, they had secretly dealt with more than half of them. In the end, they didn’t notice that one of them was coming out of the toilet and were discovered just like that. This turned the assassination into an open killing.","There were no cameras installed in the toilet, so Z7 didn’t notice the person in the toilet.","Xia Jinyuan’s arm was bleeding. He was hit by the guy who came out of the toilet. Fortunately, the other party had fired in a moment of desperation. If not, the bullet would have hit Xia Jinyuan’s head instead of just his arm. The urgent situation was resolved by G3.","G3’s pistol was equipped with a silencer, so there wasn’t much of a sound. However, the sound of the other party’s shot was so loud that the entire cabin heard it. Hence, the bloody battle began.","Fortunately, Z7 had turned off all the alarms and cameras. The heavy door that required four passwords to enter the basement of the ship was also closed. As long as there was no alarm inside, the illegal militants outside wouldn’t know that something had happened to the heavily protected basement of the ship."]},{"number":4308,"title":"Chapter 4308: Go Back Alive","paragraphs":["The gunshots alarmed the soldiers who had yet to be dealt with. The chaos had yet to start, but there was no way to continue the assassination.","The moment the special forces soldiers heard the gunshots, they knew that something was wrong. When they saw the alarmed targets, they didn’t panic. Instead, they gestured to each other. Then, K7 jumped and rolled toward the iron bilge board. He was already hiding in a corner.","He glanced up and stared at a wire.","He pointed up and made a horizontal gesture. Comrades X and Y nodded lightly. K7 destroyed the wire, and Comrades Y and X infiltrated a few meters forward at an extremely fast speed.","They didn’t stop and infiltrated a few meters forward. The special forces soldiers beside them also infiltrated a few meters. If they formed a straight line, everyone would split the straight line into several sections. There would be people guarding each section. They would wait for the enemy to come over and kill them one by one.","No one asked why there were suddenly gunshots. No one asked if anyone was injured because they didn’t have the time to ask these things!","If someone really got injured or died... they could only accept it!","This was an operation with a mortality rate. Their wills had already been written. If anyone didn’t come back, their will would be sent out.","Thump, thump, thump...","Countless footsteps sounded. K7, who was at the front, flicked his finger on his earpiece to tell his comrades to be ready for combat.","The illegal militants realized that the lights were off and slowed down. In the darkness, the soldiers could clearly hear the sound of bullets being loaded.","The gunshots had alerted the illegal militants, but they hadn’t realized that the bilge had been invaded.","After all, there had never been any outsiders here. Their leader once said that this place was safer than the president’s residence in Libya.","\"What’s happening in front? Sentinel, sentinel!\"","Someone shouted.","Right on the heels of that, someone replied, \"My pistol misfired.\" Xia Jinyuan, who was panting as he bandaged his arm to stop the bleeding, couldn’t help but laugh.","If the little fox was here, she would definitely say it more subtly.","His arm was hit by a pistol bullet. It didn’t pierce through his arm, and the bullet was still left in his muscles. Even if he raised his arm slightly, it was so painful that all his muscles would grow tense.","Perhaps because he thought of Ye Jian, Xia Jinyuan felt that even the pain he was feeling seemed to have lessened.","This was a bloody battle. There was even a chance of death. Even as the captain, he didn’t know if he could leave alive.","Kulo Caesar was the leader of the illegal militants in Libya. He was not a big figure, but he was definitely not a small figure either. There was a big shot above him. That fellow was the real leader.","The Libyan government had been wanting to kill the two of them for more than ten years, but they didn’t have the ability or the chance to.","They had thought about it for more than ten years. It was time for them to succeed today. They had to succeed.","\"How is it? Can you still withstand it?\"","G3, who was approaching, asked in a low voice. There was a strong smell of blood on his body. It was the blood of his and his enemies. His painted face was even more bloodstained. Even his eyebrows were sticky with blood. They were hard, like they had been drawn by the clumsiest makeup artist.","Xia Jinyuan gritted his teeth as he completed the last step. His gaze was cold as he smiled and said, \"I can last until we leave alive. Have you cleared everything?\"","\"We’ll definitely make it out alive. There aren’t many left!\"","G3 smiled coldly.","The air here was getting worse. The sticky smell of blood filled every corner. The battle had already started. The illegal militants who had entered the special forces’ ambush circle finally realized that they had been invaded."]},{"number":4309,"title":"Chapter 4309: Trapped","paragraphs":["Violent roars filled the entire bilge. The illegal militants discovered that a group of people had infiltrated and killed their compatriots in the bilge and started fighting back.","Someone tried to shoot, but no one gave him a chance. The dim lights were extinguished. The illegal militants lost their direction and were killed silently.","\"Don’t give them too many chances to shoot.\"","The ’king’ of the Xueyu unit gave his order. He didn’t like to fight head-on, nor did he like to see his comrades sacrificing themselves for a battle. He didn’t like this kind of stupid combat at all.","He preferred to conserve his strength and complete his mission in the shortest time possible.","He would hide and secretly watch his surroundings. Then, he would secretly reach out his hand and kill one target after another without making any sound. He would eliminate those potential dangers as soon as possible and complete the mission at the first instant.","Even though they had been discovered, they didn’t have to be in a hurry to show their faces. The enemy was in the open while they were in the dark. They had the advantage. They could use it well to quietly kill those targets that came out like headless flies.","\"Mmm...\"","Someone was struggling in pain in the darkness. He wanted to break free and take a deep breath. With a crack, the sound of a neck being broken could be heard. The head of the person who wanted to break free fell to the ground in a strange posture.","His face, back, and hips were facing up. The back of his head and his chest were facing down. Clearly, someone had twisted his head in a direction.","The Xueyu unit completed the last round of assassination. Then, they took out their pistols and started the first round of direct shooting.","Bang! Bang! Bang! The muffled sound of guns could be heard. Before the illegal militants could shoot, they were either hit in the head or in the chest. They rushed out at the fastest speed and were killed by the special forces of the Xueyu unit.","Z7 became very busy. He adjusted the footage of the cameras in the basement of the cabin so that they would be displayed on the big monitor. Through the people coming and going on the small screens, he quickly reported to his comrades where the targets were. He also told them where the targets were hiding so that his comrades could react quickly and clear them.","Z7 saw that the figures walking on the screen soon turned into his comrades. At that moment, he saw the sudden appearance of three foreign figures. Z7 instantly realized something.","He said to K7, who had not shown his face, \"Comrade, it’s time for you to take action! Walk three meters and turn right!\"","K7 didn’t say anything. He only used his actions to tell Z7 that he knew. Z7’s voice in the earpiece wasn’t as cold as before. \"Follow them. We can find the target.\"","\"X, Y, cover K7!\"","Xia Jinyuan’s cold and bloodthirsty voice entered the ears of all his comrades. He bandaged his arm casually and joined the battle to start the most bloody clearing.","The basement of the cabin was the lowest level of the cargo ship. It was also Kulo Caesar’s personal activity area at night. Without his orders, no one was allowed to approach.","Now, the basement, which had its power supply completely destroyed, had become an isolated world. The illegal militants above didn’t know what was going on below, and the illegal militants below couldn’t call for help. They were like turtles in a jar, getting killed one by one.","Gunshots were already heard. The special forces soldiers took the last chance to assassinate and killed eight more people. There was no way to assassinate again. They could only use their guns to shoot the targets they found.","There were not many. There were about seven to eight people left, including the three who had retreated to report to Kulo Caesar."]},{"number":4310,"title":"Chapter 4310: Crucial","paragraphs":["Kulo Caesar opened a large-caliber Eagle Production rifle placed at the foot of his desk. He walked to the door. At the same time, he leaned close to the door and listened to the commotion outside.","There were gunshots outside, but it was short-lived. After a few shots, silence was restored. However, even though there were only a few gunshots, it was enough to make Kulo Caesar’s heart sink.","How could there be gunshots here?","Without any hesitation, Kulo Caesar immediately locked the round steel cabin door from the inside. Then, he walked to the cabinet in the dark, opened the door, and quickly changed his clothes.","This was a set of diving equipment. It was fully equipped. It was enough for Kulo Caesar to jump into the sea and escape.","Outside, the three illegal militants knocked on the cabin door anxiously and shouted. Although Kulo Caesar couldn’t hear what his subordinates said, the knocking sounds made his face darken.","Idiots!","Were they trying to let those people who had infiltrated the bilge and were obviously here to kill him know where he was?!","Damn these stupid men!","Kulo Caesar, who had a gloomy expression on his face, only cursed in his heart. His hands didn’t stop moving. In less than three minutes, he put on his diving suit. Then, he wore an oxygen mask and carried an oxygen tank on his back. He held his flippers in his hand and rushed to the right side of the cabin skillfully.","There was a door there. When he opened the door and went out, he saw the dense integrated pipes. There were sewer pipes, cable pipes, communication pipes, and so on. This was the lowest level of the entire cargo hold. If he walked further, he would be able to enter the sea and leave.","King’s Water was poured onto the round cabin door. No matter how invulnerable the closed cabin door was, a hole started to appear bit by bit under the high corrosion of King’s Water. It corroded the lock.","K7 kicked the cabin door open. Through his night-vision goggles, he saw that the cabin was empty. There was only a pile of clothes scattered beside a cabinet in the corner.","X rushed up and picked up the clothes. \"His clothes are still warm. He escaped not more than three minutes ago!\"","\"Here!\" Y discovered a small door that was closed. It was very short, and one needed to bend over to pass through. His face was tense as he pulled it. The door was locked from the outside.","\"It’s the entrance to the drainage and pipeline. He wants to escape through the drainage entrance. He took off his clothes, which means he has changed into diving clothes!\"","As Y spoke, he used King’s Water again. At this moment, King’s Water was more useful than bullets. Bullets wouldn’t be able to penetrate the cabin door made of thick steel in a short moment, but King’s Water, which was highly corrosive, could.","\"Q King, Kulo Caesar is planning to escape through the drainage outlet!\"","K7 reported the news. Right on the heels of that, the sound of running came from outside. The comrades who had cleared the targets outside rushed over.","It was already the last crucial moment. How could they let him escape?","\"E6, the target is preparing to escape through the drainage outlet. Go over and kill him! Z7, continue to block wirelessly!\" Xia Jinyuan’s expression was so cold that it was as if there was a layer of thick ice on his face. He adjusted his deployment. Next, all of them would leave through the drainage outlet. Hence, the plan to retreat was canceled.","\"Roger!\"","E6, who was at the high ground, put away his heavy sniper rifle. He ran briskly with a heavy sniper rifle weighing more than ten kilograms on his back. He made it look like the sniper rifle weighed more than ten kilograms.","The small door was successfully opened. The three special forces soldiers rushed in first. Then, their comrades behind followed one after another. The two comrades in charge of guarding the back left last."]},{"number":4311,"title":"Chapter 4311: Explosion","paragraphs":["The sound was not loud, but it was extremely clear. It was... the sound of someone running!","The voice refreshed everyone.","\"Split into three groups and charge!\"","Xia Jinyuan waved his hand. The 13 members quickly split into three groups. As the captain, he rushed to the front. Although there was a bullet embedded in his arm, he was still very fast.","Blood had already dyed the white bandage red. Xia Jinyuan didn’t have the time to care about it. He only had one goal now—to kill Kulo Caesar!","Kulo Caesar heard footsteps chasing after him. This cunning illegal militant didn’t panic because of this. In the darkness, there was even a cold smile on his face.","The sound of two grenades being thrown was heard. Xia Jinyuan, who was at the front, shouted, \"Grenades, dodge!\"","As soon as he finished speaking, the explosion swept over with a fireball, shaking the basement of the entire cargo ship.","The power of the fireball was like fire from the depths of hell. It surged over with a power that could easily destroy lives. The shrapnel splattered in all directions. Some embedded in the pipes, some scattered in every corner, and some were swept in front of the special forces soldiers.","The sharp shrapnel slashed across the back of their hands, leaving scratches.","This was the lightest injury one could get after a grenade exploded. This was just a minor wound.","The cargo ship was too heavy. The threat of two grenades was not enough to shake it, but the power of the sound was still impactful. The illegal militants seemed to hear the sound of drums coming from below. It was very muffled...","This sound was enough to alarm the patrolling people. They immediately reported the news, and right on the heels of that, the illegal militants started moving.","The special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit dodged to the side. The smoke hadn’t dissipated. Xia Jinyuan, whose ear was scratched by shrapnel, had already gotten up. He listened to the footsteps in front and gritted his teeth.","\"Let’s go!\"","G3 shouted in a low voice and chased after Xia Jinyuan with his gun.","Kulo Caesar, who was getting closer and closer to the drainage outlet, heard footsteps again. Not far behind him, the soldiers were chasing him at a speed that made his heart sink.","\"Bastards!\" he cursed, but he didn’t stop. He didn’t throw any more grenades.","He was all out of grenades. He only managed to find them at the last minute when he rushed out. Now, he only had a pistol on him. He didn’t even have a high-caliber rifle with him as he was afraid that it would affect his speed of escape.","Now, he realized that he had made a huge mistake when he escaped. He shouldn’t have only thought about escaping. In an emergency, he could use a rifle to counter-attack.","He didn’t even have the chance to make up for his mistake. He could only rush forward.","He even threw the oxygen tank to the side, causing it to keep clanging on the ground. Without the weighted oxygen tank, Kulo Caesar ran much faster.","Xia Jinyuan, who was chasing after him, had already seen his figure. Xia Jinyuan put away his pistol and quickly changed it to a rifle. Through the laser aiming device, a red dot landed on Kulo Caesar’s back.","Bang!","The 7.2mm bullet of the 95 rifle hit the figure. The fleeing figure staggered and fell.","The drainage outlet that could allow Kulo Caesar to escape... was so close that he could even hear the sound of the waves and the heavy rain outside."]},{"number":4312,"title":"Chapter 4312: Boundless","paragraphs":["At the same time, the illegal militants realized that the walkie-talkies in their hands were useless. They tried to contact the people below, but the walkie-talkies were quiet. There was no sound of radio waves.","Something had happened. Something must have happened below!","They all knew that something was happening below, but they couldn’t go down. The hatch that required a password to enter blocked their path. They knew that something was happening below, but they couldn’t do anything.","Z7 kept all his equipment and quickly approached his comrades. He retreated from the drainage outlet and left from the end of the port. He avoided Kulo Caesar’s important guards until he left the port.","The waves were huge. Xia Jinyuan’s injured arm was stimulated by the seawater. He couldn’t help but purse his thin lips. How could it not hurt when salt was sprinkled on his wound?","The pain lasted for only a moment. Operation Sandstorm was completed perfectly. No comrades died.","The endless darkness swallowed more than ten figures. The interweaving wind and rain covered the applause between them. There were trails of footprints on the beach. The footprints disappeared without a trace when the waves washed over.","Kulo Caesar, one of the leaders of the illegal organization that the Libyan government forces had been trying to capture for more than ten years, was lying less than a meter away from the drainage outlet. Drop by drop, his blood dripped into the surging sea current.","In the abandoned ship, the hatch that was protected by a password lock was shot by bullets, leaving behind countless pits and dense bullets. The cabin was still closed, and there was no way to break the hatch door.","The illegal militants outside had already searched everywhere. They ran in the rain chasing each other. When the power supply was destroyed, they used flashlights to illuminate their surroundings. In the end, other than discovering that countless of their compatriots had been killed, they didn’t find anything else.","They raised their heads and looked at the surface of the sea and the surroundings of the port. It was pitch-black everywhere. Besides the sound of the wind, rain, and waves, they couldn’t even hear the roars of their own people.","After an unknown period of time, the backup power supply that was destroyed was finally repaired. The technicians in the abandoned ship who were hired by Kulo Caesar were finally able to restart the computer. However, they realized that the surveillance data in the bilge had been destroyed. They couldn’t find out what had happened in the bilge through the database.","Then, they looked at their firewall. They knew that the firewall had been breached. Before the other party left, they erased all traces, making it impossible for them to capture the data. They wanted to chase after the person who hacked into the database but couldn’t.","At 11:00 pm local time in Libya, the technicians who used more than two hours to decipher the four passwords finally succeeded. The moment the cabin door was opened, the thick smell of blood assaulted their faces. Inside, blood was flowing like a river. Countless illegal militants had fallen to the ground as if they had been killed by sea monsters. No one survived.","It was already 11.30 pm in Libya when they found Kulo Caesar. All the illegal militants under him were infuriated. Kulo Caesar’s brother, another leader of the illegal militants, learned that his brother was dead and started plotting to start a new war against the government forces.","At this moment, the bullet in Xia Jinyuan’s arm was finally taken out. The bullet that was stained with blood fell to the ground, leaving some bloodstains. Xia Jinyuan kicked the bullet into a dark corner.","\"You’re lucky you have strong muscles. You didn’t hurt your nerves.\"","K7, who was the one who picked out the bullet, spoke calmly. Facing the wound, he didn’t even raise his eyebrows. From the debridement to the suture, everything was done in one go."]},{"number":4313,"title":"Chapter 4313: She’s Here Too","paragraphs":["They had already left the port. They walked in the rain for nearly two hours before they found a shelter to treat their injuries.","This time, the only one who got hit was Xia Jinyuan. Other than that, the others only got a few abrasions. They directly disinfected their wounds and didn’t even waste the bandages they had.","Z7 walked over and said in a low voice, \"The boss is looking for you.\"","The voice of their boss, Major General Yang, came from the earpiece. It was a private call, so not all the special forces soldiers heard him.","\"There’s an accident in a mine that produces important materials for China. 12 Chinese workers and 64 Libyan local workers are being subdued by illegal militants. A team of comrades you’re familiar with has already rushed to rescue them.\"","The 76 hostages needed to be rescued. Xia Jinyuan asked with a cold gaze, \"Are there any hostage casualties?\"","\"We haven’t received any information for the time being. The other party has blocked all communication in the mine. Even if there is...\" Major General Yang sighed softly and left the words unsaid. He changed the topic. \"There are many hostages. The soldiers who returned to the camp to report said that there are many illegal armed men, and they’re carrying good weapons. To be safe, you have to go over and provide support.\"","Major General Yang knew that Kulo Caesar had been successfully killed. At the same time, he understood the situation of the special forces soldiers on the mission in detail. A desert operation with a mortality rate of zero. When Major General Yang, who was waiting for news in the country, heard this, his heart surged.","Good job!","What great Chinese men!","Major General Yang gave another order. He considered the situation of all the soldiers below him. If possible, he wanted the soldiers he was proud of to have a good rest. However, he could only keep that thought in mind.","Xia Jinyuan glanced at his bandaged wound and replied, \"We can do another job. I wonder which company it is? Can you contact them?\"","Major General Yang replied, \"The Storm Commando Brigade. They’re your acquaintances who trained together.\"","The young officer’s voice was full of energy. It was a little arrogant and cold. It was mostly because of his confidence as a soldier. It made people feel at ease.","Xia Jinyuan, who was leaning against the wall, was in high spirits. He mouthed to his comrades who were looking at him, \"There’s a new job.\" His expression was cold as he replied, \"It’s been a long time since I’ve worked with them. We’ll take action immediately!\"","Major General Yang reported the coordinates of the mine. Xia Jinyuan repeated them to Z7. Then, there was the sound of Z7 typing on the keyboard. He now knew the exact location of the mine. He stared at Xia Jinyuan who was carrying a military laptop and narrowed his eyes.","He asked, \"Other than the hostage rescue, are there any other instructions?\"","What was the value of a mine far away in the depths of the rainforest to make illegal militants go there? Moreover, they had blocked all news from the mine.","\"Blow up the mine, including the equipment that wasn’t transferred in time.\"","\"Roger!\"","Xia Jinyuan thought that the call would end just like that. Unexpectedly, Major General Yang suddenly dropped a bombshell. Xia Jinyuan wondered if he heard wrongly.","\"Azure Bird? You mean Azure Bird... is with Demon King Li now? She’s on a mission with the water ghosts?\"","Not long ago, he was still thinking about the little fox. He was told that the woman he was thinking about was also in Libya and was on a mission with the Storm Commando Brigade’s water ghosts.","This news made Xia Jinyuan, who had always been calm, lose his composure.","What were they waiting for?","They needed to hurry up and leave!","The woman who should be studying in the country actually came out to carry out a mission again and was even fighting alongside the water ghosts who wanted to poach her away. ’Brothers from the navy, what’s wrong with you? Why did you look for Azure Bird from the army?’"]},{"number":4314,"title":"Chapter 4314: Weak And Incompetent","paragraphs":["T6’s eyes widened. He had a look of disbelief on his face.","How was that possible?","Azure Bird!","That was Azure Bird!","Azure Bird of the army!","Azure Bird from the Xueyu unit!","How could she be fighting alongside a group of navy soldiers in blue and white camouflage uniforms? How was that possible?","They were not the same kind of soldier!","\"How is that possible? Could it be that Azure Bird was really snatched away by the navy?\" V8, who also didn’t believe it and felt incredulous, directly expressed his worry.","Someone immediately slapped his head. V8 was wearing a helmet, so it didn’t hurt. However, he fell forward. Their captain said, \"Is Azure Bird the kind of soldier who’s so easily snatched?\"","...","Of course not!","Xia Jinyuan’s words calmed the soldiers down. G3 said in a low voice, \"There are 12 Chinese workers and 64 Libyan workers. Did Boss say what arrangements the Libyan government has?\"","This was what G3 was concerned about. As for whether Azure Bird had been poached away by the navy, the captain said that Azure Bird wasn’t the kind of female soldier who was easily poached off. Everyone was relieved when they heard that.","Xia Jinyuan, who was putting on his combat uniform again, said calmly, \"Boss didn’t say anything. It can be seen that the Libyan government doesn’t have any arrangements.","\"Now that the situation is getting out of control again, the government forces won’t specially send soldiers to rescue the 64 Libyan workers. Boss knows this clearly, and that’s why he asked us to provide support.","\"We can save as many Libyan workers as we can, but we have to save all the Chinese workers.\"","This was war. As soldiers, they were not God or the Virgin Mary. They would save the Libyan workers, but the safety of the Chinese workers came first!","It was cruel and heartless, but this was reality. There were no emotions on the battlefield. Sometimes, there was no humanity either.","The strong preyed on the weak. If someone were to be blamed, they could only say that Libya was too weak and incompetent.","Major General Yang didn’t emphasize the words ’rescue the Libyan workers’. He only told Xia Jinyuan how many Libyan workers there were and provided the data. As for how the Xueyu unit would judge the situation, he believed that the king of the Xueyu unit would come up with his own decision.","After giving the order, all combat power was handed over to Xia Jinyuan, who was in charge of combat. Even as his superior, Major General Yang didn’t have the right to interfere.","Xia Jinyuan’s words made the young special forces soldiers fall into a short silence. They tightened their grip on their guns as if they were secretly venting some emotions.","64 hostages... The Libyan government forces weren’t taking any rescue measures. As soldiers, they deeply felt the sorrow.","A weak and incompetent country! This was how weak and incompetent a country was!","China was the same in the past.","Today, China had slowly stood up. Though they were once a weak country, they had strengthened themselves bit by bit!","The rain was still falling. The tireless special forces soldiers of the Xueyu unit were led by Captain Xia Jinyuan as they embarked on their journey again.","This was a declaration of war against the evil forces. It told those people with evil intentions that China was no longer the country that had to be careful even when they were having a ’war of words’. They were not afraid of offending powerful countries. China would use their actions to tell the illegal militants and the forces supporting them that China had risen."]},{"number":4315,"title":"Chapter 4315: Helpless","paragraphs":["The rain washed the city that had been ravaged by the flames of war. In the dark, women were hugging their children and the old were guarding their dilapidated houses. From time to time, they would wake up from their dreams with fear. After a long time, they would close their eyes again.","In a war-torn country, it was a luxury for civilians to be able to sleep.","Tonight was destined to be a restless night. The Libyan government was already extremely busy. As for the 64 mine workers who had been kidnapped by illegal militants, the Libyan government expressed that they were helpless in the face of the current situation.","The workers of the mine were being subdued by illegal militants. The Chinese had sent their own soldiers to rescue them. The Libyan government had yet to make any moves.","China had been communicating with the Libyan government. They hoped that the Libyan government could help the ’peacekeeping’ soldiers that China had sent for the rescue mission. They could only be considered ’peacekeeping’ soldiers. They couldn’t be said to be other soldiers sent by China. After several rounds of communication, the Libyan government’s reply was still that they were helpless.","They really wanted to send soldiers to rescue the Libyan workers, but they really didn’t have any extra soldiers to specially rescue the 64 Libyan workers who didn’t listen to their arrangements.","Resignedly, Libya told China clearly, \"Our soldiers will do our best to protect the civilians of Libya. They need to protect Yeni, the town of Covil, the capital of Libya, and the civilians of Libya in all states. We can only choose to give up on the civilians who disobeyed the arrangements.\"","Yes, Libya clearly told the Chinese that they had given up on the 64 workers.","Major General Yang could hear the sorrow of the Libyan government official.","He wanted to protect the citizens of Libya, but reality forced him to make the most resigned and painful choice.","There was nothing he could do. He was... really helpless.","After many failed attempts, Major General Yang finally hung up the phone. The green blood vessels on the back of his hand were protruding.","He spoke to the navy commander-in-chief and told him about the Libyan government’s decision. Then, he heard the sound of the folder being thrown out.","\"It’s fine if they won’t rescue the workers, but they can’t even provide transportation. They’re placing all their hope on our country’s soldiers! Old Yang, those are soldiers that we carefully nurtured! I... I haven’t slept until now. I’m afraid that something will happen to them!\"","Ever since the water ghosts of the Storm Commando Brigade went overseas for a mission, the navy commander-in-chief had never closed his eyes. No matter how tired he was, he would only sleep for a while before waking up immediately. The soldiers sent out were all elites who had been polished for years. Moreover, they were the first batch of marine frogmen special forces soldiers in the navy. All of them carried the hope of the country. The country was hoping that after they came back, they could nurture future generations of marine special forces for the navy.","Even if something happened to one of them, the navy’s commander-in-chief would feel a great loss.","Major General Yang could understand the commander-in-chief’s feelings very well. He felt the same way too.","He sighed and said, \"Old Dong, calm down. There’s indeed nothing they can do. As for us, we’ll definitely save all the Chinese workers and then save the Libyan workers. We’ll save them if we can.","\"Contact your soldiers and tell them that a company that once fought with them has already rushed over. If they join forces, they’ll definitely be able to kill all those bastards!\""]},{"number":4316,"title":"Chapter 4316: Mysterious And Powerful","paragraphs":["Did the army also send their soldiers? Would they join forces with the Storm Commando Brigade in combat?","The angry navy commander-in-chief immediately said in a low voice, \"Okay, I’ll contact them immediately. Old Yang, we have to let them contact each other. They can’t act alone.\"","\"Yes, that’s what I’m thinking. Next, we’ll wait for the news from the frontline.\"","It was not easy to get the special forces soldiers of different military units to contact each other through different radio electronics systems. It took nearly 20 minutes for the navy’s commander-in-chief to contact Li Jinnian. The first thing he said was, \"There’s an army unit that you’re familiar with. You guys have even fought together before. They’re heading to the mine.\"","Li Jinnian was drenched with not a single spot on his body that was dry. When he heard the news, a familiar face flashed past his mind. His future brother-in-law... Xia Jinyuan.","His military unit was the only one that had fought together with the Storm Commando Brigade.","Then, the commander-in-chief of the navy said that they should save the Libyan workers. It was still the same thing. If they could save the Libyan workers, they would. If they really couldn’t, they should give up. They shouldn’t force themselves.","\"Demon King Li, you’re a Chinese soldier. The country didn’t groom you to die. Remember your mission and position your responsibility. I don’t want to see anyone missing from your team. Do you understand?\"","The commander’s dignified and extremely cold voice entered Li Jinnian’s ears. Li Jinnian replied calmly, \"Understood!\"","His forceful voice made the navy commander feel at ease.","The soldiers he groomed were good. They never disappointed him. He didn’t need to say a lot of words for them to understand.","From the start, Li Jinnian didn’t expect to rescue all 64 Libyan workers. With more people, there would be more opportunities to be exposed. He would give up when necessary.","Even if they could work with Xia Jinyuan’s team now, he had never thought of rescuing all the Libyan workers. However, he would do his best to provide an opportunity for the Libyan workers to leave.","If the situation allowed them to kill all the illegal militants in the mine, everyone would be happy.","It had been a long time since the peacekeeping soldiers hid the truck. The truck was still at the same spot and hadn’t been stolen. It was just waiting for them to go over.","The truck was still there. The comrades contacted the rescue team together. The two pieces of good news made a faint smile appear in Li Jinnian’s cold eyes. He told his comrades the good news about joining forces with their brother company. Upon hearing the news, even the rain couldn’t hide the joy of the water ghosts.","Brother company. Hahaha, they knew which brother company it was. It was that... F*ck, they still didn’t know the number of their military unit. It was a mysterious and powerful brother company.","The water ghosts were happy purely because of the arrival of the company. This way, they were more confident that they could complete the mission.","Lieutenant Colonel Zhu sent news that two more batches of illegal militants were heading to the mine. At the same time, at least 20 foreign faces appeared. They were wearing mixed military uniforms and were suspected to be... mercenaries.","Those who could become mercenaries were mostly retired soldiers who had survived the battlefield. They were all ruthless and had powerful tactics. With the addition of mercenaries, it would undoubtedly be even more troublesome. The water ghosts of the Storm Commando Brigade knew that this bone was getting harder and harder to chew. If they didn’t do a good job, they might lose their lives.","Everyone knew this, but no one retreated and continued marching.","Now that the brother company was here, and it was the brother company that they admired so much, there was nothing to be afraid of!","No matter how difficult this bone was, they would chew it to dust!"]},{"number":4317,"title":"Chapter 4317: Bullying","paragraphs":["The water ghosts were happy, and so was Ye Jian. She was also shocked.","After so many twists and turns, she would actually fight alongside Captain Xia again.","They were reunited on a battlefield in a foreign country. As expected, her relationship with Captain Xia was so different.","How many couples would be like them?","They reunited on the battlefield of a foreign country.","Her face was a little pale from the rain, but there was a bright smile on her wrinkled face. She was looking forward to meeting Captain Xia now.","Both sides entered a mutual wireless communication system. They both knew each other’s wireless codes. They only needed to rebuild a set of data, write the communication codes of both sides, and establish a connection. Finally, they would be able to communicate successfully after completing the bridge.","Within 15 minutes, the voices of the comrades from the brother company came from their earpieces.","It wasn’t just the water ghosts of the Storm Commando Brigade who were happy. The special forces of the Xueyu unit were also happy.","There was a fierce battle waiting for them in front, but it didn’t affect the joy between the special forces soldiers of the two different services.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t talk to Ye Jian immediately. As the captain, he had to talk to Li Jinnian alone first. The two of them needed to brief each other.","The two captains were having a serious conversation alone. Their comrades had already said a bunch of things on the public channel. Ye Jian listened and didn’t say anything immediately. When T6 from the Xueyu unit said, \"Azure Bird, are you afraid to say anything because you know that you’ve let us down? Or do you think we don’t know that you’re with the navy company now?","\"You’re from the army. How could you go to the navy? Are you abandoning our brothers from the army?\"","The topic was Ye Jian. As the only female soldier in the two teams, there were always many things to talk about her.","Ye Jian pursed her lips and smiled. Before she could speak, the water ghosts had already spoken for her.","\"Yes, yes. Azure Bird already has the thought of abandoning you. We’ll work harder and have her completely leave the army and become our comrade!\"","\"All of you, be mentally prepared. Azure Bird will be one of us soon.\"","\"Azure Bird, don’t talk to them. They’ll just bully you.\"","The water ghosts of the Storm Commando Brigade all wanted Ye Jian to come to their unit. However, poaching off a soldier would ruin their reputation, so they kept it to themselves.","Now, the words that they had been holding back were exposed by the comrades from their brother company. It was a godsend opportunity for them to say it openly!","Poor T6 was knocked on the head and kicked in the calf. He was ’bullied’.","Why was he so bad with words?","If he didn’t know how to speak, he should just shut up!","He mentioned the things that the water ghosts had been stopping themselves from mentioning. He deserved to get a beating!","T6, who knew that he had committed an unforgivable crime, quickly made up for it. He smiled and chuckled. \"It’s not up to you guys. Azure Bird gets to make the final call. Azure Bird, remember that you’re an army soldier! Thank you.\"","Ye Jian, who was called out, said, \"Long time no see, comrades.\"","It had been a long time since they last met. Her most recent cooperation with the Xueyu unit felt like it took place ages ago.","After Xia Jinyuan ended his call with Li Jinnian, he entered the public channel again. It was extremely lively. From time to time, he would hear his woman’s soft laughter."]},{"number":4318,"title":"Chapter 4318: Love On The Battlefield","paragraphs":["Hearing Ye Jian’s laughter, Xia Jinyuan didn’t speak immediately. Instead, he listened quietly. He had already drawn her face in his mind. She seemed to be smiling quietly while standing in front of him. He had already caressed her face a thousand times in his heart.","They hadn’t been apart for long, and they didn’t expect to meet so soon. Moreover, they were reunited on the battlefield.","With her by his side, the tiredness he felt from the overnight combat and the rainy night seemed to have been cleared. He only hoped that he could see her faster.","His woman was still able to laugh. Her mental fortitude was good.","Just now, he had a short conversation with Demon King Li. They both had a rough idea of this rescue mission. Demon King Li even told him that he was prepared to sacrifice himself on this trip. Hiring illegal militants and using hostages to cover their retreat was dangerous stuff. He thought it would be hard to avoid casualties.","As for his woman, she could be said to be the soldier with the most experience in overseas combat among the 15 of them. She had to be very clear about the situation. However, in front of the possibility of sacrifice, she still smiled like a gentle spring breeze without any gloominess.","His woman was already a veteran.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t say anything more, and Li Jinnian kept quiet too. As a result, the comrades thought that they were still communicating. Ye Jian thought so too. It wasn’t until Li Jinnian spoke that she realized that the two of them had been eavesdropping on the public channel for a long time.","\"Q King, after eavesdropping for so long, it’s time to bring your soldiers along.\"","As soon as his cousin-in-law spoke, Xia Jinyuan held his forehead.","Alas, although his identity as Li Jinnian’s cousin-in-law had been recognized, Li Jinnian was still difficult to deal with. He was still dragging Xia Jinyuan down happily.","Hearing that, Ye Jian immediately stopped laughing. For some reason, her cheeks, which had turned pale from the rain, turned slightly pink. She seemed to be looking forward to something. There was a sweet shyness in her eyes.","In the eyes of her comrades, she was a strong female soldier who was outstanding in everything. However, in the eyes of the man she loved deeply, she was still the woman who needed his protection.","The two of them were standing in the same country. They were less than 50 kilometers apart, but their hearts had already closed in when they knew that the other party was here. Even if the two of them didn’t take the initiative to greet each other, they knew what they were thinking.","When Xia Jinyuan heard her laughter, he knew that his woman was shy again.","In front of the many comrades who were fighting side by side, he was not her boyfriend. He was the leader of his team.","Xia Jinyuan cleared his throat and said with a faint smile, \"We’ve been talking for so long. Shouldn’t we set off? Whether you guys can snatch Azure Bird or not will depend on you. But know that I can’t bear to let Azure Bird leave our team.\"","The last two sentences had a deeper meaning. His comrades, such as T6 and G3, were probably laughing.","Their captain was so eloquent and dignified. With his EQ, it was no wonder he could win Azure Bird’s heart. His EQ was really high!","At that moment, the comrades who knew about their relationship felt an inexplicable sweetness in their hearts. It was as if they were in a relationship themselves and had exchanged sweet words. It was so sweet that it made their hearts feel at peace.","It wasn’t that these soldiers couldn’t love or didn’t want to love. It was just that the love they were waiting for wasn’t the sweetness that most couples in the world shared. Besides sweetness, their love would also contain bloodbath. This was enough to make them hesitate and not dare to take a step forward, afraid that they would let down their loved ones."]},{"number":4319,"title":"Chapter 4319: Focus On Following","paragraphs":["It wasn’t that they couldn’t love or didn’t want to love. They weren’t afraid of dying, but they were afraid of love. They yearned to be loved,but they were also afraid of being loved. They were afraid that it would be a dream.","They had become cowards who were afraid of encountering love. The bachelors in the team were all the same.","However, Q King and Azure Bird’s love made them see a different kind of sweetness. It made them, who had become cowards, dare to love again.","Even if there was a storm of blood along the way, Xia Jinyuan would feel happy if Ye Jian was by his side.","Listening to Xia Jinyuan’s sweet words, V8, Z7, and the other comrades smiled.","The comrades who didn’t know about their relationship, such as X and Y, as well as the water ghosts in the Storm Commando Brigade, all thought that he was worried that Azure Bird would join the Storm Commando Brigade. Immediately, a special forces soldier from the Xueyu unit patted his chest and said, \"Captain, we promise to complete the mission. We promise that Azure Bird won’t join our brother company and will follow you wholeheartedly!\"","Xia Jinyuan liked hearing those words very much!","The water ghosts didn’t like them, though. The channel was filled with the sounds of them clicking their tongues to express their dissatisfaction.","\"Whether Azure Bird can follow me wholeheartedly will depend on you guys, my comrades!\"","Li Jinnian turned off the microphone as he listened to that guy’s arrogant voice. He said to Ye Jian, \"If I beat him up one day, don’t feel sorry for him. He deserves a beating.\"","He flirted with her in front of Li Jinnian, her cousin. Heh, if Xia Jinyuan wasn’t asking for a beating, what was he doing?","Ye Jian’s face was red, and her complexion had improved. She turned off the microphone and replied, \"Fight, then. I won’t see it happen as long as I’m in school.\"","It was obvious that she was protecting Xia Jinyuan.","As her cousin, Li Jinnian’s heart ached. She was so protective of Xia Jinyuan... Li Jinnian’s heart ached.","In the future, even if he wanted to beat Xia Jinyuan up, he couldn’t reveal anything to his cousin so that he wouldn’t feel sad seeing his cousin side with Xia Jinyuan.","After saying those flirtatious words, Xia Jinyuan stopped. His girlfriend was shy, and his girlfriend’s cousin was fierce and narrow-minded. In order not to dig a hole for himself, he had to stop here.","\"Alright, brothers, you’ve said your piece and laughed. The time to relax has passed. Now, let’s gather our minds and talk about how to meet up as soon as possible. We have to rely on our legs to hurry. We have to think of a way to get a vehicle.\"","When they talked about the mission, the public channel, which was filled with laughter a second ago, instantly quietened down. Ye Jian put away her thoughts. Her facial expression turned exceptionally cold. Her picturesque eyes were filled with killing intent.","\"I just looked at the distance. If we find the truck, we can approach the periphery of the mine in half an hour. If we don’t have the truck, it’ll take us about three hours to reach even if we run all the way.\"","\"It’s too long. It’s not advisable to go by foot! If we want to meet up as soon as possible, we need to get the truck. We’ll settle the matter ourselves. Demon King Li, go over and scout the surroundings. See if you can find a few people and spread the news.","\"Don’t be in a hurry to move after we infiltrate. Find a breakthrough point and we’ll cooperate from the inside and kill them.\"","Now, there were two operational teams. With enough manpower, they could deploy more boldly. Li Jinnian said, \"Two peacekeeping soldiers have already infiltrated the mine. The other party has wirelessly blocked the entire mine. They can’t send any effective news in time.","\"We’ll go over and gather with the peacekeeping soldiers from the two troops before infiltrating the mine. If the situation is different and the situation changes, we’ll take action in advance. You’ll be in charge of backup and completing the hostage escort."]},{"number":4320,"title":"Chapter 4320: Where Is She","paragraphs":["It meant that the water ghosts of the Storm Commando Brigade would charge first. If the situation was out of control and the other party had strong firepower, the members of the Xueyu unit would know that they would be courting death if they went to reinforce the water ghosts. There was no need to come and reinforce them anymore. They should retreat quickly to prevent any more sacrifices.","Hearing this, Xia Jinyuan said in a low voice, \"Brothers, wait for us! When the situation is stable, move in a roundabout manner. Hide well and don’t expose yourselves. If you do, kill them with one strike!","\"All of us will be fine. We have to go back alive! We didn’t come here to sacrifice ourselves. This bone might be hard to chew, but we’ll turn it to dust all the same!\"","Xia Jinyuan was a natural battlefield commander. Many times, he wouldn’t choose to fight head-on. He would never choose to risk everything just for the sake of passion. He would fight his way out with all his might.","The reason why he liked to assassinate and destroy the enemy without batting an eyelid was because he would’ve already controlled the situation in advance and understood the other party’s layout. He liked to bring his comrades to play dirty. He would be as ruthless as he wanted.","Hence, he wouldn’t allow the situation that Demon King Li mentioned to happen. Since he was going to reinforce them, his comrades had to return to the country alive!","\"Wait for us, brothers. Since we came here alive, we must go back alive together. No one must be missing!\"","This was a promise made by Xia Jinyuan. Ye Jian knew that the man she loved deeply meant what he said!","The rain hit the leaves and made a rustling sound. Lightning flashed at the end of the horizon, temporarily illuminating the dark rain clouds. The truck’s headlights weren’t turned on. It jolted, and the wheels rolled over the muddy road. Mud splattered everywhere. It drove toward the pitch-black front like the mouth of a giant beast.","Ye Jian, who was sitting in the front passenger seat, stared straight ahead. She even deliberately slowed down her blinking. She was as vigilant as a leopard and didn’t miss any movements.","Half an hour later, the car stopped moving forward. It drove out of the muddy road and hid in the rainforest. They covered the traces of the wheels that had ground into the rainforest floor before retreating.","On the other side, Xia Jinyuan entered the government military camp stationed in Yeni. He drove a truck away and replenished the grenades through a friendly exchange. Under the friendly gaze of the lieutenant colonel who provided the truck and grenades, Xia Jinyuan drove away with his team members.","The Chinese and the Libyan government communicated again and finally got a truck for the Xueyu unit. Xia Jinyuan fought for the best weapon for self-defense—grenades!","With a truck and grenades, they finally went on their way. However, they realized that they had lost contact with the water ghosts of the Storm Commando Brigade.","Needless to say, they must have entered the mine.","Li Jinnian and the rest found the hiding place of the peacekeeping soldiers and gave them a shock with their appearance. The peacekeeping soldiers who had lost contact with the outside didn’t know that reinforcements had arrived. How could they not be shocked?","\"Our comrades who went in didn’t come out. The signal is blocked. We don’t know what’s going on inside. Currently, three batches of illegal militants have entered the mine. There are sentries around.\"","The soldiers on guard told the comrades who came to reinforce them about their situation. Big Prawn sped up his deciphering of the other party’s wireless communication and completed the construction of his own communication system.","Ten minutes later, the two teams resumed communication. At the same time, the two peacekeeping soldiers who had infiltrated the mine sent out the latest news.","The illegal militants forced the workers of the mine to confess. They tried to ask where the special materials were going. So far, there were no casualties among the Chinese hostages, but the Libyan workers..."]},{"number":4321,"title":"Chapter 4321: Angry","paragraphs":["The Chinese workers chose to cooperate and negotiate. The Libyan workers, who had been ruined by the flames of war, chose to try to escape because they didn’t believe that the government forces would save them at all. They didn’t believe that as long as they cooperated, they would be released.","They believed that they were being lied to and that the illegal militants wouldn’t let them go!","The Libyan workers, who had been ruined by the flames of war and only believed in themselves, chose to escape. When they did that, they were shot to death. The few people who were shot were then dragged back to the cafeteria of the mine workers by the illegal militants. The illegal militants also told everyone who was squatting down while hugging their heads that the consequences of escaping would be tragic.","The blood that flowed out had already dried up. It was like countless dark brown snakes were on the ground, looking like they would retaliate in the next second. It made people shudder.","The cafeteria was filled with Libyan workers. A figure slowly stuck his head out of the window of the cafeteria. His gaze quickly swept across the cafeteria building. After ten seconds, he bent down again to avoid the gazes that were directed at the windows.","After a while, the shadow stuck his head out again and continued to observe the situation inside. When he confirmed that there were no Chinese workers in the cafeteria, he hunched over and retreated bit by bit.","He was from the batch of peacekeeping soldiers that entered the mine first.","The mine that had been mined for half a year was huge. The scraps that were mined were not transported out in time and were piled up in the mine. After entering the mine, the peacekeeping soldiers carefully avoided the illegal militants standing in the dark. They started at the sentry post at the tall tower. Only then did they slowly approach the staff cafeteria, dormitory, office area, and living area.","They couldn’t confirm if the hostages in the cafeteria were Chinese workers, so they took the risk to check again.","Now, it could be confirmed that there were no Chinese workers inside.","Where did the Chinese workers go?","After receiving the latest news, Li Jinnian and Xia Jinyuan focused on the mine. They suspected that the Chinese workers who weren’t in the cafeteria were all in the mine.","Instead of letting the peacekeeping soldiers take the risk of checking, they were replaced by the members of the Storm Commando Brigade.","Li Jinnian looked at the time. It was already past 12:00 am. He pursed his thin lips and said to Xia Jinyuan in a low voice, \"My team will go in and scout the way first. We’ll try to settle it as soon as possible!\"","\"We’re still 32 kilometers away from the mine. We’ll arrive in about half an hour. Go in and find the Chinese workers first before working together to rescue them.\"","Xia Jinyuan’s eyes were cold as he sat in the car and maintained the contact between the two teams. His heart sank when he understood the strength of the illegal militants who controlled the mine.","The vicious look on his face became deeper. He said, \"How much firepower equipment do you have? Don’t fight them easily before we come. Wait for us to come before taking action.\"","Heavy firepower equipment...","Hearing this, Ye Jian and the water ghosts looked at the rifles in their hands silently. The only firepower equipment was the Type 95 automatic rifle.","Demon King Li finished reporting their equipment in a second. \"Type 95 automatic rifle.\"","...","Xia Jinyuan waited for more than ten seconds as the car shook. He frowned. \"What else?\"","\"That’s it.\"","\"F*ck!\"","Xia Jinyuan frowned. He kicked the interior of the truck. \"Why are you here? Are you here for peacekeeping?\"","The brothers from the Storm Commando Brigade didn’t have much equipment at all. They were all lightly armed and didn’t even have a grenade. Besides rifles and daggers, they didn’t have any lethal weapons!","Damn it!","They came to a war-torn country to save people, but this was all they were given?"]},{"number":4322,"title":"Chapter 4322: He’s Scared","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan was furious. The anger on his face was so scary that it could make children cry.","Were they overconfident in the strength of the water ghosts?","Or did they trick the water ghosts on purpose?","He cursed a few times, but the water ghosts weren’t angry. Instead, they persuaded him.","\"We have guns, so we’re indeed armed. It’s enough. After we kill a few bastards with grenades, won’t we have lethal weapons?\"","\"Q King, calm down. Calm down. Just now, Demon King Li studied the mine map. If all the Chinese workers are concentrated in the mine, they’re still a little far from our current location. Once we sneak over, you’ll probably have arrived to reinforce us. So, there’s nothing to worry about.\"","The water ghosts weren’t angry. Their situation was different at that time. They came to Libya as peacekeeping soldiers and shuttled through the village. It wouldn’t be according to the rules if they carried all kinds of lethal weapons.","Also, there were no lethal weapons in the camp of the peacekeeping forces. Azure Bird was the one who took down the heavy machine gun and sent it into the camp to hide it just in case.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t know what mission the water ghosts of the Storm Commando Brigade were originally on. Since the water ghosts were persuading him now, he took a deep breath and reminded them again, \"The other party has heavy weapons and bazookas. You must wait for us to come!\"","After he finished speaking, he gritted his teeth and said to the team member driving, \"Drive faster!\"","They didn’t have any weapons. How dare they save hostages with just rifles? He wanted to run over and beat Demon King Li up first!","Was he f*cking going to die?","After thinking for a while, Xia Jinyuan contacted Ye Jian alone.","This was the first time the two of them had a private conversation after being on the public channel for a few hours.","\"Azure Bird, listen up. Your equipment can’t keep up with the other party. The difference is too great. You have more overseas combat experience than the water ghosts. You must remember not to be rash!","\"They don’t dare to touch the Chinese workers now. You just need to remember this. Wait for us to come over and we’ll attack together! Do you understand?\"","This was the woman he loved! They had to be together for a long time!","Ye Jian pressed her earpiece and replied softly. Then, she felt that her answer was too concise and was afraid that he would be suspicious, so she added, \"I know. Demon King Li also said that we’re here to save people, not to die. We won’t fight the other party head-on.\"","\"Okay, wait for me!\"","Xia Jinyuan heaved a sigh of relief. He was really afraid just now.","In order to save the hostages, he was afraid that the woman he loved might put her personal safety aside. He knew that the battlefield was ruthless and life was fragile. He also knew that no one could guarantee that they would come back alive in every combat. He knew that but had never been afraid of death. However... when it came to her, he was still afraid.","He was really afraid that something would happen to her!","Xia Jinyuan’s eyes were red as he stared ahead. He wished he could appear beside Ye Jian now.","The fully equipped special forces soldiers of the Xueyu unit were all tense. They didn’t expect the water ghosts to dare to enter the tiger’s den with just rifles!","Now, they understood why their boss immediately asked them to provide support!","The speed of the truck increased instantly. It went from 60 miles per hour to 80 miles per hour. The entire vehicle shook even more. The special forces soldiers sitting at the back couldn’t sit properly. They kept bouncing up, their butts not touching the seats.","Even so, they still felt that it was too slow. Could their comrade drive faster? After all, he was a driver."]},{"number":4323,"title":"Chapter 4323: Arriving","paragraphs":["At the request of his comrades, the comrade driving said in a low voice, \"Sit tight and don’t bounce out.\" He stepped on the accelerator, and Xia Jinyuan leaned back due to inertia. The speed of the truck instantly increased to 100 miles per hour.","The comrades behind grabbed the side panel of the compartment tightly. They squeezed each other and held each other’s hands. The entire journey was like a roller coaster. The speed was too fast, and the rain hit their faces.","The water ghosts had already started moving. The soldiers from the two troops outside continued to keep an eye on things. If anything happened, they would immediately inform the people inside. This way, they wouldn’t be unaware of what was going on in the outside world. It would also be easier for the water ghosts to infiltrate the mine.","If they wanted to infiltrate the mine, they had to pass the electric net first. It wasn’t difficult for the water ghosts. With tools, it was easy to destroy the electric net.","The mine was very big and protected by the electric net. The illegal militants only strengthened the security of the mine’s exit and didn’t watch their surroundings too closely. The water ghosts found a breakthrough and cut a hole in the electric net before entering the mine.","Ye Jian, who was smaller than the male soldiers, entered first. After entering, she immediately found a hiding spot and stared at her surroundings. When she was sure that it was safe, she said softly, \"Follow.\"","The water ghosts hiding outside infiltrated the mine at the fastest speed.","The scout, Seaweed, and Sea Anemone continued to open the way. Big Eel and Big Squid covered the back while Ye Jian walked in the middle. Demon King Li and the other four brought up the rear. The group of 16 people settled in their positions and headed to the mine on high alert.","Ye Jian had already memorized the map of the entire mine and the buildings in her heart. Occasionally, she would act as a directional sign and take a shortcut to get closer to the mine.","The forest outside the mine was green, and piles of waste stones could be seen everywhere in the mine. Bending over, they passed through the pile of waste stones and headed toward the entrance of the mine.","The Chinese workers weren’t in the cafeteria, dormitory, office, or living area. The only place that hadn’t been checked was the mine. There was a high possibility that the 12 Chinese workers were in the mine.","The rain was falling, and there was water in the mine. When they stepped onto the puddles, the water instantly turned gray and turbid. Rainwater flowed down from the waste pile, and there were small streams everywhere.","Normally, there would be workers redirecting the water. But now, as the water accumulated, the soldiers found their shoes getting wet in some areas.","Ye Jian, whose military boots were already soaked in the rainwater, stepped lightly on the sharp edges and corners. She looked at her comrades in front and hunched over as they moved forward quickly.","Everything happened silently. Every comrade was very stable and didn’t have any impetuousness.","This was their second hostage rescue after arriving in Libya. Compared to the first time, Ye Jian could tell that the water ghosts were much more skilled and their search speed was much faster.","Hide, spy, advance... They alternately entered the depths of the mine.","\"Right, three o’clock, four-man sentry position.\"","\"Roger!\"","\"There’s still one kilometer left. Go around the left side of the mine car track. There’s a lot of waste, so it’s easier to hide.\"","\"Someone’s approaching! Hide!\"","The black shadow, who had already touched the tracks of the mine cart that was extended from the mine, placed one hand on the ground and immediately lay down. He waited for the sound of footsteps to pass.","After a while, he heard another clang. It was a mine cart transporting ore. Ye Jian raised her head slightly and looked in the direction of the track.","The peacekeeping soldier who was staring outside whispered, \"There’s a situation. Two Jeeps are here. Six guys with aluminum tools in suitcases got out of the Jeeps. They’re Western Caucasians.","\"We were too far away to hear what was said. The guys guarding outside are checking the toolboxes in the hands of the six people.\""]},{"number":4324,"title":"Chapter 4324: No Return","paragraphs":["Ye Jian, who was lying in the dark, stared at the mine cart that was moving away. She narrowed her eyes slightly.","Six people came from outside, and a mine cart immediately went out. Were they planning to bring the six people into the mine? Toolbox? Toolbox to check the special materials?","\"The six of them got into the cart. The cart is moving into the mine.\"","As soon as the soldier finished speaking, a cold voice followed. \"Follow the six people who just came in. We’ll arrive in five minutes.\"","It was Xia Jinyuan’s voice.","They had already arrived and were approaching the mine on foot.","The arrival of the special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit immediately eased the tense atmosphere among the water ghosts. The Xueyu unit soldiers infiltrated the mine very quickly through the electric net.","The black shadows were as agile as bobcats. One second, they were here. The next second, they disappeared on the spot and flashed to another place. Their speed was so fast that the water ghosts were amazed.","As expected of the elite forces. One could see their true strength from their actions.","The two Jeeps came to a stop. Six Caucasians came down with umbrellas. At the same time, four armed bodyguards came over and protected the six of them.","One of the militants reached out and shook hands with a Caucasian. After exchanging a few words, everyone jumped onto the rail cart that would go deeper into the mine.","Before the militant jumped into the cart, he lowered his head and instructed a subordinate beside him. Then, the water ghosts, who were secretly observing, clearly felt that the security was tighter. A group of 12 people jogged toward the mine.","\"I’m afraid Azure Bird was right.\"","Big Eel said in a low voice. His voice was filled with killing intent. \"I’m afraid they’re really here to test the materials in the mine so that they can know what special materials China will use.\"","\"The arrival of the six people doesn’t represent individuals, Demon King Li. They represent a certain country.\"","\"A certain country? Maybe a few countries. There are more than one or two Western countries that don’t want China to rise.\" Xia Jinyuan, whose elbow hurt from the sharp scraps, smiled coldly. The killing intent in his eyes was as thick as black. \"Brothers, we have to make sure that they won’t be able to return.","\"Demon King Li, you’re in charge of bringing the hostages out. Leave the matters in the mine to me. The higher-ups have ordered us to destroy all the equipment that wasn’t transferred in time.","\"We have C4s and grenades. It’s not a problem to blow up the entire mine.\"","Li Jinnian didn’t know how well-equipped the special forces soldiers of the Xueyu unit were. He was looking in the direction Ye Jian was pointing at. Hearing that, he looked at the words ’dangerous items, fireworks are strictly prohibited’ and smiled. \"You have C4, but we have firepower too.","\"It’ll take a few C4s to blow up the mine. If we use the miner’s detonator, the impact will be greater.\"","Ye Jian had already started moving. With her was the scout, Seaweed. Their destination was the gunpowder depot with a warning sign written on it.","How did they know that it was a gunpowder depot?","Below the warning sign were the words ’gunpowder depot’.","Ye Jian went to the gunpowder depot, and Xia Jinyuan started his retreat plan. He targeted the two Jeeps and arranged for two team members to reach the Jeeps so that they could drive out when they retreated.","E6 kept an eye on the exit of the mine. He would deal with the six Caucasians who came. He would shoot as long as he saw the enemy.","The two peacekeeping soldiers didn’t continue hiding. They were instructed to sneak into the power supply room and wait for the order to destroy the power supply."]},{"number":4325,"title":"Chapter 4325: Resistance","paragraphs":["After entering the mine, Xia Jinyuan completed the entire combat deployment as quickly as possible. He didn’t waste a second.","After receiving the hostage rescue mission, Xia Jinyuan made countless combat arrangements based on the electronic blueprint provided by the mine.","Later, when he found out that the water ghosts were equipped with only rifles, he immediately overturned the first three sets of combat plans. In the end, the redrafted combat plan also included the deployment if anything were to happen to the water ghosts of the Storm Commando Brigade.","Now, the water ghosts had stabilized themselves. They even knew how many soldiers there were and what weapons they had. There were 31 people in total. In addition to the two peacekeeping soldiers who destroyed the equipment and the eight peacekeeping soldiers outside, there were a total of 41 people. There were enough people!","There were long-range heavy firepower suppression members in the two teams. There were snipers, assaulters, demolitionists, and communication soldiers. They could have anything they wanted. Xia Jinyuan, who had completed his combat deployment, started to rub his hands together.","After he finished deploying, he immediately brought the assaulters and contacted Li Jinnian. Ye Jian had already entered the gunpowder depot. The iron lock beside the door was unlocked. Seaweed remained outside. He was in charge of guarding the place.","Through the night-vision goggles, Ye Jian picked up a detonator that was ready to be used. Her clear voice reached the ears of every comrade. \"There are enough detonators. They’re all civilian TNT detonators. There are wires and detonation equipment. It won’t be a problem to blow up the entire mine.\"","With so many of them, it wouldn’t be a problem for the entire mountain to collapse.","These were such dangerous items, but the Chinese workers didn’t move them together when they moved the equipment. This made things easier for them.","It wasn’t that the Chinese workers didn’t want to move them. It was just that the detonators weren’t important at all when compared to human lives.","In addition, they were afraid that something would happen in the mine. They had the mentality that if there was an explosion, it would not be convenient for outsiders. Therefore, they also moved all the detonators that they had planned to use on another mountain into the depot. If something happened, everything would be blown up together.","Xia Jinyuan laughed softly. \"Let’s see how many kilograms you can carry. Don’t be too greedy. Just bring out enough to blow up the mine.\"","The ones who were sent to open the mine were definitely military enterprises. They probably had already prepared to blow up the mine.","The sensitivity of a soldier to crises was often much higher than those from a private company. When it was time to give up, they would never be soft-hearted.","Ye Jian wanted to take more, but Xia Jinyuan reminded her to just take what was enough.","However, to be safe, she destroyed the other four detonators and took two out. One was for use and the other was for backup.","Just as the two teams finished deploying and were about to gather and infiltrate the mine, something happened at the cafeteria.","Gunshots suddenly sounded. Even though the cafeteria was hundreds of meters away from the two teams, the gunshots could still be heard clearly.","\"Get down, Azure Bird!\"","Xia Jinyuan, who specially came to the gunpowder depot to meet Ye Jian, saw several illegal militants rushing out and immediately reminded Ye Jian to lie down.","The gunshots alerted the illegal militants who were controlling the mine. They mobilized their men to go to the cafeteria.","There were ten militants guarding the cafeteria. They hugged their heads and squatted on the ground. They knew very well that the government forces wouldn’t come to rescue the hostages, but the Libyan workers started resisting again. This time, it wasn’t just a few people. It was everyone.","Ten militants fired at a group of Libyan workers. However, they were pounced on by the Libyan workers who were still alive and stained with the blood of their compatriots."]},{"number":4326,"title":"Chapter 4326: Sorrow","paragraphs":["The Libyan workers, who no longer placed their hopes on the government forces, used their own methods to save themselves. In fact, it was a tragedy.","They were so sad that they couldn’t rely on their own country.","They had no weapons and finally found a shelter. In the end, they lost the chance to escape because of their fear. Thus, they decided to face the challenge head-on.","The Libyan worker who led the charge at the illegal militants was also a core member of a nearby village. Most of the reason why he was recruited in the first place was to appease the natives of Libya who lived nearby.","Now, he was leading more than 60 Libyan workers to win their freedom with his flesh and blood. Even if he fell, he would be able to win the freedom of the Libyan workers behind him.","It was impossible for them to get out alive. These demon-like fellows were even more annoying than the NPFL militants. At least the NPFL militants wouldn’t aim their guns at the Libyan people!","The cafeteria was in chaos. The surviving Libyan workers rushed out of the cafeteria. When the illegal militants received the news, they quickly rushed over to support their people and fired at the Libyan workers who rushed out.","The members of the Storm Commando Brigade knew what was happening. At that moment, two of them were so angry that they almost rushed out. It was the other black shadows that pulled them back in time.","\"Don’t be rash, brothers!\"","Low and cold voices sounded. Li Jinnian immediately recognized that Xia Jinyuan’s soldiers were warning the members of Storm Commando not to be rash.","\"Remember our mission!\" Li Jinnian’s jaw tightened as he gritted his teeth. \"Take advantage of the chaos to enter the mine. Hurry!\"","His eyes were bloodshot. In the dark, the killing intent in his bloodshot eyes was like steel. It seemed like he wanted to kill all the bastards who aimed their guns at the civilians.","In the public channel, countless water ghosts were breathing heavily and chaotically. They were all on their first overseas mission.","They were angry. They were angry because the illegal militants were pointing their guns at the Libyan workers. They wanted to do something.","\"Demon King Li, take advantage of the chaos to bring your men into the mine. We have to hurry!\"","Compared to the anger of the water ghosts, the young Q King was exceptionally calm. The gunshots didn’t affect his emotions. All his emotions and judgment were focused on the rescue mission and how to take advantage of the chaos!","Who was he?","He was a soldier on a mission!","It was a soldier’s duty to obey orders. Hence, he couldn’t indulge in his personal emotions!","The Libyan workers chose to resist. This was their choice and the best choice they thought of.","As for him?","He was a soldier who was ordered to carry out a mission to save all 12 Chinese hostages. He wanted to tell those who dared to directly make decisions to go against China and threaten China to declare war. He wanted to tell them not to stand on China’s head and cause trouble!","The sudden resistance of the Libyan workers would definitely bring about some benefits and disadvantages to the entire rescue mission. The advantage was that they could take advantage of the chaos to enter the mine. The disadvantage was that... they still couldn’t confirm if the Chinese workers were in the mine.","Xia Jinyuan held Ye Jian’s hand tightly and transmitted his voice to every special forces soldier on the mission through the public channel.","The couple was happy to be reunited in a foreign country, but they could only suppress the joy in their hearts and complete their reunion with just one look."]},{"number":4327,"title":"Chapter 4327: Come, I’ll Bring You To Fight","paragraphs":["There was no time for them to say anything heartwarming. To them, time was their life!","After he finished speaking, Xia Jinyuan let go of Ye Jian’s hand. They had only held hands for a few seconds since their reunion.","\"The workers are waiting for us to save them. Your mission is to save them! Do you understand?!\" Li Jinnian knew what his team members were experiencing at this moment. He had experienced it before.","This was what they had to go through in order to develop. Ye Jian had been on the battlefield and transmigrated. She completely understood how ’heavy’ military orders were.","This was also a hurdle that all soldiers had to pass.","The moment they walked out of the country, they no longer revolved around training or carrying out missions in their country. In the future, they would have to go out more often to carry out high-risk, confidential, and despairing missions.","’Brothers, this is the growth of a professional soldier!’","The water ghosts, whose organs were hurting, moved. It was too painful. It was so painful that it felt like their organs were being ripped from their bodies. Their hearts, which were beating faster because of anger, were burning. However, because of what Xia Jinyuan said, they had to tamp it down.","The moment the Chinese soldiers heard the gunshots, they thought that the Chinese soldiers who entered the mine to rescue the hostages had been exposed. When they received the news from inside, they realized that the Libyan workers who were locked up in the cafeteria had resisted.","At that moment, the soldiers outside were all furious. They gritted their teeth so hard that a few of them were about to break.","The Libyan people were the hope of the country. They would fight for freedom and work hard to live!","Even though the country was war-torn, there was still a group of people fighting for freedom and hope. The future would always be there, and the Libyan people would never abandon it.","The gunshots became more concentrated. The special forces soldiers of the two units heard the commotion, and their eyes were filled with killing intent. The water ghosts from the Storm Commando Brigade approached the mine. Xia Jinyuan and Li Jinnian gave their orders almost at the same time.","\"Destroy the power equipment!\"","Their calm voices sounded with killing intent. The soldiers of the two units received an order and pulled down the main power valve. Then, they destroyed the entire power supply.","The entire mine instantly fell into darkness. Without the lights, the mine became a little chaotic. The sentinels guarding the mine were also momentarily distracted. The water ghosts from the Storm Commando Brigade took advantage of their distraction and the fact that these people didn’t have night-vision equipment to ’sweep’ into the mine like the wind.","The Storm Commando Brigade had already moved. The special forces soldiers of the Xueyu unit found their positions according to the previous combat deployments. Countless black shadows moved, waiting for a fierce battle to descend.","Ye Jian, the fast shooter, didn’t enter the mine. Xia Jinyuan took out six grenades and handed them to her. \"It’ll be a fierce battle. Take a few grenades to defend yourself! Give me the detonator! I’ll lay the mine later. You’re on guard! Don’t be too far away from me, understand?\"","Ye Jian, who had been listening to the arrangements the entire time, took the grenades and handed over the detonator. Then, she said softly, \"You don’t have to keep reminding me. You have to be careful yourself.\"","Her helmet was suddenly lifted a little, and a gentle kiss landed on her lips. It was very soft. He quickly raised his head after he was done.","\"Nothing will happen. I promised you. Let’s go, Azure Bird. Your captain will bring you to fight!\"","The mature female soldier followed the mature and steady male soldier closely. She didn’t just follow him. She held her gun and guarded him and herself.","She had already grown up. Xia Jinyuan, who had been holding her hand for a long time, felt at ease letting her cover for him."]},{"number":4328,"title":"Chapter 4328: Together","paragraphs":["The 60-odd Libyan workers who resisted caused a lot of trouble for the illegal militants. The ten rifles they snatched from the cafeteria were all AKs. If the bullets hit their targets, they would pierce through them. Even if they didn’t die, they would be crippled.","The chaos created was huge. The main reason was that the Libyan workers were very familiar with the entire mine. The sudden destruction of the power equipment made it easier for them to escape.","Some people fled toward the exit, but they didn’t manage to run away. Instead, they were killed by illegal militants.","On the contrary, the Libyan workers who escaped to the mine found a hiding place. Some hid and didn’t come out, while those with guns kept firing back.","Amidst the chaos, Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan entered the mine at the same time. The two of them ran forward until they reached a fork.","One fork led to the left, and the other led to the right. According to the blueprint provided by the Chinese mineral company, there was a waste cave to the left. It was more than 140 meters deep. To the right was the mine that had been mined in the past two months. It was similar to a domestic coal mine.","Besides a mine track that transported ores, there were all kinds of metal pipes of different sizes on one side. Some of them were copper pipes. On the other side, there was an aisle that could be passed normally. There were steel nets on both sides to prevent falling rocks from hurting people. When they entered the mine on the right, Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan found an engineering vehicle transporting materials.","The engineering vehicle was a special vehicle that was specially transported into the mine. The entire body of the vehicle was long, but it was very short, like a flattened truck.","There was a huge black pipe above their heads. It was mainly used for ventilation and deep oxygen supply. Ye Jian, who was on guard, looked up and saw the corpse of an illegal militant that had been killed lying on the pipe.","This was the first person who the Storm Commando Brigade had secretly dealt with.","The channel was very quiet. There was still no news from the water ghosts who went deep into the mine to look for the Chinese workers. The situation outside was unknown for the time being.","The special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit were silent. This meant that everything was normal. There was no need to worry.","The resistance of the Libyan workers attracted the attention of the illegal militants. They still didn’t realize that Chinese soldiers had infiltrated the mine and entered the depths of the mine.","Xia Jinyuan placed the detonator on the black oxygen supply pipe at the top and started setting it up ten meters into the mine on the right. Finally, the metal wire used to detonate the detonator extended out.","Li Jinnian’s cold voice broke the silence on the public channel. \"All the hostages have been found. Prepare for support outside. The battle will start in five minutes. Time!\"","\"Roger!\"","\"Okay!\"","...","The latest news made the killing intent in the eyes of the special forces soldiers who participated in the rescue even stronger. The Chinese peacekeeping soldiers outside immediately sent the news back to the Chinese peacekeeping camp in Yeni.","At this moment, the Chinese peacekeeping camp in Yeni was being attacked by illegal militants. They arrogantly used loudspeakers to shout at the Chinese peacekeeping soldiers, asking them to get out of Yeni immediately!","They used the humiliating word ’scram.’ Even the word ’evacuation’ was omitted.","After receiving the latest news from the mine, Lieutenant Colonel Zhu contacted the country. The 12 Chinese workers had been found, and they were preparing to evacuate.","Just as Lieutenant Colonel Zhu was contacting the country, the bloody battle in the mine had begun.","All 12 employees were held at gunpoint in the mine. The Chinese person in charge was shot in the thigh because he didn’t cooperate with the illegal militants. His entire knee was blown up. He had been shot for more than two hours."]},{"number":4329,"title":"Chapter 4329: Brave And Scheming","paragraphs":["In order to prevent the Chinese person in charge, who was still useful to them, from dying, the illegal militants immediately stopped the bleeding after shooting him in his knee. Then, the six Westerners came over.","The Chinese person in charge, who had lost too much blood, was cruelly dragged to one of the Caucasians. Just as the Caucasian wanted to ask something, the electricity in the entire mine suddenly went out, including deep inside the mine.","The mine, which had lost its power source, immediately fell into darkness. Two illegal militants who were standing guard ran out to check on the situation, but they were killed by the water ghosts without any bloodshed.","The water ghosts of the Storm Commando Brigade sneaked in and heard the illegal militants threatening and shouting because the Chinese person in charge wasn’t cooperating.","There was a reserve power source in the mine. The special forces soldiers who were moving close to the tunnel at the side followed the blueprint and found the electric well box first. When Demon King Li and the members of the assault team could see the Chinese workers, they quickly hid in their combat positions. The electric well box that was in charge of the backup power source in the mine was destroyed...","\"What are you doing?!\"","The last ray of light disappeared. The person in charge of guarding the Chinese team shouted outside the mine. At the same time, the sound of countless bullets being loaded could be heard in the darkness.","The six Caucasians who had entered the mine were stunned for a moment. Then, almost at the same time, they took out their pistols and aimed them at the darkness.","The mine was too deep and dark. Even if someone was standing at a distance where they could hear the sound of breathing, they wouldn’t be able to see the other party’s face clearly.","The special forces soldiers outside heard a rhythmic knocking sound from their earpieces. It was three knocks.","After listening to the three knocks, Xia Jinyuan shouted in a low voice, \"Move!\"","Li Jinnian’s hand signals rose and fell. Dozens of black shadows rushed out. The first to be dealt with were the guys who were aiming their guns at the Chinese workers.","The Chinese workers were squatting while the illegal militants were standing. This time, it wasn’t an assassination. They were openly shooting. The soldiers fired their Type 95 rifles continuously. A barrage of bullets was fired. There was smoke at the muzzles.","\"Get down, get down, all of you!\"","Li Jinnian shouted in Chinese. The Chinese workers who were squatting were first frightened by the gunshots and screamed. They thought that the bullets were aimed at them, but they suddenly heard someone shouting in Chinese, \"Get down. All of you, get down!\" Their desire to live made them react the fastest. They pounced forward and laid on the ground without moving.","Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang!","The gunshots were especially stimulating. All the water ghosts fired their bullets at the targets they were staring at. They didn’t miss out on the six Westerners either.","The bullets hit the targets, and the targets fell. A stray bullet hit the machine used to mine ores. The sound of metal colliding was heard continuously, and sparks flew everywhere.","This time, the water ghosts took the initiative. After the first round of shooting, almost all the 20-odd illegal militants around them were killed.","The person who was holding a gun and threatening the person in charge loudly a few seconds ago was the first to be shot in the head by Li Jinnian. The person whose head was hit fell to the ground without even shouting for help.","Although the power outage allowed the illegal militants to load their guns in advance, the water ghosts were all watching them closely. They didn’t give these guys a chance to shoot at all. They kept sweeping over and suppressing them with firepower until they didn’t have a chance to shoot anymore.","\"Go, go, go. Hold hands and follow us!\"","They started to retreat."]},{"number":4330,"title":"Chapter 4330: The Speed Of Life And Death","paragraphs":["Gunshots sounded throughout the entire mine. Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian, who were lying in ambush at the fork of the two mines, had their fingers on the trigger. Their cold gazes were fixed on the front. When they heard the gunshots, several figures were killed by the two of them.","They were the illegal militants guarding outside.","The illegal militants in the mine were hindered by the special forces of the Xueyu unit, especially when they entered the mine. The soldiers guarded the mine tightly. Whoever came to reinforce the mine would be killed on the spot.","After two rounds, the illegal militants who wanted to come over were frightened. Some people wanted to inform the outside world that they had been sneak attacked. In the end, they realized sadly that their communication devices were blocked. They couldn’t contact the outside world at all.","The entire mine was even more chaotic. The soldiers guarding outside didn’t move because it wasn’t time for them to move.","They were the last ones to cover the retreat. The brothers who went in to rescue the hostages hadn’t come out yet. They had to continue lying down and wait.","It was the rainy season now. There was abundant rainwater in the Libyan mine. The rain hadn’t shown any signs of stopping since yesterday evening. The raindrops fell and hit the leaves. The countless interweaving sounds covered up the gunshots in the direction of the mine. The blood was also washed clean by the rainwater.","An explosion sounded. The flames from the explosion rushed over and lit up a certain spot in the mine. The rain and wind smelled of gunpowder.","\"Group attack? Let’s wipe them out in one go!\"","A cold and vicious voice came from the public channel. Ye Jian, who was helping the Storm Commando Brigade retreat, heard a deafening explosion a few seconds later.","\"Follow closely, follow closely! Bend down and don’t look up! Keep walking forward!\"","There was also Big Eel’s voice in the earpieces. He, Sea Anemone, Seaweed, and Big Eel led a total of four teams to cover the evacuation of the Chinese workers. Big Squid carried the Chinese person in charge whose right knee had been shot at.","In the end, Li Jinnian and the rest were in charge of covering the retreat.","\"Hurry, hurry, hurry!\"","\"Don’t look back. Just rush forward!\"","The anxious voices of the water ghosts could be heard through the earpieces, letting all the team members who were receiving them know that the situation in the mine was under control.","The special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit, who had ample ammunition outside, threw a few grenades and sent a group of at least 20 illegal militants flying.","One grenade wasn’t lethal enough, so they threw three grenades at once. The explosion shook the ground, and 20 targets were knocked down.","Those who weren’t caught in the explosion were hit by the shrapnel. Before they could get up, they were shot at.","Assassination and night attacks were the strengths of the special forces of the Xueyu unit. Facing these fellows who were ruthless even to the civilians of the country, every one of them would be killed.","The terrain of the mine was complicated. In addition, there were many piles of waste stones. It was hard to say if a few powerful illegal militants would sneak onto the pile and try to launch a sneak attack.","However, although the illegal militants brought bazookas, heavy machine guns, and other heavy weapons to the mine, they left behind a very important thing—night-vision goggles.","The illegal militants who controlled the entire mine probably didn’t expect to be sneak attacked in the middle of the night. The other party even sneaked into the mine under their surveillance and started a fire attack. Hence, even though they had heavy weapons, they couldn’t shoot accurately at the Chinese soldiers who entered the camp.","However, the fully equipped Chinese special forces soldiers could do it."]},{"number":4331,"title":"Chapter 4331: Don’t Let Them Escape","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian guarded the fork, preventing the illegal militants from entering. The people who wanted to rush to the mine were stopped by their team members to buy time for the water ghosts to retreat.","They had to retreat quickly. 12 minutes later, Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian received the water ghosts and rushed out of the mine.","\"Drive the truck over!\"","Xia Jinyuan informed his comrade, who had been waiting to drive, to move immediately. He rushed toward the mine at a high speed.","The sound of the engine was heard. The snow-white high-beam lights lit up the place. It was like two sharp swords cutting the darkness into two.","The illegal militants, who had entered a fierce battle, discovered the situation and fired in the direction of the truck. The truck was like a snake turning around in the mine. It didn’t drive in a straight line, nor was it driving directly on a road. Instead, it was shuttling through the mountain of wasted stones, making it impossible for the illegal militants to aim and shoot. They could only shoot blindly.","\"F*ck, block the truck! Block the truck! Damn it! Don’t let them escape!\"","\"Machine gunners, machine gunners, kill them! Kill them all!\"","\"Damn it, they’re not the damn government forces!\"","The truck was a big target. An illegal militant hiding in the dark set up a bazooka and loaded it. He aimed at one of the waste stones with a gloomy gaze. Just as the truck was about to reach the small mountain of waste stones he was aiming at, the bazooka fired the shell.","\"Bazooka, V8! Retreat, retreat!\"","The shell that was fired had a long trail of fire as it shot toward the pile of waste stones. Special forces soldiers M and T6, who were watching the west side, immediately noticed something amiss. Their voices seemed to be torn out of their throats and were filled with ruthlessness.","V8 had already driven onto the pile of rocks. When he heard his comrades’ reminder, he didn’t retreat. His eyes were filled with blood as he suddenly turned right. The truck rushed toward another pile of rocks like a cannonball!","Boom!","The bazooka shell used for anti-tank attacks hit the pile of waste stones. Flames and smoke surged into the air. The huge explosion flattened the entire pile of waste stones, leaving a medium-sized crater in the middle.","Countless gravel and fragments splattered in all directions, smashing onto the ground like a rain of rocks.","Everyone knew the power of a bazooka. T6 shouted for V8. The two of them had always been partners. They were partners whose lives were on the line. The moment the explosion sounded, T6 felt as though he was about to lose his own life.","\"V8! V8!\"","T6 shouted. His handsome face, which was washed by the rain, was distorted as if he had become a different person.","All his comrades were waiting for V8’s reply. However, they didn’t wait for V8’s reply immediately. The guy hiding on the pile of rocks looked at the rocks that had been blown up. He slowly lowered his head and put away his shells, preparing to leave.","M didn’t stay where he was. He locked onto the position where the bazooka was fired. Holding his rifle, he hunched his back and rushed out.","He needed to find that fellow as soon as possible. He needed to kill that fellow as soon as possible. With the first shell, there would be a second shell. Once the shell aimed at the mine, all their rescue arrangements would fail.","His military boots stepped on the water. The muddy water splashed everywhere. When he stepped on the uneven gravel, his feet made clicking sounds.","Finally, through the night-vision goggles, M saw two figures in the dark green world. They were both carrying things. One was carrying a bazooka, and the other was carrying shells!","The shooting range was too far for him to lock on accurately. M increased his speed and rushed out. However, someone moved faster. It was the sniper, E6."]},{"number":4332,"title":"Chapter 4332: Revenge For You","paragraphs":["Bang!","The heavy sniper rifle’s high-caliber bullet tore through the air and accurately hit the guy carrying the shells.","The black shadow fell instantly. He didn’t even know how he died.","When the guy carrying the bazooka saw this, his reaction was extremely fast. He immediately laid down and rolled in the opposite direction of the sniper bullets.","He knew that he was being attacked by a sniper, and his companion had been sniped by a sniper’s bullet. He had been locked on by the sniper. It would be difficult for him to escape!","The bazooka launcher had a keen anti-reconnaissance capability and was extremely fast. Knowing that he was locked on by a sniper, he rolled a few times and stopped moving. Even though his face was bleeding from the sharp rocks, he didn’t move and let the rocks pierce deep into his face.","This was a fellow who had made countless contributions to the anti-government soldiers. He was also a ruthless fellow who would shoot civilians whenever he wanted. Once, when a child bumped into him, he used the dagger in his hand to cut off the child’s head and tossed it about for fun.","His hands were stained with blood. At this moment, his heart was trembling. He wasn’t sure if he could escape from the sniper’s gun.","He looked at his partner who was killed by the sniper. He didn’t care about his partner’s death. What he cared about was... whether he could take the shells with him.","M didn’t give him a chance.","Although E6 had locked onto the entire sniping range, the other party cunningly rolled to the other side, blocking his vision. He wanted to change his sniping position, but M told him that he would handle the fellow.","\"I’ll make sure he stays on the pile of rocks forever. He can forget about staying alive until dawn.\"","M, whose gaze was ice-cold, said in a low voice. After he finished speaking, a muffled voice sounded. \"Damn it, M, help me kill that bastard.\"","V8 was still alive. The speed of the truck was too fast just now. He turned right and rushed to the pile of waste stones. In the end, he was still a step too late. The windshield on the driver’s side was shattered by the explosion. All kinds of debris smashed toward the left side of his face. His vision was affected for a moment. A second before the car lost control, he stepped on the brakes.","The consequence was that... his head hit the steering wheel and his vision turned black. The surroundings became quiet for a moment and then buzzed like countless bees.","He seemed to have heard his comrades’ shouts, but his mind was not in the right state. He took a deep breath when he saw his vision turning black. He couldn’t speak normally for a while.","His comrades were shocked when he didn’t answer immediately.","Now that he had spoken up, all the members heaved a sigh of relief.","T6, who felt as though he had lost half his soul, heaved a sigh of relief when he heard the familiar voice. He didn’t speak again and aimed his gun at the enemy who was firing at them.","Xia Jinyuan, who had successfully reached the entrance of the mine and was about to rush out, shouted, \"If you’re not dead, hurry up and drive the truck over!\"","\"Yes!\"","V8, who was still alive, released the brake pad and stepped on the accelerator. The rumbling of the truck’s motor sounded again and reached the ears of the illegal militant who was still lying tightly on the ground.","The moment he heard the sound of the truck’s motor, disbelief and anger flashed across the illegal militant’s eyes.","He thought that he had killed the driver, but in the end, he didn’t!","Nothing could be more miserable than this!","However, what made him even more discouraged was yet to come. M, who had locked onto him, pursed his lips and set up his rifle."]},{"number":4333,"title":"Chapter 4333: The Final Madness","paragraphs":["The soldiers of the Xueyu unit were skilled at shooting people in the back. They would never allow others to shoot them in their backs.","The cold-eyed illegal militant was still thinking about how to get the shells back when M, who had set up his rifle, fired.","He had to solve the problem with one shot so that he wouldn’t waste bullets.","Bang!","A single bullet was fired. The tip of the bullet turned the raindrops into mist and tore through the air, heading straight for the target’s head.","The brain was the most important part of the human nervous system. The central nervous system was the most active. If the brain was damaged, the person would either die or be paralyzed, let alone if the brain was hit by a bullet.","The bullet passed through the back of his head and then out between his eyebrows. Red blood and white brain matter splattered out together with skull fragments. Before they reached the ground, they were washed into the gaps between the waste stones by the rainwater.","The man lay on the ground without the chance to get up.","After taking care of his target, M tightened his grip on his rifle and quickly retreated from another pile of waste stone. Now, he had to rush to clear the area.","When he was retreating, M met a Libyan worker who was also holding a gun and hiding nervously in a corner. M didn’t alarm him and chose to avoid him.","The surviving Libyan workers were all hiding now. Even if they had guns, they were still hiding because they realized that others had killed those damned fellows one by one.","V8 drove the truck and rushed over. Soon, he entered the circle where the Xueyu unit was clearing the area. He was getting closer and closer to the Chinese workers who had been rescued.","Xia Jinyuan detonated the detonator. A huge explosion sounded in the entire mountain range. The mountain collapsed, and the ground split. The entire mine shook.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The mine cave collapsed, and even the entire mountain was collapsing. The people inside, including the six Caucasians specially sent for inspection, were all buried in the rubble.","This change stunned the illegal militants who were still fighting with their guns. They finally realized that things were worse than they thought.","Thinking about who else was in the mine, the illegal militants started their last crazy attack.","\"Get in, get in! Hurry! Get in!\"","Amidst the sound of gunfire, the water ghosts pulled the 11 Chinese workers into the truck one by one. The Chinese person in charge, who had hurt his knee, had gotten into the car earlier. Now, his body was covered with waterproof cloth.","The 12 Chinese workers got into the truck. The 15 water ghosts who were protecting them also got into the truck. The Chinese workers who were rescued were all lying on the ground. The 15 water ghosts, including Captain Li Jinnian, were all kneeling with guns in their hands. They squatted in four directions of the truck and rushed toward the entrance of the mine.","\"All the hostages have been successfully rescued. Retreat now! Retreat now! Receive at the front!\"","The command was repeated again and again. The truck retreated at its fastest speed.","V8 drove. Li Jinnian, who was sitting in the passenger seat, was in charge of clearing the area. The truck rushed out of the rain curtain and rushed to the Chinese camp with the 12 Chinese workers who had survived.","The soldiers guarding outside started moving. Now, it was their turn to receive the hostages who had already boarded the truck.","Another round of fierce battle started. They used grenades to blow up the locked iron gates of the mine. Then, they killed the illegal militants who tried to resist and stop them from retreating. As for the Libyan workers, it was most suitable for the Chinese peacekeeping soldiers to come to their aid.","They used stiff English to tell the surviving Libyan workers to leave immediately and not stay any longer. Amidst the sound of gunfire, the surviving Libyan workers finally rushed out of the destroyed gates under the cover of the Chinese peacekeeping soldiers. At that moment, they knew that they had successfully survived.","At the most crucial moment, the Chinese soldiers stood up and let them leave alive."]},{"number":4334,"title":"Chapter 4334: It’s Good To Be Alive","paragraphs":["Another truck drove out. This time, it was to fetch the special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit who were still fighting in the mine.","\"Retreat, retreat!\"","\"I’ll cover you. Retreat!\"","\"Where’s the captain? Captain! Say something!\"","\"What’s up? Azure Bird and I will retreat quickly!\"","\"Damn it, isn’t there a heavy machine gunner? Why isn’t there any movement?\"","\"F*ck, are you looking for trouble? Damn it, where are you? Why don’t I see you?\"","The rescue of the hostages was successful. Even the company channel became lively. The special forces soldiers of the two units cooperated and wiped out the illegal militants. Besides the illegal militants who escaped and hid far away, the rest were all wiped out.","If they really relied on the water ghosts of Storm Commando to infiltrate the mine and rescue the hostages, how could they succeed so quickly?","There were not enough people and weapons. They might even have to report a number of casualties.","The water ghosts, who had rushed out of the mine, smiled when they heard the happy voices of their comrades from the brother company.","It was good to leave alive.","The special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit started getting into the truck. Ye Jian was the first to jump into the truck. Right on the heels of that, she pulled Xia Jinyuan into the truck. The truck retreated according to the route they had planned. They retreated safely.","The remaining illegal militants didn’t dare to exchange fire anymore. They didn’t gather either. Instead, they became scattered soldiers. Facing opponents with stronger firepower and strength than them, they didn’t dare to show their faces easily.","About a hundred illegal militants had entered the mine, and there were 31 Chinese special forces soldiers. Even if the other party’s numbers were twice as high, they were still inferior.","One had to know that the execution ability of a special forces soldier was far from what an ordinary soldier could compare to. In combat, a special forces soldier could fight against more than five ordinary soldiers. As a result, even though there were more illegal militants, they still lost.","Of course, there was another main factor.","The other party didn’t expect the Chinese to send peacekeeping soldiers to rescue the hostages. They didn’t expect the Chinese special forces to do it either.","They thought that restraining the two Chinese peacekeeping forces in Yeni and Covil was enough to prevent China from being able to spare any additional forces. That was what they thought, and so did the Western countries that were cooperating with the illegal militants.","The United Nations was still condemning the brutality of the illegal militants and trying to make them remember the peacekeeping rules. China had already resolved its biggest problem.","Just as the illegal militants were still trying to threaten China and ask the Chinese peacekeeping force in Libya to ’scram’ back to China and give them the management rights of the mines and all the equipment, the special forces soldiers sent by China had already left the mine with the hostages.","Not only did they successfully rescue the hostages, but the Chinese peacekeeping soldiers also brought the surviving Libyan workers back.","They didn’t take the same vehicle. Instead, they sat in the two trucks and left.","When the Libyan workers in the truck knew that they would be settled in the Chinese peacekeeping forces’ camp, their eyes were filled with tears and even a deep sense of security.","Their country didn’t give them a sense of security, but the soldiers from another country did.","They leaned against each other. No one spoke. They just leaned against each other until they were farther and farther away from the mine."]},{"number":4335,"title":"Chapter 4335: Wind And Rain Together","paragraphs":["If the mine collapsed, both them and the machines would’ve been buried deep beneath. This meant that this place would become an abandoned place and there would be no more work.","Five kilometers away from the mine, the Xueyu unit and the Storm Commando Brigade changed trucks. The Xueyu unit protected the Chinese workers who were successfully rescued. The Storm Commando Brigade soldiers rested after swapping trucks.","A total of four trucks were driven out. The comrades of the Xueyu unit were also divided into two groups. One group was with the water ghosts while the other group was left to protect the hostages.","As for Ye Jian, she was on a mission with the water ghosts of Storm Commando, so she naturally had to return to the team. However... she didn’t return. She was pulled back by Xia Jinyuan and continued to ride with him to protect the Chinese workers.","The Chinese workers turned around and looked at the mine they had lived in for almost a year. A technician cursed in a low voice. He was resigned and angry.","A worker at the side patted his shoulder lightly and smiled. \"Don’t be upset. Just move to another place. At least we’re still alive. We can do anything we want.\"","\"One year of surveying and one year of mining, but everything was destroyed in one night Alas...\" The technician scratched his head furiously and wiped the rainwater off his face. He gritted his teeth and said, \"I wonder where these bastards got their information from. It’s good that they were killed!\"","The technician was in charge of mechanical technology. He had followed the rest of the workers from the moment they went down the mine to the moment they mined the resources they wanted. He was a witness.","Now, their hard work had to be destroyed because they were targeted by the outside world. He was so sad that he secretly cried a few times.","When he was kidnapped, he was very afraid. However, he didn’t cry. Now... he was crying until his nose was stuffed.","\"It’s alright, it’s alright. Everything will be fine as long as we’re still alive. Let’s ask about Engineer Ding’s injuries first. I wonder if his leg can be saved.\"","The technician looked at the shelter that the four Chinese ’peacekeeping’ soldiers had temporarily set up. After staring for a while, he turned around and said in a low voice, \"He should still be undergoing treatment. We’ll ask later. I wonder if Engineer Ding can keep his leg.\"","\"Alas...\" The worker sighed. It wasn’t up to them whether his leg would be fine or not. They would have to see what the military surgeon had to say.","\"Rest for a while. We’ll ask the military surgeon when he comes out.\"","When the Chinese workers sitting next to each other heard this, they didn’t speak in low voices anymore. They leaned against each other and wobbled out of the rainforest.","The Chinese workers who were rescued didn’t know that the people who saved them were special forces soldiers sent by the country. They thought that they were peacekeepers. Even Engineer Ding, who was getting his wound treated, thought so too.","Engineer Ding was the person in charge whose knee had been shot. He was the chief engineer in charge of the transfer of important machinery in the entire mine. The illegal militants didn’t target him at first. Instead, they targeted another Chinese worker. He was the one who walked out and told the other party that he was the person in charge. If anything happened, they should come for him.","In the end, he took a bullet to his knee. The Chinese workers saw him in so much pain that his facial nerves were twitching. Even then, they didn’t see him make a sound.","The other party asked what kind of mine this was. Engineer Ding said there was gold, copper, and manganese... He even handed over a list of materials that he brought with him at any time and told the other party that they had just sent out a batch of manganese the day before yesterday. It wasn’t much, about 50 kilograms.","He was afraid that the other party wouldn’t believe him, so he even showed the other party his cell phone message.","It was because of Engineer Ding’s cooperation that the illegal militants didn’t make things too difficult for them. They asked the other Chinese workers too. Since Engineer Ding had said so, they followed this direction. In the end, even the other party believed that they were just mining gold, copper, and manganese."]},{"number":4336,"title":"Chapter 4336: Worth It","paragraphs":["The people who were held hostage weren’t ordinary workers. They were all employees of the military chemical plant. Although they weren’t soldiers from the military unit, they had undergone formal training. From the moment they were kidnapped, they knew that even if they really died, they had to bite their lips and not say anything.","It was to avoid infamy!","Now, they had been saved. They hadn’t revealed anything either. As for the mine... They had vaguely sensed something when they saw the list of materials.","Thinking back to the mechanical transfers, they pieced the puzzle together.","The mine would’ve been destroyed sooner or later.","Ding Gong, who had lost too much blood and fallen unconscious, was still in the midst of treatment. The truck drove out of the camp for ten kilometers. The special forces soldiers of the Xueyu unit made arrangements and immediately propped up a waterpoof tent to cover Ding Gong so that they could start the first-aid.","They learned battlefield first aid. In order not to waste time treating their wounds, they moved quickly and roughly. K7 looked at his comrade who was pulling gauze for him. In the end, he stuck his head out and asked Ye Jian, who was in charge of guarding, to come over and help.","At this moment, Ye Jian had become K7’s assistant. She cooperated with K7 to treat Engineer Ding’s wound.","Ye Jian looked at Engineer Ding’s injured knee. She lowered her head and avoided eye contact. The injury was very serious. The entire knee plate was shattered. The bullet was embedded in the gap between the calf and thigh bones. K7... couldn’t take it out.","Ye Jian felt lucky that it wasn’t a rifle bullet that hit him. It was a NATO-made pistol bullet.","K7 couldn’t take out the bullet from the bone. The environment didn’t allow him to take it out either. The painkiller worked. When he was cleaning the area around the wound, Engineer Ding woke up from his coma, but he didn’t feel any pain.","He had fainted after being carried into the truck. The first thing he said when he woke up was to ask Ye Jian if he was still alive. After receiving Ye Jian’s nod, he heaved a sigh of relief. He relaxed and said, \"One leg for 11 lives. It’s worth it.\"","K7 wasn’t the one who said that Engineer Ding might have to go through an amputation; it was Engineer Ding himself.","Ye Jian pursed her lips and said softly, \"It hasn’t reached the stage of amputation. Don’t think too much.\"","Her consolation was a little pale.","\"I’m fine. It’s good that I’m still alive.\" The 40-year-old Engineer Ding was very open-minded. He smiled, his lips bleeding and pale. \"I’ve been to two war-torn countries and suffered many gun wounds. Recently, I saw a person whose chest was blown up. That was the first time I saw it. After returning to the unit, I had nightmares for half a month. Later on, I saw many such cases, so I wasn’t afraid anymore.","\"Living is better than anything else. My life is still intact, and amputation is not a problem. In my line of work, as long as my brain is not damaged, everything is fine.\"","Although he said that, Ye Jian still saw Engineer Ding’s hands trembling.","K7 was a cold person to begin with, so he wouldn’t say anything to comfort Engineer Ding. However, he had already realized that Engineer Ding was afraid. He frowned slightly and seemed to be trying his best to come up with a few words of comfort. In the end, he pursed his lips and only said one sentence, \"Many soldiers can’t compare to your courage.\"","The four comrades, who were squatting at the corners of the tent, were so shocked that their jaws almost dropped to the ground.","Did the sun rise from the west today? K7, who always focused only on work and was a man of few words,actually knew how to comfort someone?","As his comrades, they had never been comforted by him!","Ye Jian didn’t know this. She felt that although K7 didn’t talk much, he was just concise.","K7 didn’t feel that he was comforting the injured. He was just telling the truth."]},{"number":4337,"title":"Chapter 4337: Throwing Herself Into His Arms","paragraphs":["Even among the soldiers in the combat military unit, it was normal if they never suffered from a gun wound during their three years of military service.","As for Engineer Ding, he had been to two war-torn countries and had even seen a chest cave in from a bullet. That was the power of a large-caliber 12mm bullet.","Engineer Ding’s eyes lit up. That was right. He was bolder than many soldiers!","Ye Jian secretly gave K7 a thumbs-up. ’Not bad, you know how to comfort others!’","K7 accepted Ye Jian’s praise calmly. It took him a long time to say this sentence, and he was praised. How could he say that he was embarrassed?","Of course, he wouldn’t say it.","There were no blood bags. After stopping the bleeding, providing pain relief, debridement, and anti-inflammation, K7 bandaged Engineer Ding’s wound simply. After he finished his work, his comrades, who were half-squatting and raising the waterproof cloth to make it easier for K7 to carry out his task, sat down. Then, they pulled the four corners of the waterproof cloth and covered Engineer Ding again. They covered him from head to toe to prevent the rain from falling on Engineer Ding.","After Engineer Ding’s wound was treated, the 11 Chinese workers saw the ’military surgeon’ coming out. Represented by the technician, he asked K7 softly if Engineer Ding’s leg had to be amputated.","K7 looked at the Chinese worker who was talking to him. After thinking for a moment, he replied simply, \"He’s fine for the time being. He’s already asleep.\"","He didn’t say anything else.","He was fine for the time being. If he was fine for the time being, that meant he was fine. There was no need for an amputation!","The 11 Chinese workers laughed and cried at the same time. Just like that, their emotions fluctuated like a flood. They smiled and cried, expressing their gratitude as they cried.","The technician held K7’s hand and cried until K7’s back was so stiff that it was as if there was a steel plate embedded in it. He stood straight and didn’t move the entire time.","This was the first time K7 encountered such a situation. He didn’t know how to deal with it!","He wanted to ask for help, but he realized that... the 11 workers were holding the hands of his 11 comrades. One of them was even crying like a child!","Perhaps it was because G3 wanted to be a father, but he even patted the back of a Chinese worker with a kind fatherly face.","Ye Jian was almost shaken too. However, someone reacted quickly and pushed X toward the worker. X was caught off guard and was shaken by the Chinese worker. As for Ye Jian, she was pulled into someone’s arms.","Ye Jian wasn’t on guard either. Coupled with the fact that the truck was shaking, she found herself suddenly pulled into Xia Jinyuan’s arms. The back of her head bumped into his chin, and both of them gasped.","Xia Jinyuan hurt his chin while Ye Jian hurt the back of her head.","The good thing was that... Ye Jian was now sitting in Xia Jinyuan’s arms. Her back was against his broad and strong chest. Just like that, he hugged her tightly.","Xia Jinyuan raised his eyebrows in surprise. He just wanted to pull her away to prevent other men from hugging her. Who knew that he would get benefits for himself?","This benefit had fallen from the sky. How could he not cherish it?","As a human, he had to cherish his blessings!","Hence, Lieutenant Colonel Xia decided to be a man who treasured his blessings!","He held the gun with one hand and wrapped his other hand around Ye Jian’s waist. The only thing he was a little unhappy about was that the tactical vests they were wearing were in the way. They couldn’t get more intimate.","\"Are you throwing yourself at me?\"","He hugged her waist with one hand and smiled softly. He leaned close to Ye Jian’s ear and said, \"Comforting me during combat? Not bad, I like it.\"","After the serious matter was over, Xia Jinyuan decided to relax. How could his heart be tense all the time? He would get older quicker that way.","When it was time to relax, he had to relax!"]},{"number":4338,"title":"Chapter 4338: He’s Coquettish","paragraphs":["There wasn’t much time to relax. Xia Jinyuan, who always made good use of his time, wouldn’t miss any time to relax.","After two consecutive combats, he couldn’t take it anymore. He urgently needed to rest and catch his breath.","He dared to be so relaxed, but Ye Jian didn’t.","She didn’t care that the back of her head was still hurting. She hurriedly said, \"There are a truckload of people watching you. How dare you touch me? Let go.\"","As she spoke, she wanted to pry open the iron arms around her waist.","\"There’s no one watching. Everyone is busy.\" How could Xia Jinyuan agree? Even if he just had one hand around her, he still had enough strength to suppress her and not let her escape from his arms.","His voice, which was a little hoarse from the smoke, was gentle. It pierced straight into Ye Jian’s heart. She knew that someone might discover them, but she couldn’t bear to push him away.","Hence, she didn’t use her full strength when pushing his arm off. It made it easier for Lieutenant Colonel Xia to succeed.","\"Mobile combat in two places consecutively. Baby, let me lean on you. I’m a little tired.\"","Ye Jian: \"...\"","He was acting coquettishly!","She didn’t even know how to whine like most girlfriends did!","Ye Jian, who was seeing her boyfriend acting all coquettish, had no choice but to stop pulling his arm away. Even her voice softened. \"Does it hurt? I can feel the back of my head hurting even though I’m wearing a helmet.\"","She was already in pain even though she was wearing a helmet, let alone his chin.","It was a little painful, but that wasn’t a problem. However, since his girlfriend was so concerned, Lieutenant Colonel Xia nodded solemnly and said a little aggrievedly, \"It hurts. My chin is bruised, right? I almost cried.\"","It couldn’t be that serious, right?","Ye Jian felt a little uneasy when she thought about how she had gotten hit in the back of her head with her helmet on. She raised her hand. Just as her fingers touched his chin, she heard him gasp. It really hurt. It wasn’t fake.","\"Don’t touch it. It’s still hurting.\"","\"You got hit so hard. You’ll definitely see a bruise tomorrow. If you hadn’t pulled me just now, you wouldn’t have hit yourself so badly.\"","The stubble on his well-defined chin was a little prickly. Ye Jian’s heart ached as she spoke. She didn’t dare to use too much strength in her fingers. She just touched it very gently. \"When we go back to the camp, we’ll see if there’s any ice. Put some ice on it and see if it can alleviate the bruise.\"","As she spoke, she looked around vigilantly. Fortunately, her comrades in the same truck were comforting the 11 Chinese workers, especially G3. Ye Jian looked at him a few times and felt that it was very strange. Why did it feel like... he was coaxing a child?","She was distracted by G3. Xia Jinyuan, who was hugging her, seemed to have seen her thoughts. He smiled and explained, \"G3 is amazing. He went home on leave for half a month and tormented his wife every night. His wife is now expecting.","\"Sister-in-law is more than a month pregnant. He wanted to tell us three months later, but when he received the news, he couldn’t hold back his laughter. He told us that he was about to become a father. He even said it a few times.","\"He looks like a kind father now. He can be considered to be a father now.\"","Without an explanation, Ye Jian only felt that G3’s actions were a little strange. After listening to the explanation, she felt it made sense that he was immersed in his role.","It was just like what Captain Xia said.","It was a good thing that G3 was going to be a father.","\"He’s the first one in the team to be a father. Now, all the veterans in our team have been unilaterally declared to be his child’s godfather. I’m helpless. I’m still a virgin. How did I become a father?\"","He sounded serious at the start, but toward the end... Ye Jian couldn’t help but pinch his thigh. Lieutenant Colonel Xia was caught off guard and almost cried out in pain."]},{"number":4339,"title":"Chapter 4339: Image Cannot Collapse","paragraphs":["She pinched his thigh!","\"It hurts, it hurts. Be gentle, be gentle.\"","Before Ye Jian could release her grip, Lieutenant Colonel Xia begged for mercy. \"Let’s not talk about it anymore. I’m just explaining to you. I didn’t mean anything else.\"","\"Can you let go of my hand too?\"","Ye Jian smiled and asked him.","\"Yes, yes. Give me another minute and I’ll let go immediately. Just one more minute.\" Between pain and benefits, Comrade Xia Jinyuan boldly chose benefits.","Pain was nothing!","A soldier wasn’t afraid of hardship, tiredness, or pain!","He would feel pain every day, but hugging his girlfriend wouldn’t happen every day.","Ye Jian was amused and angry. The older he got, the more shameless he became.","In the end, Ye Jian couldn’t bear to see him in pain. She let go and said, \"Stop fooling around and have a good rest. We still have to make a detour back to Covil. I don’t know if anything will happen on the way. Hurry up and rest to recuperate.\"","The cries around them became softer. They were all men. When they suddenly cried, they couldn’t help but howl. Now that their tears were flowing and their fear was gone, they couldn’t continue crying.","They opened their mouths and apologized again and again. The special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit were at a loss for what to do. On the surface, they still had to show a cold expression to show that they had done what they should.","Ye Jian couldn’t help but laugh a few times.","Her comrades were very powerful but cute too!","The Chinese workers gradually calmed down. They closed their eyes and slept soundly with the swaying of the truck. The rain didn’t stop them from sleeping even though their clothes were drenched. With a group of Chinese soldiers protecting them, they could sleep peacefully.","The special forces soldiers were extremely tired. When all the Chinese workers fell asleep, the comrades Ye Jian thought were cute finally dared to stretch their long legs and hands.","Stand like a pine tree, walk like the wind, sit like a bell... In front of the commoners, the image of a soldier could not collapse!","Now that the commoners were asleep, everyone heaved a sigh of relief.","\"Oh my god, it’s even more tiring than running ten kilometers.\" T6 swung his arm and said in a low voice, \"I don’t know how many liters of tears my arms have been stained with. I was dumbfounded when they cried. I didn’t expect men to be scary when they cried.","That was right. They were dumbfounded when the workers cried. They didn’t know how to comfort them at all. If a lady threw herself into their arms, they could still accept it. However, it was fellow men who grabbed their hands and cried at the top of their lungs. That scene... They couldn’t help but tremble when they thought about it.","\"I understand a little. After surviving a calamity, their emotions are a little rich. They’ll be fine after crying,\" G3 said with a smile. His fatherly face made his comrades unable to bear to look at him.","Xia Jinyuan, who had already let go of Ye Jian and was sitting upright, waited for his comrades to finish speaking. He said calmly, \"Two people will take turns to be on guard. The rest will rest. There are still things to do later. You need to rest well.\"","\"Yes!\"","They replied in unison. There was no need for Xia Jinyuan to make any more arrangements. The comrades decided between themselves who would be on guard. The rest hugged their guns as they fell asleep.","Ye Jian wasn’t involved. As long as there were enough people, the male soldiers wouldn’t get Ye Jian to stand guard. She was a female soldier, and they had to take care of her when they could.","Ye Jian was indeed tired. She didn’t reject it and prepared to fall asleep by leaning against the wet and cold compartment. Comrade Xia Jinyuan patted his shoulder and smiled. \"Lie here. If not, I have nowhere to lean.\""]},{"number":4340,"title":"Chapter 4340: Kiss And Smile","paragraphs":["Before Ye Jian could answer, a comrade with sharp ears answered.","\"Captain, I can lend you my shoulder to lean on!\" Long Eagle chuckled. It couldn’t be helped. He accidentally heard it.","\"You don’t want to sleep? Why don’t you guard the place alone tonight?\"","\"I’ll sleep immediately. Sorry to disturb you!\"","A wise man knew when to retreat. Long Eagle immediately closed his eyes and fell asleep!","G3, T6, and the rest lowered their heads and smiled silently. As expected of their captain. He was amazing!","The other comrades who didn’t know what was going on smiled too. It wasn’t a knowing smile. It was just a smile shared among men.","The female soldier, Azure Bird, was the beauty of their team. Q King had already said that he had to coax her first so that she would join their team. There was only one year left until Azure Bird graduated from the military school. When she graduated next year, she just needed to hurry up and report to the team.","The rain was falling. The car drove toward Covil in the rainy night. The water ghosts of the Storm Commando Brigade had also gone to bed early. Demon King Li Jinnian slept a long time later than them. He called Xia Jinyuan on the channel many times but didn’t get a reply. After knowing that everyone had turned off their communication, he closed his eyes. As for when he would fall asleep, Li Jinnian didn’t know.","When Ye Jian woke up, the truck had already driven out of the rainforest. Now, she felt as if she had fallen into a furnace. She was drenched in the rain, but she didn’t feel cold at all. Her hands and feet were warm. When she moved again, Ye Jian knew the reason.","She fell asleep with her head on Captain Xia’s shoulder. She had fallen asleep in his arms. No wonder she slept peacefully. When she opened her eyes, the sky was already bright.","She moved slightly, and the man who was hugging her woke up too. He had just woken up but knew who he was hugging. He kissed Ye Jian’s cheek and said gently, \"Good morning.\"","Both the kiss and morning came seamlessly. Ye Jian didn’t even have the chance to react or reject him before he finished kissing her.","The sky was bright, and there were comrades keeping guard. His kiss... Ye Jian raised her head and looked at who was keeping guard. She saw G3’s side profile and T6’s sly smile.","Although G3 was facing sideways, he was smiling too!","Needless to say, the two of them saw it.","Fortunately, it was the comrades who already knew about her relationship with Captain Xia. Ye Jian got up from his arms and straightened her body slightly. She was pulled back into his arms again. \"It’s still early. Sleep for a while more.\"","He just woke up, and his low and hoarse voice was extremely sexy. Ye Jian’s ears turned numb when she heard that. It was as if she had been electrocuted. At that moment, Ye Jian resigned herself to fate and was hugged by him.","Xia Jinyuan had always known his limits. No matter how reluctant he was, he let go of Ye Jian eventually. If he continued hugging her, all their comrades and the Chinese workers would see them.","The sky was already bright. The moment the special forces soldier woke up from their dreams, they were already wide awake.","A few Chinese workers, who had woken up, suggested getting out of the truck to solve their physiological needs. There were no problems nearby. The four trucks stopped. They were supposed to be vigilant while solving their physiological needs.","After Xia Jinyuan was done, he saw Ye Jian standing alone in the grass that was half the height of a human. She was looking east. No one knew what she was thinking.","The rain that had been falling since yesterday evening had stopped at some point in time. The sky was clear and blue, clean as a mirror. Even the air was exceptionally refreshing. It was so beautiful that it made people stop to admire the sight for a long time."]},{"number":4341,"title":"Chapter 4341: Sigh","paragraphs":["It was hard to tell that this piece of land had been destroyed by the flames of war in such a clean sky.","Looking at the sky, Ye Jian relaxed slightly and enjoyed the hard-earned peace in the flames of war.","\"It’s a sunny day today.\"","Xia Jinyuan, who was walking over, looked at the sky. When he heard footsteps, Ye Jian turned around and smiled at him. \"Yes, it’s a sunny day. The sky is beautiful. Just looking at it makes my heart feel calm.\"","\"The sky in Libya has always been beautiful, especially in the morning when it’s sunny. The sun will come out today. You can dry your clothes while sitting in the car.\"","This weather could indeed dry clothes. Xia Jinyuan didn’t say much. Letting their clothes dry while on their bodies was common. It was so common that it wasn’t worth mentioning.","Seeing that her camouflage uniform was a little messy, he naturally reached out to help Ye Jian tidy it up.","Her clothes had absorbed a little too much water. He pinched the fabric and sighed. \"Your equipment is really simple. I can’t bear to see it. I’ll talk to the Demon King later and let him make an application to the higher-ups.\"","Ye Jian pulled her tactical vest. It was still a little heavy, but she couldn’t take it off. She looked up at the man who was tidying her clothes. The blue sky was reflected in her dark eyes. It was like clear glass. Only Xia Jinyuan’s figure could be seen.","He lowered his head, and she raised her head. Naturally, he could see the subtle changes in her eyes and face. Her sparkling eyes could only accommodate his figure. It was as if she could not tolerate anything else. Xia Jinyuan, who did not stop what he was doing, felt his heart flutter.","His thin lips curved slightly. He controlled the urge to kiss her and tried his best to shift his attention away.","\"Now that they’ve taken the lead, there’ll be many such missions in the future. Their equipment can’t be too simple. Yesterday, Demon King Li told me that you only had a Type 95 rifle. At that time, he wanted you guys to go to the mine just like that. Were you all determined to die?\"","At the mention of this, Xia Jinyuan’s attention shifted. His handsome face was already cold.","Ye Jian had carried out a few overseas combats. She was much more well-equipped compared to this time.","However, their mission this time was different. They could only travel light. Seeing that Xia Jinyuan’s facial expression was so tense and even his chin was bruised from last night, she explained, \"This time, we received a mission that required us to travel light. We had to leave and turn back at the last minute to save the Chinese workers, so we weren’t well-equipped.","\"However, you can have a chat with my cousin. Our equipment can’t fall behind. We have to have everything.\"","She could also tell that the equipment of the Storm Commando Brigade was much worse than that of the Xueyu unit. If Captain Xia said that the water ghosts would often carry out missions outside in the future, then they needed to upgrade their equipment.","Seeing that his attire was a little messy and his tactical vest was crooked, Ye Jian helped him tidy up as she spoke.","It was normal for comrades to dress neatly. Even if others saw them, they wouldn’t think too much about it. Ye Jian was very natural and neat. Xia Jinyuan even raised his head slightly to make it easier for her.","\"The equipment in the country is still a little simple. Everything is still improving. Let’s take it one step at a time. One day, the entire army will have top-notch equipment like the Xueyu unit’s special forces. Our country’s strength and military power will increase many times.\"","Ye Jian, who was speaking, pulled his collar and adjusted his equipment. Then, she patted his shoulder. Not bad, he was a handsome male soldier. However... the bruise on his chin was an eyesore.","Last night’s collision had indeed hit his chin hard."]},{"number":4342,"title":"Chapter 4342: Blow","paragraphs":["They didn’t continue talking about equipment. If they continued, they would get further away from the topic.","The two of them squeezed out some time to talk alone. It was fine if they didn’t talk about these problems that wouldn’t be solved in a short time. They should talk about the two of them.","In the end, Xia Jinyuan patted Ye Jian’s head and sighed. \"Be good. You should fight with us in the future. I’m really worried about leaving you far away.","\"Last night, I wished I could fly a plane over directly. I even cursed the ancestors of my cousin-in-law’s grandpa.\"","Ye Jian smiled when she heard this. The ancestors of his cousin-in-law’s grandpa... Cough, Captain Xia was very clear. He was scolding the Li family.","\"After cursing, I realized how stupid I was being. No matter how rudimentary the equipment is, we cannot avoid going to the battlefield just because of our lacking equipment. We must be there when our country needs us. Otherwise, who will save the people?","\"I still believe in the combat ability of the water ghosts and the command ability of Demon King Li. It’s just that I was a little flustered at that time. I was afraid that something might happen.\"","Ye Jian felt a lump in her throat when she heard that. She lowered her head and rubbed her rifle with her fingers. Her gentle voice came along with the cool morning breeze. \"We’ve never thought of sending ourselves to our deaths. Cousin made a very thorough combat deployment. Although it was very dangerous, we could come back alive as long as we were careful.","\"I didn’t expect to suddenly receive a notice that you were coming over. They were happy, and I was the only one who was dumbfounded. For some reason, I felt guilty about being caught doing something bad.\"","As she spoke, she pursed her lips and smiled. Because she was happy, her eyes were bright and beautiful.","Xia Jinyuan couldn’t help but smile. \"You’re right. I’m here to catch you. I’ve only been gone for a few days, but you actually came to Libya to carry out a mission. You’re already an inter-soldier in combat.","\"Those water ghosts were so happy that they kept telling me that you’ll be part of their team in the future. When I heard them, I wanted to stuff grass into their mouths.","\"You’re clearly my person. How did you become a member of their team?\"","He was being a little petty. He referred to her as ’my person’, not even ’my soldier’.","She could hear the sweetness in his heart.","\"What do you mean by your person? I’m still a student.\" Ye Jian, whose heart was filled with sweetness, started to argue. She was obviously happy, but she pretended to be calm.","That sweet expression made Xia Jinyuan cover his thin lips with his fist and laugh. Why was his little fox so likable?","His laughter was a little loud. It affected his chin that was bruised by Ye Jian’s helmet last night. He appeared handsome for less than three seconds. Then, his handsome face twitched in pain. He couldn’t even smile anymore.","\"Don’t laugh. It’s already swollen.\" Ye Jian’s heart ached. If it wasn’t in the middle of the day and her comrades were far away, she would have gotten on her tiptoes to blow on his bruise for him.","\"Why? Do you want to blow on my bruise? My injuries are too serious. Just blowing is useless. It’ll only work if you kiss me. One time isn’t enough. It’s only possible to recover if you do it ten times.\"","She was very familiar with Captain Xia. He was always acting like a hooligan.","She didn’t kiss him and just glanced at him. Their time outside was over. They gathered and got into the truck.","The Chinese peacekeeping camp in the town of Covil had already been informed. The Chinese miners had also heard the good news and were all waiting in the camp."]},{"number":4343,"title":"Chapter 4343: Angry","paragraphs":["When the four trucks drove into the camp, cheers and applause sounded. When the peacekeeping soldiers carried the injured person in charge, Ding Gong, down to arrange for his surgery, the other Chinese workers were already in the arms of their compatriots.","Engineer Ding needed an emergency surgery. He only said, \"I’m fine.\" Then, he was sent away immediately. Whether his leg needed to be amputated or not... The decision was left to the doctor.","The medical equipment in the camp was complete. They could complete a large-scale surgery.","The 12 Chinese workers returned safely. Everyone in the country received the news and felt relieved.","Commander Dong of the navy said to Major General Yang, \"When they come back, I’ll have to come to the military to apply for military fees. Our equipment must be properly matched. If we continue to travel so lightly, I’ll be the first to disagree!\"","As the captain of the Storm Commando Brigade, Demon King Li naturally thought of the problem that Xia Jinyuan had considered. Before he returned to the country, he had already submitted his opinion. Soldiers had to be swift and decisive. How could they be delayed?","Commander Dong, who was in the country, ordered his soldiers to go to the battlefield lightly. His heart bled as he ordered them. It wasn’t easy for them to nurture a maritime special forces team. Every water ghost was the hope of expanding the special forces in the future. Sacrificing one was a huge loss!","But what could he do?","At that time, they were needed. Only they, who were preparing to return to the country, could save the 12 hostages.","Soldiers had to be maintained in the course of long years but had to be used in the nick of time. When they needed to go on the battlefield to kill their enemies, they had to do it bare-handed. There was no way out.","They went over. Now, all of them had retreated safely. After the navy commander finished speaking, he silently wiped the corners of his eyes with his hand.","All of them were alive. Very good, very good. It was really very good!","Major General Yang could understand the commander’s feelings at this moment. In the past, Xia Jinyuan brought a few soldiers who had never been on the battlefield out. As their boss, he didn’t sleep. He just stayed in the office and waited for them to call back.","When everyone returned safely, he felt as though all his energy had been sucked dry. He even secretly wiped the corners of his eyes.","\"Old Dong, stop wiping your eyes. They’re alright now. But it’s not safe in the campsite in Yeni. We have to let them make another trip.\"","\"Let them go again? No! I don’t agree! Think of a way yourself. Don’t even think about sending my soldiers over!\"","After wiping the corners of his eyes, the commander exploded.","What a joke!","They hadn’t even been given a chance to catch their breath after entering the camp. Why would they go out again?","No way!","What was the use of disagreeing, however?","It was useless.","When Commander Dong hung up the phone, the receiver was almost cracked by him. What was the use? He still had to carry out the order.","This time, they were just going to receive and not fight. It was much less dangerous than the previous two missions. The Chinese peacekeeping camp was being targeted by illegal militants. If it was really taken down by illegal militants, it would be a huge loss of face!","The government forces in Yeni could not hold on much longer. The peacekeeping forces in several countries in Yeni were retreating, and the Chinese peacekeeping camp was no exception.","When the news of Kulo Caesar’s assassination reached his cousin’s ears, it completely angered the leader of the illegal militants in Libya. He gathered his forces and attacked the capital of Libya directly, carrying out a carpet massacre of the government forces in Yeni.","Yeni was about to fall completely. The defeated government forces could only abandon the city and leave."]},{"number":4344,"title":"Chapter 4344: A Husband Sings, A Wife Follows","paragraphs":["The situation in Libya was getting more and more chaotic. Illegal militants were attacking the capital city of Libya, and NPFL militants were also attacking the government forces. The Libyan government, who was surrounded by enemies, asked the United Nations for help.","The weapons provided by a certain Western country to the illegal militants arrived at the port early. However, they realized that they couldn’t contact the mine that was controlled yesterday. They even lost contact with the six experts and four mercenaries.","The leader of the Western country who was in charge of this matter realized that there was a problem. As for what the problem was, they had no way of knowing.","In order to prevent the surviving illegal militants from leaking the news, the special forces of the Xueyu unit destroyed the communication channels and vehicles when they retreated. The survivors wanted to inform the higher-ups, but they had to walk out first.","It would take a long time to walk. How long would it take to walk more than a hundred kilometers?","By the time they walked out, it would be too late.","Realizing that something was wrong, the leader of the Western country asked the illegal militants who were cooperating with them to enquire about the situation. At the same time, the two special forces units were ordered to receive the Chinese peacekeeping forces who had retreated from Yeni.","With the help of the Russian side, the Chinese peacekeeping forces in Yeni once again repelled the illegal militants who were surrounding them. The British and Russian peacekeeping forces withdrew, and the Chinese side immediately started to retreat after the firefight ended.","The Russian peacekeeping soldiers didn’t leave. They needed to retreat to the town of Covil too. Naturally, they would follow the Chinese.","Lieutenant Colonel Zhu arranged for the wounded to get into the car first. Then, he arranged for the supplies to be transported. The soldiers in front would open the path, and the middle would provide cover. The back would be the retreat. They would complete their retreat at the fastest speed.","Including the two captains of the Xueyu unit and the Storm Commando Brigade, a total of 31 special forces soldiers only had time to change into their camouflage uniforms and grab a few buns. They didn’t even have half an hour of rest before jumping into the trucks to carry out their mission.","This time, they all went as peacekeeping soldiers. After getting into the trucks, they arranged for people to keep watch and took the time to rest. Ye Jian wasn’t in the same truck as Xia Jinyuan on this trip. She was currently fighting with the water ghosts of the Storm Commando Brigade and couldn’t leave the team casually.","Although Xia Jinyuan really wanted to get in the same truck as her, he had no choice.","He wasn’t Azure Bird’s captain now. His cousin-in-law, Demon King Li, was Azure Bird’s captain.","He personally sent Ye Jian to the truck. He was afraid that Ye Jian wouldn’t be able to get into the truck alone, so he jumped in first. Then, he reached out and pulled Ye Jian up. After pulling her up, he wasn’t in a hurry to get down. He said to the water ghosts in the car, \"Brothers, please take care of our team’s Azure Bird.\"","...","They really wanted to kick this guy who had a fake smile on his face and who was obviously up to no good!","Then, they looked at the Demon King Li who was standing below. His face was cold, and even his eyes seemed to be icy. The water ghosts pointed outside the truck, indicating for this thick-skinned comrade to communicate with their captain. They didn’t want him to stand here and be an eyesore.","Li Jinnian, who had yet to get into the truck, looked coldly at the arrogant fellow who had climbed into their truck like a host. He cleared his throat and asked calmly, \"You want to stall for time, right?\"","His cousin-in-law’s voice came from behind. Xia Jinyuan smiled and turned his head to take a look. Then, he said to Ye Jian, who couldn’t do anything, \"You’re a soldier I trained. When we arrive, you mustn’t embarrass me, your captain. Do you understand?\"","\"Understood!\"","Ye Jian was very cooperative and nodded seriously."]},{"number":4345,"title":"Chapter 4345: Heart Like A Rock","paragraphs":["How could she not cooperate?","Based on her understanding of Xia Jinyuan, if she didn’t cooperate now, she would be the one who would have a headache.","To save trouble, she might as well cooperate with him.","Also, he was the one who groomed her.","With Ye Jian’s cooperation, Xia Jinyuan, who felt comfortable all over, jumped down from the truck. His actions were straightforward and nimble. He was so handsome that Ye Jian smiled.","Seeing this, Li Jinnian didn’t want to talk anymore. He glanced at the fellow who was still standing in the same spot without leaving. He jumped into the truck and pulled up the tailgate. At the same time, he protected Ye Jian by his side.","Xia Jinyuan waved his hand and left in satisfaction.","Trying to snatch Azure Bird?","They were thinking too much.","Z7 saw him walking over and immediately retracted half of his body. He sat upright and waited for their captain to come over.","When he reached the car, Z7’s voice was just loud enough for his comrades in the car to hear. \"Brothers, we have to be careful. The brothers next door really like our team’s Azure Bird.\"","\"Don’t provoke Azure Bird. If she really goes to the Storm Commando Brigade in a fit of anger, it’ll be useless no matter how hard we cry.\"","Azure Bird was still a military school student. Even if she was from the army, it wasn’t impossible for her to cross ranks. Especially an outstanding female soldier like her. Who wouldn’t want her?","\"I’m not trying to scare you, but we have to be 120% vigilant.\" Z7 secretly glanced at Lieutenant Colonel Xia who was sitting in the middle and said this.","Xia Jinyuan knew that he was being teased when he glanced at Z7. Xia Jinyuan looked at him coldly with a smirk on his face, making Z7 panic.","His strong desire to live made him open his mouth immediately. In the eyes of their comrades, the situation took a huge turn. \"However, there’s no need to worry too much. We still have the captain. With the captain around, Azure Bird won’t be able to escape! Don’t you think so?!\"","Then, he turned around and said to Xia Jinyuan like a lapdog, \"Q King, I’m right, right? With you around, Azure Bird is part of our team!\"","Xia Jinyuan raised his hand and patted Z7’s head like a dog. He smiled and said, \"You’re really sensible. Don’t say such things that will shake the morale of the soldiers in the future. Since it’s your first offense, run 20 kilometers with weights. We’ll put it on the tab first until we return to the country.\"","Z7: \"...\"","He wanted to see the captain make a fool of himself, but in the end, the captain had taken revenge even before they returned to the country!","The comrades, who always liked to watch the show, criticized their captain for being unfair. Their morale had been shaken. How was 20 kilometers enough? It should be at least 30 kilometers.","In order to prove that he was a fair and impartial captain, Xia Jinyuan, who had always been democratic, sincerely accepted the criticism from his comrades. With a wave of his hand, he changed it to 30 kilometers.","Z7 protested angrily. What kind of comrades were they? He wanted to change teams!","With their protest, he now had to run 30 kilometers with weights!","With Z7’s liveliness, the atmosphere in the truck was very relaxed. The water ghosts were also very relaxed. They praised their team and even increased the benefits so that Ye Jian would be tempted to come to their team.","Li Jinnian just watched and didn’t say anything. He let the water ghosts persuade her.","It would not be bad if she joined their team. He could take care of his cousin more in the future.","The water ghosts saw that their captain was letting them persuade her. It was obvious that he wanted Azure Bird to stay too, so they persuaded her even more happily.","Ye Jian didn’t do anything. She just smiled and listened quietly. Occasionally, she would nod to show that she had been listening. 20 minutes later, the thirsty water ghosts stopped talking. Ye Jian continued smiling...","Their persuasion didn’t work. She remained calm and unmoved.","From then on, the water ghosts of Storm Commando Brigade never mentioned this matter again because they knew that it was impossible for Azure Bird to come to their team!"]},{"number":4346,"title":"Chapter 4346: How Is That Impossible","paragraphs":["The evacuation of the Chinese peacekeeping camp in Yeni was very smooth. The illegal militants gathered all their forces to fight with the government’s firearms. They vowed to take Yeni down and released a video on the Internet. They would rule this land and expel all those who opposed them and disobeyed them from Libya.","In the end, they recorded a video of illegal militants killing the government forces. The scene was immediately condemned by various countries.","Soon, the president of Libya also recorded a video and responded to the illegal militants with an extremely strong and resolute attitude. He also told the countries that the government forces had already killed the leader of the illegal militants, Kulo Caesar, and released a set of photos.","The photo was provided by the Xueyu unit.","Kulo Caesar was one of the leaders of the illegal militants. His death instantly caused huge waves and motivated the Libyan government forces. The soldiers were motivated and saw hope for a new life.","The video released by the president was a secret meeting held by a certain Western country that had been arming illegal militants. It was unknown what the content of the meeting was, but the weapons that were supposed to be provided a week later quietly retreated to the port. Obviously, the country had the intention of stopping their cooperation.","Kulo Caesar was killed by the Libyan government forces?","How was that possible?!","Kulo Caesar was not killed by the Libyan government forces. Instead, a certain country had secretly sent soldiers to solve a problem for the Libyan government.","Which country was it?","There was news from Port Saks. All their cameras didn’t capture who had infiltrated the basement of the ship and killed their great leader. There were no clues left at the event location. Even the bullets were made by NATO. There was no way to investigate.","The other party avoided the cameras and the covert sentries. They even successfully opened the locked hatch that led to the basement. They even successfully avoided the other set of cameras installed in the dark. Even the alarm device was useless!","No one knew when they infiltrated Port Saks. No one knew how they infiltrated the abandoned ship. No one knew how they deciphered the locks and successfully assassinated the guards.","It became a mystery that could not be solved.","It was precisely because of this that the Western country immediately realized that something was wrong. They stopped supplying firearms and quickly erased the transaction records.","After the assassination of Kulo Caesar, the country only temporarily stopped providing firearms. When they found out that the situation in the mine was bad and they had completely lost contact with the illegal militants, the country immediately cut off their contact with the illegal militants. They erased all records of their involvement.","At the same time, another secret meeting was held. It was aimed at finding out which country had helped Libya.","China was undoubtedly the biggest suspect. There was a heated discussion about whether China had the ability or not.","In a conference room in a strictly guarded building, about ten people were sitting in metal leather chairs with dark expressions. They had already quarreled, and all of them had serious expressions, making the atmosphere of the entire meeting extremely oppressive.","Someone pointed out that it was impossible because it was impossible for China to send peacekeeping soldiers to assassinate Kulo Caesar.","Some people suspected that China had secretly sent soldiers to support Libya.","Similarly, they were refuted. The reason was very simple. Until now, they had not discovered the existence of a military unit in China that was powerful enough to complete an assassination without leaving any traces."]},{"number":4347,"title":"Chapter 4347: Who Is It?","paragraphs":["The intense discussion was fruitless. It was not until they received news that the Chinese peacekeeping soldiers had successfully rescued the workers of the mine who were kidnapped by illegal militants that the fruitless argument finally came to an end.","The Chinese didn’t participate in the assassination of Kulo Caesar. Their focus was on rescuing the 12 Chinese workers who were kidnapped.","The topic of whether China had the ability ended.","Of course, they didn’t have the ability. How could they save the Chinese workers and assassinate Kulo Caesar at the same time?","So, which country was it?","Russia was the biggest suspect. Moreover, Russia had the ability to do it.","So what if Russia found out which country was supplying weapons to the illegal militants in Libya?","Where was the evidence?","There was no evidence. Even if they discovered it, it was just a discovery.","The illegal militants who were fighting happily with the Libyan government forces did not know that their firearms had been cut off. The first leader once again said that he would chase the president out of Libya within a month. He also said to Russia that he would make Russia pay a painful price.","Not many countries believed this.","He provoked the nations into war and even promised to make them pay a painful price. Wasn’t he afraid that his words would come back to bite him in the *ss? Where did he get his confidence from? One moment, he was declaring war on this country. The next moment, he was declaring war on that country.","The special forces soldiers who hadn’t received the Chinese soldiers from Yeni didn’t know what was happening internationally. Ye Jian, who was resting with her eyes closed, stretched her sore legs. As the truck swayed, she couldn’t help but yawn. Ye Jian gave up resisting and let herself have a good sleep.","She closed her eyes and turned off her earpiece. It would be embarrassing if all her comrades heard her talking in her sleep. She only turned off her mic and didn’t cut off the entire communication. She could still hear what was said in the channel.","Li Jinnian, who had his eyes closed too, felt a weight on his shoulder. He turned his head and saw that his cousin had already closed her eyes and fallen asleep. A smile flashed past his eyes. He adjusted his sitting position slightly so that Ye Jian could rest on him more comfortably.","The two units kept in contact. After driving for more than an hour, they finally met.","The moment the truck stopped, Ye Jian opened her eyes. The most familiar voice came from her earpiece, telling everyone to get off and gather.","Xia Jinyuan jumped down from the passenger seat as he spoke. They would wait here for the vehicles from the peacekeeping camp to drive over.","The comrades in the trucks alighted one by one and lined up neatly to wait for the vehicles from the peacekeeping camp to arrive.","About four minutes later, they heard the sound of a car engine in front of them. Then, a Jeep came over, followed by a truck.","There were a total of 16 vehicles in the peacekeeping camp. There were four Jeeps, three transport vehicles, two emergency vehicles, and the rest were trucks.","When they drove over, the special forces soldiers who had been lined up for four minutes immediately jumped back into the trucks. The first truck became the truck of the Xueyu unit. They led the way to the camp. The truck where the Storm Commando Brigade was was the last truck. They were in charge of guarding the rear.","They didn’t waste a minute. They returned to the town of Covil at their fastest speed.","Commander Dong of the navy knew that the meeting was very smooth and there were no twists and turns along the way. He finally felt relieved and said to Major General Yang, \"I can eat an extra bowl for dinner tonight!\"","Major General Yang couldn’t stop laughing. He said, \"Be careful. Don’t hurt your stomach!\"","Commander Dong replied, \"I’m willing to hurt my stomach as long as my soldiers can return safely.\""]},{"number":4348,"title":"Chapter 4348: A Cheap Shot","paragraphs":["It was 12 noon in Libya when the soldiers arrived at the small town of Covil. The two teams of special forces soldiers who had completed their mission could finally have a good rest. Xia Jinyuan got out of the truck and looked around. Then, he turned and looked at the convoy that was slowly driving into the camp. He narrowed his cold black eyes and said to V8, \"I’ll go and take a nap in front. Look for G3 for small matters. Look for Demon King Li for big matters. Find me in the channel for urgent matters.","\"Remember, don’t run over to look for me. I’m very tired now. I need to have a good sleep!\" To prove that he was really tired, he yawned several times in the blink of an eye.","T6 nodded in a daze and replied, \"Yes.\" When he came back to his senses, his captain had already strode toward the few trees that were most suitable for cooling down.","\"Is he really that tired? In the past, he couldn’t sleep well during the three days and three nights of combat, but he could still jump around. Why is he tired today? Is he getting old?\"","T6 muttered as he stared at the departing figure.","Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who had walked far away, didn’t hear him. He was contacting Ye Jian alone. There was no tiredness on his face. He was very energetic.","\"We have eight hours to rest. You must be tired. I found a good place. After you get out of the truck, shake off your cousin and come and look for me.\"","Ye Jian, who was sitting in the last truck, suddenly heard a man’s gentle voice from her earpiece. She secretly glanced at her cousin, who was sitting beside her, but she didn’t dare to say anything. She only lowered her voice and hummed a few times, indicating that she heard him and it wasn’t convenient for her to speak now.","Xia Jinyuan was amused when he heard that. He didn’t dare to speak. It felt like he was sitting with his cousin-in-law.","\"Get rid of Cousin-in-law. Don’t let him know. Come over once you get off the truck.\" He suppressed his smile and continued, \"If he finds out, he’s going to be all cruel again. I’m even more afraid of him than I am of Father-in-law.","\"It’s decided. After you come in, you’ll see three trees side by side behind the tent. I’ll occupy that place first. It’s very easy to find. If you really can’t find me, I’ll come and fetch you.\"","What could Ye Jian say? She couldn’t say anything. She couldn’t even hum in response. She was afraid that her cousin beside her would notice it.","Li Jinnian didn’t expect Xia Jinyuan to play a cheap shot right under his nose again. He remembered that they would get eight hours of rest after entering the camp. He needed to arrange for his cousin to find a bed to rest on in the infirmary.","He said, \"Wait for me after you get out of the truck. I’ll bring you to the infirmary to rest. Don’t squeeze with us.\"","Ye Jian, who was going to make a cheap shot later, almost choked on her own saliva when she heard that. She almost thought that her cousin really overheard their conversation.","Ye Jian swallowed her saliva. She wasn’t suited to do bad things. She smiled and said, \"There’s no need to go through so much trouble. I’m covered in dust. I shouldn’t dirty their beds. I’ll find a place to rest myself. There’s no need to specially make arrangements.\"","After she finished speaking, she took a deep breath and tried her best to look calm.","She didn’t know that Li Jinnian was frowning slightly. In the end, he didn’t say anything and nodded slightly. \"Alright. Don’t turn off the communication. I need to ensure that I can find you at any time.\"","\"Okay, I understand.\" Ye Jian smiled and nodded. That was a close call. She finally passed this round.","Xia Jinyuan had already walked to the shade of the trees when Ye Jian’s truck entered the camp.","Lieutenant Colonel Fang was talking to Lieutenant Colonel Zhu in the camp of the small town of Covil. They agreed to meet a captain with the surname Li later. As for Xia Jinyuan, they didn’t know that there was such a person. They didn’t know that there were actually two special forces units. The two people in charge of the camp thought that there was only one special forces unit."]},{"number":4349,"title":"Chapter 4349: Old Comrade","paragraphs":["It was precisely because Lieutenant Colonel Zhu and Lieutenant Colonel Fang didn’t know that there was another special forces unit that they went to look for Li Jinnian and didn’t disturb him.","The special forces soldiers of the Xueyu unit were like shadows. No one knew about them.","Li Jinnian got out of the truck and met the lieutenant colonels from the two camps. They exchanged a few words before getting busy. Lieutenant Colonel Zhu waited until Li Jinnian walked out of the tent before saying to Lieutenant Colonel Fang, \"Fortunately, we met them. If not, our two camps wouldn’t have been able to rescue the 12 workers in time.\"","\"When I found out that 12 Chinese workers had fallen into the hands of illegal militants, I was thinking about where I should transfer people to rescue them...\"","At the mention of the Chinese workers being kidnapped, Lieutenant Colonel Zhu’s heart started beating fast. \"I was really worried at that time. Fortunately, they came to solve the problem and saved everyone.\"","Lieutenant Colonel Fang nodded. \"That’s true. The situation in Libya is too chaotic now. We can’t let anything happen on our side.\"","\"Lieutenant Colonel Nikita from Russia has called. Next, we will guard the two camps together until the illegal militants retreat.\"","\"What are your arrangements for the Russian peacekeeping soldiers? Are you going to drive them back to the Russian camp or are they going to stay?\"","\"After a short rest, they’ll return to the Russian camp. There’s no need to send a truck. They have their own truck. Oh right, do we have any ready-made steamed buns in the cafeteria? Let them bring 50 of them back.\"","Lieutenant Colonel Fang laughed involuntarily. \"The thank-you gift is two bags of steamed buns?\"","\"Yes, it’s a thank-you gift. They all like steamed buns.\" Lieutenant Colonel Zhu smiled too. As all the difficult problems were solved, the smile on his face got bigger. \"Each of them can eat three in one go. 50 steamed buns is enough for them to eat two meals.\"","\"This gift is quite unique. We don’t have any ready-made ones. Let the cooking team handle it.\"","\"Okay, I’ll go and take a look at the injured first.\"","Lieutenant Colonel Fang stood up too. \"Come, let’s go take a look. I’ll leave the supplies to you. You still have to arrange for the soldiers to be on guard. Arrange everything you need to.","\"The situation is uncertain now. Covil is not affected by the flames of war, but it’s hard to say if it will be affected in the future.\"","As Lieutenant Colonel Fang spoke, he walked out of the tent with Lieutenant Colonel Zhu. As the people in charge of the camp, they didn’t have much rest time. Everything needed to be arranged properly.","They didn’t care about the special forces soldiers who had entered the camp to rest. The military called, and the soldiers of the special forces would follow the arrangements made by their captains. They would leave the camp eight hours later and return to the country.","The special forces soldiers who had been fighting continuously got out of the trucks and didn’t even have lunch. One by one, they crawled into the tent and found a random spot. They hugged their guns and lay on the ground. In less than three minutes, they fell asleep.","Ye Jian didn’t enter the tent to sleep. Instead, she walked around the tent and walked toward the three trees that Xia Jinyuan had told her about.","Before she got close, she saw Xia Jinyuan talking to a tall and big man from afar. One look and she knew that he was a foreign soldier.","The foreign soldier was none other than Luke, who had been with Xia Jinyuan for a year and a half.","Luke, who was from the Signal Flag, had helped the Chinese peacekeeping camp to defeat the illegal militants this morning. He looked as if he had seen a ghost. His light brown eyes were about to fall out of their sockets.","Xia! He didn’t see wrongly. The Chinese soldier in front of him was... Xia!"]},{"number":4350,"title":"Chapter 4350: So Angry","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan looked at Luke, whose eyes were about to fall out. He wanted to look away silently and pretend that he didn’t know him!","However, that was impossible.","This fellow obviously recognized him, which was why he looked as if he had seen a ghost.","Looking at the blue helmet that represented the peacekeeping soldiers, Xia Jinyuan felt that he didn’t have to pretend not to know Luke.","Xia Jinyuan took the initiative to take a step forward. He smiled calmly and said, \"Long time no see, Luke.\"","...","Luke’s eyes widened a few more times. He knew that he wasn’t mistaken. He knew that this was Xia, the guy he had spent half a month searching for but to no avail!","\"The sun is a little hot. We can sit under the shade of the trees and chat.\" Xia Jinyuan took the initiative to invite his old friend to have a heart-to-heart chat. There was no guilt in his eyes.","Luke gritted his teeth. That was right, they needed to have a good chat. They needed to talk about how Xia became a Chinese soldier!","Luke, who was striding forward, stepped heavily on the yellow muddied grass. It had rained the entire night last night.","There was a waterproof mat under the shade of the trees. Luke, who was biting his cheek, was frustrated. When he walked over, he deliberately bumped Xia Jinyuan’s shoulder with his shoulder. Only then did he feel at ease!","In order to find this hypocrite and confirm if he was still alive, he almost died in the hotel!","Look, look, he could still laugh at this moment!","F*ck!","He really wanted to fight now. He wanted to beat up this fellow who could still laugh!","The anger in his heart was burning. He stomped his feet and walked to the shade of the trees. He squatted on the waterproof mat and glared at the guy who was not in a hurry at all. He even strolled as if he was admiring the scenery. Luke felt an itch in his fist, and he wanted to swing it!","Xia Jinyuan didn’t expect to meet an old friend in the Chinese peacekeeping camp. He knew that Russia had sent peacekeeping soldiers to support the Chinese camp, but he didn’t know that the soldiers sent by Russia were special forces soldiers from Signal Flag.","One of them was even someone he knew!","He actually met Luke in Libya. He didn’t even have time to dodge.","\"You’re a Chinese soldier.\" Luke opened his mouth. His voice was cold. He didn’t smile like when he was in Molaban. \"You shot Cobra. You came to kill Cobra.\"","He spoke with certainty?","Was there a need to doubt it?","There was no need for that!","His attire and identity were enough to prove everything.","Luke was a special forces soldier from Signal Flag. Even though he was sitting and looking up, his killing intent didn’t diminish at all. He stared at Xia Jinyuan with cold light brown eyes. Even the sun above his head couldn’t hinder his sharp gaze.","Facing the imposing Luke, Xia Jinyuan smiled and walked over.","Seeing that Luke was angry, he smiled and patted his former partner’s shoulder comfortingly. \"Luke, I didn’t expect you to not get the hints I gave you in the past.","\"I reminded you many times that I wasn’t as loyal to Cobra as you had seen. However, you never believed me.","\"Alas, buddy, why did you think I told you everything about Cobra’s trip to the hotel? I answered whatever you asked me. Did you think I was so cooperative because we had a good relationship?\""]},{"number":4351,"title":"Chapter 4351: I Want To Fight","paragraphs":["Luke knew how dark his expression was at this moment.","That was right. Why didn’t he think of that?","Thinking about it now, he was really stupid!","Xia Jinyuan sighed the entire time. Along the way, he didn’t forget to give Ye Jian a wait sign. \"I thought you would suspect me, but I didn’t expect you to think that I revealed Cobra’s whereabouts to you just because we were good partners.\"","With every sentence he said, Luke’s expression darkened. By the time he finished speaking, Luke looked like he had swallowed a bitter pill. \"So, are you saying that I’m stupid?\"","As he thought about this, Luke slowly clenched his fists.","This fellow was right!","With Xia’s cautious personality, how could he have answered whatever he asked?","If Xia was loyal to Cobra, he would definitely keep Cobra’s schedule a secret. Even if Luke was his partner, Xia would not reveal anything.","At that time... how could he be so stupid as to think that everything was because of their good relationship?","Deep in his heart, Luke thought that he was extraordinarily stupid at that time.","\"Also, you speak the truth when you’re drunk. At that time, you said a few things that I didn’t understand. I also told you about this, but unfortunately, you didn’t get the hint at that time.","\"You’re only supposed to know one language. After drinking, you said a few words that I didn’t understand. With my loyalty to Cobra, why didn’t I tell him?","\"That’s because I purposely hid it for you. Why would I purposely keep a secret for you? That’s because we have the same goal. There’s no need to kill each other.\"","Xia Jinyuan continued speaking. The corners of Luke’s mouth kept twitching. Xia even patted his shoulder from time to time. Luke felt that he had lost his dignity.","He glared at the hand that was still on his shoulder. His expression was so dark that it was expressionless. He gritted his teeth and said, \"I hate it when people pat my shoulder now!\"","\"In the past, you liked to pat my shoulder.\" Xia Jinyuan retracted his hand and smiled. \"I’m just learning from you.\"","Luke’s eyes widened, and his chest heaved with anger.","Was this playful fellow who was laughing like a street gangster still the Xia he knew?","It did not seem to be the case at all!","In the past, Xia Jinyuan was cold and serious. Luke always teased him for being impotent. Xia had never been interested in a woman.","The words that Xia Jinyuan said now made him very angry. Even his laughter made Luke want to beat him up!","\"You knew my identity when we went to Myanmar, right? You can understand Russian, right? So, you’ve always known my identity, but I never knew yours.\"","Luke held his breath. He really felt as stupid as a donkey!","\"Smart. You got everything right. Unfortunately, there’s no wine here. If not, I really want to drink to celebrate!\"","\"Thank you for your compliment! But I don’t want to celebrate with you! I just want to beat you up now!\" Luke waved his fist and gritted his teeth. \"You knew everything, but I didn’t. In the end, I almost died in the hotel to look for you. You hypocrite, you deceived my feelings!\"","...","Luke gritted his teeth and growled at the last sentence. He shouted so loudly that Ye Jian, who was walking over slowly, heard him. She heard him say, \"You hypocrite, you deceived my feelings.\" She tripped and almost sprained her ankle.","Captain Xia... deceived a man’s feelings?","How did he do that?","Ye Jian, who was quite interested, decided to listen carefully and not disturb them for the time being."]},{"number":4352,"title":"Chapter 4352: Fun","paragraphs":["It couldn’t be helped. To admit that one was stupid required a certain amount of courage.","And Luke didn’t have the courage.","He could only be angry at himself.","It was fine that he was angry. He just had to accept reality.","Luke, who had angered himself, stopped talking. In the end, he closed his eyes and laid on the waterproof mat. He ignored Xia Jinyuan and took a deep breath.","Xia Jinyuan wouldn’t specially comfort him again. Ye Jian was the only one who could make him explain again and again.","He had said everything he needed to say to Luke. He had given him enough hints back then, but Luke... he didn’t notice them. When Luke retracted the net, he was a little anxious. He only wanted to return to his motherland as soon as possible after six years and didn’t care about the details. If Xia Jinyuan hadn’t secretly helped to erase some traces, with Cobra’s cautiousness, he might have suspected Luke.","Ye Jian was still waiting to hear how her Captain Xia had deceived a man’s feelings. However, after the other party lay down, he didn’t say anything for a long time.","Lieutenant Colonel Xia smiled and suddenly felt that something was wrong.","His girlfriend was standing not far away. Over here, a man was gritting his teeth at him and accusing him of deceiving his feelings. Lieutenant Colonel Xia slowly raised his eyes and looked at his girlfriend...","Ye Jian had been waiting for this moment. When she saw him turning, her beautiful face had already turned cold. Even her dark eyes were shining with a cold light. When the sun shone on her, she appeared so cold that Lieutenant Colonel Xia shivered.","Unable to care about the big guy in front of him, Lieutenant Colonel Xia immediately turned on his earpiece and explained in an anxious tone, \"Little fox, don’t listen to his nonsense. I have nothing to do with him. We once worked together. You know about Cobra, right? I put myself in harm’s way to gain Cobra’s trust. After you left, this fellow saved me.\"","It was a misunderstanding. There was no relationship between him and Luke beyond friendship!","He couldn’t let Ye Jian come over, but he couldn’t get rid of Luke for the time being. He didn’t care about the big man who was lying still. He could only hurry up and clear his name first.","\"He thought that I was dead, and he didn’t expect to see me here again. He’s angry at himself for being stupid. Find a place to rest first. I’ll come and look for you after I send him away.\"","He needed to explain clearly. He didn’t want to be accused of deceiving a man!","Ye Jian, who was laughing in her heart, didn’t show it on her face at all. Ha, in the past, he was the one teasing her. This time, it was her turn to return the favor!","Courtesy demanded reciprocity!","\"Explaining to me like this means you have something to conceal. It looks like you still have many personal secrets that I don’t know about. That’s good too. I’ll wait for you to look for me.\"","Ye Jian said calmly. She was so calm that Xia Jinyuan couldn’t tell if she was really angry or faking it.","\"I’ll leave first. Take care of the things here yourself.\"","Although she wanted to tease him, she was still worried that there would be a problem now that he had suddenly met someone he knew. Before she turned around and left, Ye Jian couldn’t help but ask about him.","Sensing her concern, the smart Xia Jinyuan heaved a sigh of relief. \"There’s no problem. We were both undercover. It’s okay. Be good. I’ll come over later and explain it to you in detail. Go and rest. Don’t stand under the sun.\"","Hearing his nervousness, Ye Jian laughed in her heart.","’Hahaha, Captain Xia, to think that you would have such a day!’"]},{"number":4353,"title":"Chapter 4353: Strength And Intelligence","paragraphs":["Ye Jian, who was smiling behind his back, left. She needed to find a place to rest. Her stomach was a little uncomfortable. It was about time that she got her period.","Fortunately, her body could withstand it. Besides feeling a little uncomfortable, there were no other reactions.","After watching Ye Jian leave, Xia Jinyuan sat down cross-legged and said to Luke, who still had his eyes closed. \"Although Cobra is dead, his influence hasn’t dissipated. I know that your Signal Flag is still in action. You’ve been with Cobra for six years. It’s best not to enter Molaban, in case you’re recognized.","\"I’m the same as you. I’m a soldier who snuck in to get rid of Cobra. You have your responsibilities, and I have mine. We’re loyal to our respective countries. Even if I know some things, I can’t verify them with you.","\"If I really said that I knew that you were a Signal Flag soldier, would you have chosen to cooperate with me? Or would you have shot me? You would’ve chosen the latter. I didn’t go over to let you shoot me. I needed to do my job.\"","As a soldier, Luke understood. It was just that he couldn’t accept it for a while... He actually hadn’t noticed anything!","During the week when he closed the net and found nothing, Xia must have spent every moment teasing him!","Damn it!","Luke cursed softly and finally opened his eyes again. \"You hid too well. I really didn’t notice anything wrong with you. Xia, your disguise successfully fooled everyone.\"","\"Your disguise successfully fooled everyone as well,\" Xia Jinyuan replied with a smile.","Luke glared at him. \"But I didn’t lie to you!\"","\"That’s because you drank too much wine while hugging a beauty. I advised you to drink less wine so that you wouldn’t embarrass yourself. Unfortunately, you didn’t listen.\"","\"Shit!\"","Luke wasn’t someone who knew how to curse. He kept repeating the same word. His fist hit the waterproof mat, leaving a fist mark that slowly disappeared. Luke wiped his face and stared at Xia Jinyuan. \"How did you leave the hotel after that?\"","\"I snuck into the hotel and left in a car.\"","Xia Jinyuan didn’t say that he left in Qin Xiu’s car. There was no need to pull Qin Xiu in.","The sun was scorching hot, but there was a slight breeze. Sitting under the shade of the trees, the breeze blew past them. It wasn’t very hot. A leaf fell quietly and landed lightly on Luke’s shoulder.","Xia Jinyuan reached out his hand and brushed away the fallen leaves. He said sincerely, \"Luke, thank you for your help in the past. I apologize for hiding my identity from you in the past. If I had to choose again, I would still choose to do the same thing considering my identity as a Chinese soldier.","\"I think you can understand this.\"","The fallen leaves were twirled between his fingers. His slender fingers were a little thin, but they were filled with strength. Luke stared at them. The scene of the hotel where Cobra collapsed that day flashed past his mind...","It was these hands that killed Cobra with one shot.","He fired decisively, not giving Cobra a chance to live.","\"You didn’t want us to bring Cobra back to Russia, did you?\" Luke asked.","\"Of course. He was a dangerous fellow. As long as he was alive, everything would be filled with variables. Only when he was dead would the ending be true.\"","Luke’s gaze was locked. He pressed on, \"You knew that we wanted to bring him back to Russia, right?\"","Xia Jinyuan raised his eyebrows and replied calmly, \"I just wanted to kill him so that I could return to the country as soon as possible.\" As for knowing Russia’s plan, was it important?","It wasn’t important."]},{"number":4354,"title":"Chapter 4354: Everyone Has Their Own Duties","paragraphs":["Luke looked at his former partner and didn’t speak for a long time.","Xia was right.","Xia’s mission was to kill Cobra. As a soldier, he was only carrying out his mission. As long as his mission was completed, what did the plans of other countries have to do with him?","It had nothing to do with him.","Xia was loyal to his country. The matters of other countries had nothing to do with him.","Xia knew that Russia wanted to bring Cobra back, but so what?","The Russian decision couldn’t affect him or influence him.","Also, Luke wasn’t angry because Xia killed Cobra. He was angry because... Damn it! He was fooled by Xia Jinyuan and never once suspected his identity.","This was a big blow to his intelligence!","Hence, he was furious!","Luke’s anger gradually disappeared. He finally accepted the fact that he was inferior.","He had already lost his reputation. No matter how angry he was, he had to accept reality!","Damn it, damn it! He really wanted to smoke a cigarette and drink a glass of whiskey now. He wanted to blow smoke rings as he faced reality.","But to face reality like this...","He had to regain some reputation. Luke stared at his shameless old partner and revealed a fake smile. \"You’re impotent and aloof. You don’t like women, but you must really like men, right?\"","\"My girlfriend is outstanding. Do you think I’ll be impotent and frigid?\"","Xia Jinyuan, who saw through his plan, smiled and replied. Luke looked as though he had eaten an entire lemon. He felt his throat and chest hurt!","He felt that he needed to end this unpleasant conversation!","The topic changed. Luke said in a low voice, \"Cobra died, but it’s not over. We received the latest information that a very young man has started to interact with a senior officer from Myanmar. Xia, our mission hasn’t ended completely. It’s still ongoing. Maybe one day, we’ll work together again.","\"I look forward to working with you again. I believe we’ll have another chance to come into contact with each other.\"","There was a country behind Cobra. When Cobra died, the country behind him would groom a new successor. Xia Jinyuan didn’t find it strange.","It was normal.","Spy warfare had always existed.","\"I look forward to working with you next time too.\"","\"Aren’t you going to thank me for providing you with information? Does your country know that someone has started dealing with Myanmar officers?\"","\"We’re always paying attention to the movements of those on the blacklist.\" Xia Jinyuan smiled casually as if he already knew.","Luke took a deep breath and sized up Xia Jinyuan seriously. After a few times, Luke finally asked the question he had been holding in, \"Xia, you’re very different from the person I thought I knew. Which one is the real you?\"","The Xia Luke knew was silent and cold. He liked to come and go alone. He didn’t like to talk and didn’t like to get too close to others. He was very violent. Every time he fired his gun, he was the fiercest and killed the most people. Most importantly, Luke was always the one who teased Xia until the latter couldn’t take it anymore.","But now, it was Xia’s words that made him very angry. He wasn’t silent, nor was he cold. He looked like he liked to smile, but when he smiled, he looked like a bastard! Most importantly, it was Luke’s turn to be teased by him until he wanted to escape!","Luke finally asked the biggest question in his heart. He felt that his breathing was much smoother. It was too uncomfortable holding it in!"]},{"number":4355,"title":"Chapter 4355 - 4354","paragraphs":["Hearing this, Xia Jinyuan raised his slender eyebrows. The smile on his handsome face that was covered by paint deepened. \"One is me on a mission, and the other is me who’s relaxed. They’re both me. There’s no difference.\"","...","\"You’re a very cunning fellow!\" Luke gritted his teeth again. Getting this answer was equivalent to not getting an answer. However, there was nothing he could do.","No matter how cunning this guy was, Luke couldn’t hate him!","It was getting late. Luke, who still had to return to the Russian camp, stood up. Although his teeth were gritted together, there was a smile in his eyes. \"If there’s a chance, I’ll definitely get you drunk!","\"Cunning fellow! Why did I become friends with a cunning fellow? Anyway, goodbye!\"","Luke was still the same Luke. Although their identities and positions had changed, it didn’t affect the friendship between Luke and Xia Jinyuan. Even though they had their own goals at that time, they had interacted for a year and a half and went through life and death together. They had long accumulated a deep friendship. At the end of the day, however, their identities were different. No matter how deep their friendship was, there had to be a limit.","Xia Jinyuan stood up and sent him off, watching until Luke and his comrades left.","The ten people sent by Russia were not all special forces soldiers from Signal Flag. There were only three special forces soldiers from Signal Flag. The rest were real peacekeeping soldiers.","On the other hand, Luke and the rest didn’t realize that there were two soldiers from the special forces units hiding in the Chinese camp. The real peacekeeping soldiers were disguised as employees of the Chinese mine. There were as many real peacekeepers disguised as employees as there were special forces soldiers.","Luke had only stayed at the Chinese camp for less than an hour. It would be difficult to make the discovery.","After sending Luke off, Xia Jinyuan immediately came to look for Ye Jian. He had to settle this properly. However, he realized that... he couldn’t find Ye Jian. He asked his comrades in the team but they didn’t know where Ye Jian went.","Xia Jinyuan found his cousin-in-law. Unfortunately, his cousin-in-law didn’t tell him where Ye Jian was resting and even pulled him to work.","There was news from the military. Due to the problem with Yeni, the transport plane couldn’t enter the small town of Covil, which belonged to Yeni. The special forces soldiers who had retreated to the country had to drive to the Keko Prefecture, where planes were currently allowed to fly.","Keko Prefecture was more than 200 kilometers away from the town of Covil.","Evacuating safely was another big problem.","Lieutenant Colonel Zhu looked at Keko Prefecture on the map and said to Li Jinnian, \"226 kilometers. In the middle, we need to pass through three crossfire points between the government forces and the illegal militants. We can provide a truck, but... we really can’t provide any more armed forces.\"","The town of Covil, which was the closest to Yeni, could end up like Yeni at any time. China had also been sneak-attacked twice by illegal militants. Lieutenant Colonel Zhu and Lieutenant Colonel Fang were very worried that there would be another exchange of fire.","Hence, they needed to ensure the ammunition capacity of the peacekeeping camp.","Li Jinnian looked at Xia Jinyuan secretly and said calmly, \"We only need a truck. We’ll settle the rest ourselves.","\"In addition to the truck, you need to provide us with a barrel of petrol.\"","Lieutenant Colonel Fang nodded. \"It’s just a small matter. There’s no problem at all.\" His gaze landed on the military map again. He frowned and said in a low voice, \"If you need to go to Keko Prefecture, you won’t be able to have eight hours of rest.\"","They needed to pass through three crossfire points. There were still unknown dangers along the way. It would take about three hours to drive 226 kilometers at a normal speed. If there were any twists and turns in the middle... The earlier they departed, the more flexible they could be with their time."]},{"number":4356,"title":"Chapter 4356 - 4355","paragraphs":["The special forces soldiers, who had rested for less than an hour in the camp of the Chinese town of Covil, set off again. This time, they only needed to take care of themselves and reach Keko Prefecture safely.","As such, even the special forces soldiers who were not resting looked relaxed.","Xia Jinyuan found Ye Jian in the cafeteria. She was hugging her gun and sitting in a corner of the cafeteria. She had fallen asleep with a slight frown on her face.","Seeing that she was sleeping soundly, Xia Jinyuan couldn’t bear to disturb her.","However, they were about to leave, so he had to wake her up.","Ye Jian woke up very quickly. Before Xia Jinyuan could get close, she suddenly opened her eyes. Her gaze was as cold as an arrow as she looked at the approaching man.","After seeing who it was, Ye Jian closed her eyes again. Even her unnatural frown disappeared. There was a faint smile on her face.","So it was Captain Xia. She could continue sleeping.","Her affectionate actions made Xia Jinyuan sigh softly. He knelt on one knee and half-squatted in front of her. His gaze was filled with gentleness.","Her hair was a little long. A few strands of black hair covered her eyes playfully. Xia Jinyuan reached out his hand and brushed away the strands of hair with his slender fingers, revealing her full and delicate forehead.","Just like him, in order to hide her true appearance, she didn’t even wipe away the paint on her face. She was a female soldier and would attract more attention. Before she reached the camp, she specially put on a layer of paint. Now, the paint on her face was so thick that one could leave marks on the surface.","His slender fingers tucked her hair away and slowly brushed across her face reluctantly. His fingers were warm, and there were traces of love on his fingertips. Ye Jian, who felt his gentleness, couldn’t help but tilt her head and rub against his fingers gently. She was like a bird that was greedy for his gentleness and couldn’t bear to leave.","Xia Jinyuan, who was half-squatting on one knee, slowly leaned forward and kissed Ye Jian’s forehead gently. He didn’t leave immediately. Instead, he stuck close to her...","Ye Jian, who had her eyes closed, raised her hand and touched his face accurately. She asked in a low voice, \"Is everything settled?\"","As she asked, Xia Jinyuan raised his head and ended the loving kiss. \"Yes, it’s settled.\"","\"It’s good that things are fine. Aren’t you going to sleep? The cafeteria is quiet and empty. You can sleep for a while.\" Ye Jian had just woken up. She was tired, so her voice was low. It was obvious that she wanted to continue sleeping.","Xia Jinyuan, whose fingers were still touching her cheek, felt his heart ache. He kissed her forehead again, then her nose bridge. Occasionally, his lips would land on hers. His lips were very soft and gentle as he sucked on her lips.","\"We can’t sleep anymore. The transport plane can’t enter Yeni. We need to go to Keko Prefecture 226 kilometers away. We have to leave. We’ll sleep in the vehicle, okay?\"","The transport plane couldn’t enter Yeni, so they needed to go to Keko Prefecture.","Ye Jian’s sleepy mind suddenly woke up. She didn’t close her eyes anymore and stared at the man who had just kissed her. \"Have you gathered the rest?\"","\"Not yet. There are still five minutes left.\"","After ending the intimate moment, Xia Jinyuan stood up first and reached out his hand. He looked at her gently with his dark eyes. \"You can sleep in the vehicle. If you’re lucky, you can sleep all the way to Keko.\"","Ye Jian grabbed his hand and stood up. She smiled and said, \"That’s impossible. Keko is more than 200 kilometers away from us. The entire Libya is in chaos now.\""]},{"number":4357,"title":"Chapter 4357: I Like You","paragraphs":["Hence, Ye Jian could tell that he was comforting her so that she could relax and not be tense all the time.","Ye Jian had never relaxed in this war-torn country. In an environment where bullets were constantly coming from an unknown direction, it was difficult to relax.","Xia Jinyuan always knew that his girlfriend was smart. He couldn’t hide what he wanted to hide from her. It didn’t matter if he couldn’t hide it. She knew why he brushed it off. She knew him and understood him.","Ye Jian seemed to have thought of something. She slowly pulled her hand out of Xia Jinyuan’s hand. Then, she raised her eyebrows slightly. There was a faint smile in her eyes, but it gave off a chilliness.","The atmosphere suddenly changed. Xia Jinyuan felt a chill on the back of his neck.","He thought that... she wouldn’t settle scores with him even after sleeping. In the end! In the end... he was too naive.","How could he not understand the little fox’s personality?","If there was hatred, there would be revenge. If there was gratitude, there would be repayment.","Now, she was here to even the score.","\"You took advantage of a man’s feelings. Captain Xia, it looks like you led a rich private life during your time away.\" Ye Jian raised her eyebrows and spoke slowly. She enunciated each word clearly. Lieutenant Colonel Xia’s back was already drenched in cold sweat.","Who was Lieutenant Colonel Xia? He was a man who wouldn’t blink even if a mountain were to collapse in front of him. Hearing that, he held Ye Jian’s hand again. He exerted some force and didn’t let her break free from his hand. He held it tightly. Their skin touched, and they could feel each other’s body temperature.","His dark eyes, which were as deep as the sea, stared at Ye Jian without blinking. His sexy thin lips slowly curled up, and a smile slowly glinted in his eyes. The sense of lingering love slowly surrounded Ye Jian.","\"Don’t you know whether that’s true or not? I’ve been away for more than a year, but I’ve been guarding my chastity and waiting for you to inspect my goods.","\"Little fox, if you’re really suspicious, why don’t you check the goods after we return to the country?\"","...","In terms of shamelessness, Ye Jian had never won against Lieutenant Colonel Xia.","It wasn’t easy for him to retaliate, but in the end, he retaliated.","Chastity?","Why was he so shameless when he said this?","However, Ye Jian had learned from Lieutenant Colonel Xia. Ye Jian’s ears were a little red, but she sighed and said, \"Captain Xia, did you make use of that man’s feelings for you?\"","Xia Jinyuan started coughing.","He thought that if he used his ultimate move, the shy woman would definitely blush and retreat step by step. In the end, she would admit defeat and never mention it again.","Unexpectedly... she brought up the topic once more.","Impressive...","The little fox was turning into a big fox. She was getting smarter and harder to deal with. He... liked her a lot!","Then, he looked at her appearance. The corners of her mouth were curled up, and her eyes were slightly narrowed. There was a smile at the corners of her eyes. She looked like a big fox that had done something bad.","The little fox had become a big fox. How worrying.","\"Friendship is also a kind of relationship. That fellow always thought that his IQ was higher than mine. In the end, not only did I expose his identity, but I also silently got him to do things without him knowing. However, he didn’t notice anything and even thought that I was stupid.\"","At the mention of the past, Xia Jinyuan thought of the angry Luke. The smile on his face was really evil. Ye Jian pursed her lips and smiled. Captain Xia was very confident and calm. She liked him very much."]},{"number":4358,"title":"Chapter 4358: Afraid Of His Wife’s Glory","paragraphs":["What should Ye Jian do? Every time they reunited, she didn’t feel distant. Instead, she fell more in love with him...","Unknowingly, Ye Jian looked at Xia Jinyuan with admiration.","She liked Lieutenant Colonel Xia and admired the man she loved deeply.","Lieutenant Colonel Xia was extremely satisfied with being admired by the woman he loved deeply. His slender fingers even rubbed her palm affectionately. Seeing that Ye Jian retracted her hand from the ticklish sensation, the smile on Lieutenant Colonel Xia’s face deepened.","Her face was covered with paint, but her ears had turned red.","His face was too handsome!","Who didn’t like handsome people? Ye Jian was no exception.","Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who was enjoying his girlfriend’s admiration, held her hand and walked out of the cafeteria. His deep voice was pleasant and sexy.","\"Now, he finally understands that it’s not me who’s stupid but him. His self-esteem took a great blow, and his reputation was ruined. In his embarrassment and anger, he said something that could easily be misunderstood.","\"Coincidentally, you heard that sentence. Bully him? He just realized that he’s the stupid one. As a man, his self-esteem was hurt. He couldn’t accept it.","\"When he left, he was even gritting his teeth. Alas, it’s indeed difficult to admit that one’s IQ is inferior to another.\"","At this moment, Ye Jian sympathized with Luke.","She knew the two-faced Captain Xia, who had a high IQ. She expressed her condolences to the special forces soldiers from Signal Flag.","In the past, she was suppressed by Captain Xia’s intelligence as well. She was caught off guard and was eventually taken down by him...","Just as they were about to walk out of the cafeteria, Ye Jian stopped in her tracks and looked at the man beside her with her dark eyes. Ye Jian said worriedly, \"Captain Xia, if you continue to be so annoying, someone might put you in a sack!\"","It was really possible!","The comrades in the Xueyu unit had said such harsh words. They wanted to drag their captain to a corner and beat him up.","Hearing this, Lieutenant Colonel Xia grinned, revealing his white and neat teeth. \"Before that, I’ll teach them a lesson until their knees turn weak whenever they see me.\"","He had white teeth and a fierce smile. He was no different from the ferocious beast in the mountains. Ye Jian shut up silently.","When she stopped mentioning Luke, Lieutenant Colonel Xia’s back finally stopped sweating.","He wasn’t afraid of Luke’s claim of him taking advantage of his feelings. He was afraid that the little fox, who had turned into a big fox, would find out... he was often dragged to various places by Luke to drink.","Although he only drank and did not do anything bad, he still felt guilty and short of breath.","Afraid that Luke would say some inappropriate things, he quickly coaxed the big fox to leave.","Fortunately, he was smart and coaxed the big fox away.","Fortunately, he passed the test successfully, and the big fox didn’t probe further.","After walking out of the cafeteria, Lieutenant Colonel Xia let go of Ye Jian’s hand and secretly wiped his sweat. In the future, he could not even take half a step into a bar! If he provoked the increasingly powerful big fox, he was really afraid that with her personality, she would cut him from her world with one slash. Then, he wouldn’t even have a place to cry!","The men of the Xia family were afraid of their wives. It was an honor to learn from them!","Ye Jian didn’t know that she had teased Little Six so much that he wouldn’t go to any bars anymore. Bars were now on Little Six’s blacklist.","He had no choice. He couldn’t forget about his family’s education. Otherwise, he would be betraying his ancestors and would be spat on to death by the Xia family."]},{"number":4359,"title":"Chapter 4359: The Cruel Lieutenant Colonel","paragraphs":["Ye Jian, who didn’t know what was going on in her man’s mind, was still immersed in her admiration for the man she loved. She didn’t notice that the man was secretly wiping his cold sweat.","Ye Jian felt that with Captain Xia’s intelligence, he would definitely be able to tell who wanted to put him in a sack in advance. Preemptive strikes had always been his secret to winning.","This was why every time Xia Jinyuan trained the special forces soldiers of the Xueyu unit, he would say harsh words to them before letting them go.","That was because they couldn’t find a chance to do anything! Before they could do anything, he would see through them. In the end, they would be the ones suffering.","After several battles, the special forces soldiers in the team stopped asking for trouble and became honest.","The veterans who had followed Xia Jinyuan for a few years knew that they couldn’t offend the handsome but cruel captain. However, the new recruits in the team didn’t know that!","After leaving the team for more than a year, the first thing Xia Jinyuan did when he returned to the base was to train his soldiers. In his eyes, even though these soldiers had been in the Xueyu unit for two and a half years, they were still new recruits.","In less than three days after returning to the team, he had grasped all the personal training situations of the new recruits. He listed out which areas they needed to train harder and which problems they needed to fix. He also called them out one by one when they gathered.","The new recruits thought that they were improving at a godly speed. Who knew that their elusive captain would come back? Damn, it made them suspect that they had not trained for a day for the past two and a half years!","After walking out of the cafeteria and wearing the military uniform, Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan arrived on time. Lieutenant Colonel Fang and the other people shook hands with all the special forces soldiers.","When he shook hands with Ye Jian, Lieutenant Colonel Fang’s eyes twitched violently. He sized up this female special forces soldier carefully.","He didn’t know that there was a female special forces soldier among the male special forces soldiers.","The special forces soldiers happily jumped into the truck that finally had a waterproof cloth covering it. They left the camp and would later take a plane to Keko Prefecture.","Lieutenant Colonel Fang watched as the truck drove away from the camp. He said to Lieutenant Colonel Zhu, \"I was really shocked just now. I didn’t expect there to be a female special forces soldier among them.\"","Lieutenant Colonel Zhu smiled and said, \"Female special forces soldiers are rare. But there’ll only be more and more of them in the future. Sometimes, it’s more convenient for female soldiers to do things compared to male soldiers. They can make people lower their guard.\"","\"That’s true. A female soldier won’t be worse than a male soldier.\"","\"Of course. A woman can hold up half the sky. How can she be bad? Isn’t that female special forces soldier the best example? There’ll be more and more in the future. Our country will get better and better. At that time, let’s see who will dare to bully us.\"","\"This retaliation against the non-military soldiers is the best evidence!\" After Lieutenant Colonel Zhu finished speaking, his resolute face revealed the sharpness of a soldier. \"Old Fang, we can stabilize ourselves now. If they dare to provoke us, we’ll retaliate!\"","The truck was already far away. The two lieutenant colonels turned around and returned to the camp calmly.","After leaving the country, they represented the country. The country could not be bullied. Whoever dared to cause trouble would not be able to return!","After leaving the truck in the camp, Xia Jinyuan, who was the last to get into the truck, stepped over his comrades’ long legs savagely and squeezed into a corner to sit beside Ye Jian. Ye Jian, who was hugging her gun tightly, lowered her head with a blush.","He really... wanted to be with her for every minute of the day."]},{"number":4360,"title":"Chapter 4360: Not Letting Go","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan squeezed over and sat down. He was like a cat that had stolen a fish. He leaned his body close to Ye Jian and transferred his scorching body temperature to Ye Jian. The small space was filled with his refreshing smell.","Li Jinnian sat in the passenger seat. The driver was a water ghost. 29 people were squeezed into the truck. The truck swayed, and the people got closer and closer. In the end, Xia Jinyuan was very shameless. Taking advantage of the dim corner, he reached out and hugged Ye Jian’s waist.","He had wanted to hug her for a long time, but he never had the chance!","Now that the opportunity had come, how could Lieutenant Colonel Xia let it go?","Ye Jian struggled as she placed her long arms around her waist. She glanced at her comrades from the corner of her eyes and lowered her voice. She gritted her teeth and said, \"Let go!\"","She twisted the thin layer of skin on the back of his hand that was holding her waist. She twisted it 180 degrees until Xia Jinyuan’s eyebrows jumped a few times. It was painful.","The young lieutenant colonel, who was in so much pain that his eyebrows were twitching, endured it. This pain was nothing. Compared to being able to hug his girlfriend’s waist, this pain was nothing!","\"Don’t move. If you move, they’ll notice you.\" Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who was in pain but still happy, didn’t let go. He even pulled her closer to him. \"You chose a corner to sit in. Wasn’t it because of me?","\"Be good. Don’t throw a tantrum. There are many people, and the seats are a little small. Bear with it.\"","Ye Jian was furious!","He had turned things around with just a few words.","She specially chose to sit in the corner? The seats were small? She was throwing a tantrum?","Ye Jian was so angry that she twisted the flesh on his hand with even more force this time. Lieutenant Colonel Xia gasped a few times. Even so, Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who could tolerate what ordinary people couldn’t, continued to endure!","This bit of pain was nothing!","\"Don’t pinch my hand. My heart aches.\" Lieutenant Colonel Xia’s hand hurt so much that he gasped. He maintained his composure. Even his voice didn’t fluctuate. If Ye Jian didn’t hear him gasping in pain just now, she would have thought that she had pinched the wrong person.","She knew how much strength she used. Seeing that he would rather be in pain than let go, Ye Jian’s heart softened again. Even her voice softened. She moved her mouth to his ear and said angrily and helplessly, \"If we’re really discovered, you’ll do the explaining. I won’t care anymore.\"","She would let him be. If he was really discovered, she would face it with him.","Being discovered by her comrades... Ye Jian thought about it. It was probably because she was quickly promoted to her fourth year, but she wasn’t as timid as before. After all, she didn’t do anything bad.","Weren’t they just dating?","The truck was filled with comrades who had gone through life and death together. It shouldn’t be a problem for them to know. As long as she and Xia Jinyuan weren’t discovered outside and were used by someone with ulterior motives, it was fine.","Although Ye Jian was in the military school, she knew that in the past two years, the Du family had been playing more and more tricks. Especially on Madam Li’s side. Commander Xia even personally called her to remind her that if Madam Xiao found the military school, there was no need to explain anything to her or be afraid.","If her relationship with Captain Xia was discovered, Captain Xia would be the one affected the most. As for her, with the Du family’s temper, they might not take her seriously.","If there was anyone to be wary of, it was Du Jiayi.","Xia Jinyuan hugged Ye Jian’s slender waist tightly with his iron arms. He laughed softly. \"Why bother explaining? Seeing is the truth. They’re not stupid. Would they still need me to explain things to them?","\"The boyfriend who can’t be seen in public occasionally needs to see the light of day and declare his sovereignty.\""]},{"number":4361,"title":"Chapter 4361: Declaring Sovereignty","paragraphs":["Occasionally, he needed to see the light of day and declare his sovereignty?","Ye Jian narrowed her eyes as if she thought of something.","After a while, Ye Jian knew why he said that. As it turned out... he was deliberately showing off to the water ghosts of the Storm Commando Brigade.","Sitting opposite her were the Storm Commando scouts, Sea Anemone and Seaweed. With their reconnaissance ability... they might have seen Captain Xia’s small actions.","Ye Jian raised her hand and rubbed her temples. Fine, she would cooperate and not struggle anymore.","It was a few hours’ drive. If Captain Xia hugged her, she could rest on his shoulder and sleep. As for what Sea Anemone and Seaweed would think when they found out, she didn’t care.","Ye Jian, who was hugging her gun, stopped struggling. Then, she heard Xia Jinyuan say to her, \"Sleep for a while. That way, you’ll have the energy to deal with anything that happens.\"","Forget it. It was just a relationship. She had a clear conscience.","She nodded and replied softly, \"You rest for a while too. You still have to change shifts with the Demon King later.\"","The captains of the two teams were in charge of the entire journey. Li Jinnian was in charge now. Xia Jinyuan would be in charge later. The two captains would take turns sitting in the passenger seat until they reached Keko Prefecture.","Ye Jian laid on his shoulder. She closed her eyes and started to conserve her energy. Unexpectedly, she fell asleep soon after.","After a long period of operational combat and getting her period, Ye Jian needed to ensure a certain amount of sleep.","Xia Jinyuan lowered his eyes slightly. Under the faint light, he saw a smile on her lips. Her facial expression relaxed as she fell asleep. Seeing this, his thin lips curved into a gentle smile.","He was still smiling at Ye Jian. Suddenly, Xia Jinyuan looked up and glanced over. His gaze was sharp and terrifying as he looked at Seaweed and Sea Anemone, who were secretly observing. They were as shocked as if a 12-magnitude earthquake had happened.","They thought that they had hidden well, but they didn’t expect Xia Jinyuan to catch them. Seaweed and Sea Anemone, who were squinting, were so frightened that their backs trembled. They closed their eyes tightly and didn’t say anything else.","Although they didn’t look at each other, the two of them kept communicating secretly.","The two people sitting opposite had already realized that something was wrong and had been secretly writing on each other’s palms.","[I’m sure now. They’re really a couple! Just now, Q King’s gaze was clearly warning us not to talk nonsense.] Sea Anemone wrote quickly. When Q King’s gaze landed on him, he felt a little flustered. [Why do I feel that he purposely let us see them? With Q King’s cautiousness, it’s impossible for him to do this.]","Seaweed closed his fingers and wrote on the palm of Sea Anemone. [He purposely let us see it. He’s telling us that Azure Bird is in their team and she’s his woman. He’s telling us not to have any ideas about Azure Bird.","[He did it on purpose and expected us to find out.]","Seaweed clenched his fingers and remained silent for a while. Then, he continued writing: [Did you realize that the Demon King treats Azure Bird differently too? Does the Demon King like... Azure Bird too?]","Seaweed wasn’t the only one who thought so. The water ghosts in the Storm Commando Brigade had this feeling too. Moreover, they felt that the two of them were quite compatible. If they really became a couple, it would be a good thing.","Even if Azure Bird couldn’t become a comrade in the team, it was fine if she could become the girlfriend of the Demon King!","Who knew...","All their thoughts were for nothing!","It was impossible for Azure Bird to become their comrade!","It was impossible for Azure Bird to become the Demon King’s girlfriend!","It was impossible. They had thought about everything, but it was all in vain.","They wondered if the Demon King knew about Azure Bird’s relationship with Q King. How sad would he be if he knew?","Sea Anemone and Seaweed started to worry about the Demon King."]},{"number":4362,"title":"Chapter 4362: Exposed","paragraphs":["Sea Anemone and Seaweed felt uncomfortable for the rest of the trip. They only hoped that when it was time to change shifts, the Demon King, who was sitting in the passenger seat, would be able to sit in the compartment.","Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who had achieved his goal, stretched out his long legs and held his girlfriend’s waist comfortably. He closed his eyes happily.","From now on, the water ghosts of Storm Commando wouldn’t have any designs on Azure Bird.","The water ghosts, his cousin-in-law, and even Commander Dong of the navy had certain thoughts about Azure Bird. Azure Bird was about to be in her fourth year. At the most critical moment, he had to stabilize the situation. After all, he couldn’t keep an eye on Azure Bird at all times.","If he made a mistake and the navy commander-in-chief really poached Azure Bird, it would be too late for regrets. Old Xia was someone who wasn’t afraid of a good show. He always liked to make things difficult for others. Xia Jinyuan had to get rid of all the problems and not complicate things.","Xia Jinyuan, who was sleeping happily, didn’t care about the two gazes that landed on his face. They could look all they wanted and it wouldn’t change anything.","After a while, Seaweed and Sea Anemone retracted their gazes and looked at each other silently. They closed their eyes and rested with mixed feelings.","How could they still have a good sleep?","That was impossible.","They waited anxiously. Even when they were sleeping, they were still half-awake. When the truck braked and stopped, their eyes lit up.","It was time for the two captains to change shifts!","Li Jinnian frowned and locked his cold gaze on the two scouts. His thin lips moved slightly as he asked, \"Azure Bird is my cousin. Do you have any questions?\"","...","The sun was shining brightly above their heads, but the two people felt as if they could hear thunderclaps. Seaweed and Sea Anemone almost jumped 30 feet into the air.","What?!","What?!","What?!","Azure Bird was the Demon King’s younger sister!","They were so shocked that their souls flew out. They felt as if their intelligence had dropped to rock bottom as they blurted out, \"When did this happen?\"","After asking, they knew that they had asked the wrong question. Azure Bird was the Demon King’s cousin. She was definitely born his cousin. How could it be possible that he acknowledged her as his godcousin?","With the Demon King’s personality, how could he acknowledge a godcousin?","Sea Anemone successfully salvaged the situation by asking, \"Cousin? Biological?\"","\"Yes.\"","Li Jinnian didn’t want his comrades to know that he and Azure Bird were cousins. But who knew that there would be such a misunderstanding? In the past, Big Whale thought that he had feelings for Azure Bird. At that time, he didn’t know that Azure Bird was his cousin. It was just that he felt inexplicably close to her, so his actions could easily cause his comrades to misunderstand.","Now, after a few years, their relationship was still misunderstood. There was a need to explain.","He didn’t give any more explanations. He just needed them to understand the simple fact.","Li Jinnian didn’t explain further. After he finished speaking, he got into the truck. Seaweed and Sea Anemone looked at each other. Libya was too chaotic. They should return to their country as soon as possible.","Before getting into the truck, Sea Anemone whispered, \"Did we get into trouble?\"","\"I don’t think so. Since the Demon King didn’t say anything before this, how would we know? Cousins... Cousins are good too.\" Seaweed wiped the hot sweat from the sun and hopped onto the truck. Sea Anemone followed closely.","Ye Jian was still sitting in the innermost seat. The only difference was that the person beside her now was her cousin.","The people sitting opposite them were K7 and G3, the comrades of the Xueyu unit.","Sea Anemone and Seaweed were terrified. They didn’t dare to sit opposite the Demon King.","Li Jinnian and Azure bird were clearly cousins. The two of them were so stupid that they misunderstood that the Demon King liked Azure Bird. Although the Demon King didn’t say anything, they were still frightened and didn’t dare to get closer."]},{"number":4363,"title":"Chapter 4363: Not Worthy Of Love","paragraphs":["The 200-kilometer journey was full of devastation. The spreading flames of war had destroyed Libya into pieces.","The special forces soldiers who came overseas for missions were the most affected, especially the water ghosts. The more they saw, the more silent they became. In the end, they hugged their rifles and didn’t even say a word to each other.","The special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit didn’t disturb them.","This was a path that one had to take to cleanse one’s soul. In the future, one would understand that peace was not easy. One would also understand the weight of one’s responsibility as a soldier.","The first crossfire point appeared. The wireless communication was no longer silent. Everyone turned on their communication devices and prepared to jump out of the truck at any time.","The waterproof cloth above the truck was folded, and the entire compartment was open so that the special forces soldiers in the truck could observe their surroundings.","The smoke in front was thick. Before the truck entered the war zone, they could already hear gunshots and artillery fire. This was a civil war in Libya. These 31 special forces soldiers were not peacekeepers. They had to choose to take a detour and not participate.","The entire retreat route had been planned. The people on the truck were on guard, and the vehicle started to circle around.","After that, they met a few more crossfire points. They still chose to take a detour. They set off from the second point in the afternoon. After five hours, they finally arrived at Keko Prefecture.","Commander-in-chief Dong and Major General Yang knew that all the special forces soldiers had arrived in Keko Prefecture safely. The two major generals exchanged calls and chatted for a while before hanging up in peace.","Major General Yang was still alright. After all, the special forces soldiers of the Xueyu unit had gone overseas many times to carry out similar missions. He was already used to it.","Commander Dong was different. It wasn’t easy for him to groom a special forces unit. This was his first time sending his special forces unit overseas for a mission. From the moment they went overseas, Commander Dong had been worried about them. He was afraid that bad news would come. He was so worried that many strands of his hair had turned white.","Fortunately, everything went smoothly. The special forces at sea had won their first battle. It also built up confidence for their future development.","The transport plane slowly lifted into the sky. Li Jinnian watched quietly. There was a hidden emotion in the depths of his cold expression that no one could notice. The transport plane started to fly. Li Jinnian saw it and laid his head on the seat. He slowly exhaled.","They could safely return to their country!","\"Come, come, come. Let’s stack our hands and celebrate the victory of the Storm Commando Brigade!\"","Someone got excited. Then, the cabin became lively. They couldn’t get up and walk around at any time. They all stacked their hands and cheered for the Storm Commando Brigade’s first victory.","\"One, two, three! Keep it up, all the best!\"","\"Keep it up, all the best!\"","They stacked their hands and shouted the slogan. Then, they cheered together. Ye Jian’s hand was covered by Xia Jinyuan’s hand. As the slogan was shouted, their gazes met and intertwined.","’Captain Xia, I’m one step closer to you.’","She said with her eyes.","Xia Jinyuan smiled. The paint on his face had been wiped clean. The smile on his handsome and elegant face was faint and affectionate.","He blinked slightly, indicating that he had understood her gaze.","’That’s right, my girl. You’re getting closer and closer to me. I’m so happy that you didn’t give up on me and continued to chase after me despite all the hardships.","’I’m so lucky to finally have you here.’","Ye Jian smiled too. Her smile was as beautiful as a flower.","She was so lucky to finally get close to him."]},{"number":4364,"title":"Chapter 4364: Cutest Height Difference","paragraphs":["The transport plane passed through the transit point and entered the Chinese border 21 hours later. The radar indicated that it had entered the Chinese aviation field, indicating that all the special forces soldiers on the plane had really arrived in the country.","This mission was special. They didn’t need to go to the military directly. They just needed to write a report and send it to the military. Hence, Xia Jinyuan and Li Jinnian didn’t need to enter the capital city. After the transport plane landed at a military airport at the border, they returned to their positions.","Xia Jinyuan and the rest would be the first to leave. They would take the military transport plane to the base.","There were still 70 minutes before the take-off time. All the special forces soldiers were waiting outside the military airport runway. As this was an airbase, one of them was from the navy while the other was from the army. Even dragons had to guard this place. They were not allowed to go anywhere else.","Xia Jinyuan tidied Ye Jian’s helmet and collar. His deep voice blended into the night wind and sounded sexy. \"I have some work to do after I return to the base. I’ll lose contact with you for the time being. I can’t arrange for you to be in the team during the summer vacation this year. I’ve already submitted the training camp application form I mentioned last time. The results are still unknown.","\"Just stay in school and wait for the news. During the summer vacation, you’ll listen to the military school’s arrangements. If you have a holiday, go back to the capital city to visit the old master. Go to the Xia family’s residence too. The old master and old madam miss you.\"","Xia Jinyuan felt that there were still many things he didn’t say out loud. He said whatever he thought of. No matter what he said, Ye Jian could tell that he couldn’t bear to part with her.","It was the same for her.","Ye Jian nodded at everything he said so that he wouldn’t worry.","Li Jinnian occasionally looked up at the street lamps in front of him. He didn’t disturb them.","Xia Jinyuan and the rest were the first to leave. He would let the two of them talk for a while. As the elder cousin, if he kept disturbing them, he might seem ignorant and might even make his cousin hate him.","He didn’t walk over because he was afraid of disturbing the two of them. He was mainly afraid of being hated by Ye Jian.","Under the streetlamp, the slender Xia Jinyuan stood in front of Ye Jian, who was 168 centimeters tall. Ye Jian looked exceptionally petite. Ye Jian was standing under his elongated figure under the light. From Li Jinnian’s angle, he could only see that Ye Jian was enveloped by Xia Jinyuan’s shadow. He couldn’t see her.","Ye Jian, who was enveloped by the black figure, kept looking up. It couldn’t be helped. The man she loved was taller than she was. If she wanted to look at his facial features when she stood close to him, she could only look up.","If she looked up for too long, her neck would hurt.","Every time Xia Jinyuan saw Ye Jian raising her hand and hitting the back of her neck, Xia Jinyuan couldn’t help but want to laugh.","He flicked her forehead lightly with his fingers and teased, \"Eat more. You’re like a little bean. I need you to grow stronger so that you won’t feel tired even if you have to raise your neck.\"","At Ye Jian’s age, it was impossible for her to grow taller. She was already 168 centimeters. Even another half centimeter was a far-fetched dream.","Ye Jian rubbed her forehead. She felt helpless. \"Why aren’t you shorter? Every time I stand so close to you and talk, I’m the one who’s the most tired. My neck hurts...\"","\"You’re short, but you think I’m too tall.\" The man who spoke raised his hand and compared their heights. He was 1.89 meters tall while Ye Jian was 1.68 meters tall. The difference in their heights was 21 centimeters. Xia Jinyuan realized that the difference in their heights was surprisingly harmonious. It even made him feel sweet and a little proud."]},{"number":4365,"title":"Chapter 4365: Deep Love","paragraphs":["Ye Jian saw that he was measuring their heights. Amused, she raised her leg and kicked his calf. She stretched out her leg, but she didn’t manage to kick him. Instead, he rubbed her head forcefully.","Fortunately, she had short hair. Although it was messy, it wouldn’t become a bird’s nest.","\"Fortunately, you’re 1.68 meters tall. If you were only 1.60 meters tall, it’d be difficult for you to kick me with your small arms and legs.\"","After rubbing her head, Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who felt sweet and satisfied, laughed softly. At this moment, Ye Jian was pure and carefree. She was like an ordinary woman fooling around and acting coquettishly in front of her boyfriend. From a soldier who was as cold as iron, he became gentle.","The gentleness was all because of her. They were deeply in love.","Ye Jian imagined what he said just now. The scene was so funny that she couldn’t help but laugh.","That was right. Fortunately, she was 168cm. If not, she would really look like a little doll in front of him. She couldn’t even walk by his side. She would be dragged away by him. If not, she would be carried under his armpit!","Her imagination was a little out of line. Her chuckle gradually turned into an all-out laugh, causing their comrades to look over.","Sea Anemone and Seaweed looked at each other silently. Then, they looked at the Demon King. The Demon King Captain’s gaze was murderous.","The killing intent in his eyes was very strong. They felt a chill down their spines just by glancing at him. They were afraid that Demon King would shoot Q King, who made Azure Bird laugh.","Azure Bird was the Demon King’s younger cousin. Q King was indeed Q King. He was actually able to woo the Demon King’s younger cousin. Did the Demon King chase after her?","Only Q King could withstand all the pressure from the Demon King and chase after Azure Bird!","If it were any one of them, as long as the Demon King glanced at them, they would definitely tremble in fear and not dare to have any disloyal thoughts.","Li Jinnian’s killing intent didn’t affect Xia Jinyuan at all. At this moment, he was blocking everything around him. He only had eyes for Ye Jian.","70 minutes was a short time. The military transport vehicle was loaded. It was time for Xia Jinyuan to lead the team to board the plane.","The low and gentle kiss landed on her lips. Xia Jinyuan turned around and entered the cabin without looking back. Ye Jian, who was standing outside, hugged her helmet with one hand and touched her lips that were still warm. Then, she waved goodbye.","The transport plane took off and turned into a glint before disappearing into the sky.","He was returning to the base while she was returning to the military school.","Xia Jinyuan brought the special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit back to the base. They were the first to leave. Next, Li Jinnian would leave with the water ghosts from the Storm Commando Brigade. Ye Jian was the last.","It couldn’t be helped. There were no military planes heading to Xiang City. There were fighter jets, but Ye Jian wasn’t a pilot. She didn’t have the knowledge to operate a fighter jet with a pilot. Hence, she was the last to leave.","Li Jinnian and the rest only boarded the plane half an hour later. In this half an hour, it became Li Jinnian’s turn to remind his cousin. It involved everything from life to studies.","Ye Jian nodded and listened obediently.","Toward the end, Li Jinnian suddenly fell silent. Ye Jian was listening obediently to him and thought that he had finished speaking. However, she saw a hint of unnaturalness on her cousin’s handsome face. Even his cold voice sounded a little unnatural.","\"You and Xia Jinyuan are both grown adults. You have to pay attention to some things. Don’t let yourself suffer. Don’t cause any more trouble in your last year. Don’t cut off your future because of a moment of happiness. Do you understand?\"","Ye Jian blinked. She... understood!","She also understood why her cousin was so unnatural."]},{"number":4366,"title":"Chapter 4366: Reception","paragraphs":["Li Jinnian’s unnaturalness didn’t disappear even after he boarded the transport plane that was flying to the navy base in the south. His jawline was tense as he used a cold expression to hide his unnaturalness.","Ye Jian stood on the spot and watched the transport plane leave. She patted her slightly hot face. After a while, the heat on her face dissipated.","Captain Xia had left, her cousin had left, and her comrades had left too. She would have to leave in another hour.","When she arrived at Xiang City, it was already past 9:00 am the next morning. Xiang City in May was starting to get hot. When Ye Jian walked into the school, she heard the students’ training sounds coming from the sports ground. Their voices were loud and imposing. The familiar voices and the familiar scenery swept away her fatigue from the past few days.","Ye Jian returned to her dormitory and washed up. She changed into her summer military uniform and wore her military cap. She stood in front of the dressing mirror and tidied her military uniform again. Without taking a rest, Ye Jian walked toward the teaching building.","\"Report...\"","Outside the classroom, the clear voice of a female soldier was heard. The instructor who was carrying out a PowerPoint presentation knew who the student at the door was.","The students in the class also knew who it was. 44 pairs of eyes looked over with happy smiles on their faces.","It was Ye Jian. They had been comrades for four years.","That night, He Jing found Ye Jian. That same night, Ye Jian disappeared from the dormitory. For the next few days, Ye Jian was nowhere to be seen in the classroom, dormitory, sports ground, laboratory...","The students were already used to Ye Jian disappearing two or three times every semester. She wouldn’t disappear for long. She would be back in a week at most.","From the end of the actual combat simulation to today, it had only been five days.","The instructor smiled and said, \"Please come in.\" Other than the instructor’s voice, there was no other noise in the classroom. Before Ye Jian returned to her seat, the students had already reverted their gazes back to the PowerPoint presentation. They didn’t pay much attention to Ye Jian.","This was an outstanding class. Their self-discipline was so strong that every instructor admired them.","After returning to school, Ye Jian was busy from the end of May to the middle of June. On the 18th of June, a group of foreign military school students came to the National Science University for an exchange. Ye Jian was one of the student representatives. After taking a call, she rushed all the way to her dormitory.","Today was the weekend. The temperature was as high as 36 degrees. It was rare for the military school to show mercy and let the third and fourth-year students rest during the day on Sunday. They would usually continue their training at night.","Ye Jian came in. He Jing and Xu Wen were doing exercises. When they saw her coming in, they did the same thing and looked at the time.","It wasn’t time yet. Why did she return early?","\"The plane was delayed? You didn’t receive anyone?\" He Jing put down her pen and asked.","Ye Jian glanced at the two of them and said helplessly, \"The officer gave me an order to wear a dress. He said that the two foreign female students who came back wore soldier’s skirts. As a female student, I have to wear a soldier’s skirt too.\"","He Jing was stunned for a moment. A soldier’s skirt? They seemed to have worn it together once in their first year of university. After that... they never wore it again.","Xu Wen narrowed her eyes slightly and sized up Ye Jian. \"You’re going to have to wear a soldier’s skirt, so you need to put on some light makeup. The officer even called you specially. It looks like two beautiful foreign soldiers came.\"","Xu Wen was in high spirits. She stopped doing her exercises and stood up with a smile. \"Come, come, let me put on some light makeup for you. I’ve never seen you with makeup on before! I guarantee that you’ll stun everyone!\""]},{"number":4367,"title":"Chapter 4367: Born Beautiful","paragraphs":["\"Even if you hadn’t mentioned it, I would’ve still asked for your help.\" Ye Jian’s temples hurt when she thought of the officer’s order.","She could barely accept wearing a soldier’s skirt. As for light makeup... she didn’t have any products. Other than the sunblock that Xu Wen told her about, she only had a bottle of facial cleanser, a bottle of cream that she occasionally applied, and a bottle of toner that had probably expired.","As the student representative, she was bare-faced and wore her summer uniform (sleeved shirt and pants). She stood with the male students. The instructor at the airport called the accompanying instructor. After looking for her, the instructor gave an order on the phone, asking Ye Jian to wear a female soldier’s skirt and put on some light makeup to welcome the students from other military schools.","Ye Jian tried to retaliate but to no avail.","Ye Jian wasn’t interested at all as she was just obeying orders, but Xu Wen was excited.","\"Come, come, wipe the water off your face. Sit down and don’t move. Let me see if we should trim your eyebrows...\" Xu Wen, who had turned into a makeup master, held Ye Jian’s face and smiled as she spoke. She looked at Ye Jian’s left and right. The next moment, Xu Wen felt angry.","She poked Ye Jian’s tender and fair face with her finger. Then, she pinched her face forcefully and said angrily, \"We’re both God’s children. Why is there such a huge difference?!\"","\"I even take care of my skin every day. Jing, look, look. I even got a sunburn. Look at Ye Jian. It’s unreasonable. She doesn’t need anything and her skin is still as fair as Snow White. I’m so angry that I’m about to faint!\"","Ye Jian’s skin was like the Fu family’s. It was very soft and fair. For instance, her cousin, Li Jinnian, was exposed to the sun and wind by the sea all year round. The water ghosts had tanned many degrees. As for him, he was like a white pearl mixed into a bunch of black pearls.","Ye Jian was the same. She couldn’t get tanned.","Perhaps it was because Xu Wen was so angry that she was about to faint, He Jing finally came over and took a look. Her expression was a little serious. Ye Jian, who was sitting, knew that something bad would happen again.","At this moment, Xu Wen only said that she was so angry that she was about to faint. When He Jing came over later, Xu Wen would definitely be pissed.","In order to prevent a tragedy from happening and to avoid having to find someone else who knew how to put on makeup, she rushed to say, \"Hurry up and do your exercises. I’ll get Wen to help me with the makeup.\"","\"Xu Wen, don’t be jealous. It’s hard to compete with a natural beauty. Hurry up and put on makeup for Little Jian. Don’t dawdle. No matter how long you dawdle, you won’t be able to look like Ye Jian. Just be a black pearl. That’s good too. Don’t think about it anymore. It’ll be more annoying if you think too much.\"","Xu Wen was already very frustrated. She glared at He Jing. \"Are we still comrades? Do you not have any sense of camaraderie anymore? Do you even know how to comfort people? Go! Go and do your exercises.\"","She was so angry that she almost fainted.","He Jing, who was sitting back and doing exercises, didn’t forget to pat Xu Wen’s shoulder to show her sincerity.","Xu Wen gritted her teeth and replied, \"Thank you for your consolation.\"","In Ye Jian’s opinion, the easiest way to put on makeup was just to put on some lipstick and that was all.","To Xu Wen, even light makeup had to be done step by step.","Ye Jian didn’t agree to apply all kinds of powder on her face. He Jing added, \"Nothing can compare to natural beauty. If you don’t have a good base, we’d need to apply a few layers of makeup. As for Ye Jian, I think she should just fill in her eyebrows and put on some lipstick. That’s it!\""]},{"number":4368,"title":"Chapter 4368: Amazing","paragraphs":["That was right. Ye Jian didn’t need to put on foundation. The female soldier in the mirror had bright eyes and white teeth. Her eyebrows were elegant, and her eyes were like resplendent stars. She had red lips too.","She wore the knee-length military skirt that she kept at the bottom of the drawer and then wore the brand new leather shoes. The short-sleeved shirt was tucked into the skirt. The sight made Xu Wen’s eyes widen.","Even He Jing, who didn’t pay much attention to beauty, exclaimed when she saw Ye Jian like this.","It was publicly acknowledged in the military school that Ye Jian was good-looking. Young students would privately talk about who was good-looking. Usually, they would say that there were more or less differences in aesthetics according to the person. Words of disapproval would be heard.","However, as long as Ye Jian was mentioned, they would have no objections. They all felt that even if she wore a camouflage uniform, she wouldn’t be able to hide her elegance.","Now that she had light makeup on and was wearing a female soldier’s skirt, Ye Jian was even more beautiful than a lotus flower. She looked radiant and valiant like a female soldier. When she walked out of the dormitory, Ye Jian had already received countless gazes.","In the end, she took the risk of being caught by the inspectors and lowered her military cap.","In the dormitory, He Jing said to Xu Wen, \"Fortunately, we’re in a military school. Fortunately, we find makeup a waste of time. Fortunately, our Little Jian cares about inner beauty more. Fortunately, she’s already taken. Otherwise, she would’ve charmed many boys.","\"I’m a woman and my heart is still thumping. How fascinating.\"","Ye Jian never put on light makeup. She usually didn’t even put on lipstick. This was the first time she put on light makeup and her roommates were charmed.","\"I’m thinking about how many male students Ye Jian will charm when she goes out now.\" Xu Wen put away her lipstick that she had only used a few times. She said to He Jing, \"Little Jian’s boyfriend is really lucky! Fortunately, he’s handsome. If not, I would’ve persuaded Little Jian to change her mind!\"","Lieutenant Colonel Xia had always been confident in his appearance. Even in the past, he knew that it was his face that attracted Ye Jian’s attention!","He Jing nodded seriously. That was right, it was the truth!","Fortunately, Little Jian’s boyfriend was handsome enough. If not, they would’ve persuaded Little Jian to change her mind.","Xu Wen said, \"Comparisons are infuriating.\" Then, she leaned back against the desk and continued doing her exercises.","She couldn’t think too much. It would be annoying.","Ye Jian, who had received countless gazes along the way, finally returned to the team. This time, a total of 12 exchange students from other countries came. Hence, the school also sent 12 outstanding students to receive them—ten male students and two female students.","Ye Jian knew the other female student. She was Ding Ling, who went to a grassroots company in the Nanguang Military District to learn during the winter vacation. She had returned to the dormitory to put on makeup and had yet to gather with the rest.","When Ye Jian came over, the ten male students were still memorizing the personal information of the 12 exchange students from other countries. They needed to know their personal interests and hobbies.","\"Ye Jian, the officer called just now and asked you...\" A male student who saw Ye Jian began speaking. His eyes were filled with surprise. He wanted to take a closer look but didn’t dare to. He looked away and lowered his voice. \"He asked you to call the officer when you were back.\"","As the male student spoke, the other male students looked up.","They all knew why the female students went back to the dormitory. Putting aside their identity as military school students, they were also ordinary guys. They all had feelings that ordinary guys had.","Ye Jian, who had light makeup on, was standing in front of them. When they saw her face, their eyes lit up. They were stunned."]},{"number":4369,"title":"Chapter 4369: Bad Roots","paragraphs":["The students who could represent the military school to receive the students from other military schools were all outstanding. Although they were stunned by Ye Jian, they didn’t lose their composure. They just knew that they were stunned. Soon, they retracted their gaze in embarrassment. They pretended to cough and calmed down.","It was a little rushed, but they were still steady.","Ye Jian quickly called the officer. As it turned out, the officer heard Commissar Yue say in the car, \"You want Ye Jian to put on makeup? Will she listen?\" So, the officer immediately called to ask.","Hearing this, Ye Jian was no longer resigned.","\"You’ve already given me an order. How can I disobey you? I’ve really put on makeup. I feel very awkward now. I really want to go to the bathroom to wash up.\"","The officer didn’t know whether to laugh or cry at her unaccustomed complaints. \"Comrade, didn’t you say so yourself that everyone loves beautiful things? It’s rare for a young lady like you to dress up. Why do you make it sound like you’re going to the execution ground?","\"We’ll reach the school in 30 minutes. Hurry up and prepare. Don’t embarrass the school.\"","\"Yes!\" Ye Jian stood at attention and replied. Although the officer couldn’t see her through the phone, Ye Jian was used to it.","The male students adjusted their auras. When Ding Ling, who had light makeup on, came over, they were no longer as stunned as when they first saw Ye Jian. They even praised her for being beautiful.","Ding Ling looked at Ye Jian and smiled. \"Comrades, there’s something wrong with your aesthetics. I’m beautiful? Ye Jian is the beautiful one.\"","\"I’m a woman myself, but my eyes lit up when I saw her. My heart is pounding. Didn’t you guys notice? Or are you all shy?\"","In the military school, the girls were like guys too. Sometimes, there was no need to be so awkward.","After hearing Ding Ling’s words, the male students didn’t hold back anymore. They started openly looking at Ye Jian instead of secretly glancing at her. They looked at Ye Jian and smiled.","The atmosphere instantly became relaxed as they smiled. They weren’t as tense as before.","This time, there were students from two countries who came to the National Science University for an exchange. They had diplomatic relations with China too. Similarly, Chinese military school students went to their country’s military school to have an exchange.","The students from the two countries were all tall and strong. Their exposed muscles were like rocks. They all seemed very strong.","When Ye Jian saw the two male students from Manchester, she narrowed her eyes. She knew these two male students.","They represented Manchester to participate in the military school competition. She had participated in it before.","Although the male students from the two countries were tanned, their facial features were the same. Ye Jian still recognized the two male students from Manchester at a glance.","In the past, these two male students had even been rude to the Chinese schools participating in the competition.","Now that they had returned to China’s territory and entered the military school, she wondered if the two of them would continue to be rude or lower their heads to reality and become humble.","However, not long after, reality proved that the fox that might grow gray but never good. Their bad habits had already taken root in their bones and blood. It was impossible to change them.","Ye Jian recognized the two of them, but the other party didn’t recognize Ye Jian.","When they shook hands, they couldn’t help but reveal their arrogance. The male Chinese student in charge of explaining took the initiative to reach out his hand. The two students narrowed their eyes and glanced at the Chinese student’s outstretched hand with a hint of disdain on their dark faces."]},{"number":4370,"title":"Chapter 4370: Unlucky Guy","paragraphs":["In the end, they reached out their hands. However, they didn’t touch the hand of the Chinese student. They made a handshake gesture and retracted their hands immediately.","The Chinese male student saw this and nodded slightly with a smile. He had to maintain his etiquette, after all. Then, he placed the two of them on the list of people to keep an eye on.","Manchester was a country that was divided into classes and had a strict hierarchy. These two arrogant male students came from Manchester’s ’high society’. They were at the top of the hierarchy. The reason why they were arrogant was because they thought that they were ’better’ than others.","It was impossible to let them do as the Romans did!","As a result, their arrogance became the fuse for them to be taught a lesson in the future. Of course, they weren’t beaten up. They were just taught how to act.","The student from the National Science University who was in charge of receiving the two of them was not angry because of this. On the contrary, he was still polite and did not lose the demeanor of a soldier from a big country. Since the other party ignored them, there was no need for him to approach them anymore.","As a soldier, he had to be firm.","Ye Jian shook hands with the two female students. After a while, they were able to chat freely. The two female students walked in the middle while Ye Jian and Ding Ling accompanied them with smiles.","Ye Jian still couldn’t understand why the officer asked her and Ding Ling to put on light makeup.","The two female students from Manchester didn’t have any makeup on. Why did they need to put on light makeup?","They didn’t visit the campus immediately. Instead, they went to the reception room and settled all the admission procedures for the 12 students. Then, they brought the exchange students to the international dormitory to settle down. After a short rest in the dormitory, they brought them to the conference room.","The conference room was the first step for the 12 exchange students to understand the National Science University.","Those who were able to send overseas students to learn and interact were all outstanding students. From their conversation and actions, it could be seen that their family background was not poor. Every time the two arrogant male students asked targeted questions, they were blocked by the male students in charge of hospitality.","Perhaps because they couldn’t stump the Chinese students, the two of them closed their mouths resentfully.","When it was time to visit the campus of the National Science University, the two of them started to show off their superiority again. As for the other four students from Manchester, they were probably used to it. Although they had received higher education, the sense of hierarchy was practically ingrained in their bones. They didn’t raise any objections to two students’ rudeness.","The six students from Sedoya were very humble. They communicated with the Chinese students with a learning attitude.","When they were participating in the large-scale computer room, the eyes of the six students from Sedoya were almost glued to the screen. The male student in the lead asked the students from the National Science University politely, \"Can we use them in the future?\"","Sedoya was Libya’s neighboring country. Not long after the internal strife ended, the flames of war stopped. Next was the long reconstruction. Six students from Sedoya came to China with a devout attitude to learn. They hoped to bring what they had learned back to the country and devote their strength to rebuilding their home.","Whether or not they could use large computers was a question that could not be answered.","The senior from the fourth year smiled and said, \"It depends on the curriculum. If it’s required, you’ll definitely have the chance to use the computers. Every laboratory uses a combination of courses. You can’t enter and leave as you please.\"","The other four students were also very happy to talk to the Chinese students. They asked many questions about the National Science University. Ye Jian and the rest answered these questions selectively. They didn’t answer everything.","When it came to sensitive topics, they would politely avoid them and change the topic."]},{"number":4371,"title":"Chapter 4371: Destruction And Hope","paragraphs":["After visiting two laboratories and an exhibition room, the group arrived at the library. The spacious and bright library was not empty at all. Almost every seat was occupied by students who were seriously flipping through the books in their hands.","When they encountered difficult questions, they discussed in low voices. From time to time, they would write and draw in their notebooks. Every student had a light and serious expression on their face. They were determined to gain more knowledge for themselves.","The students from Sedoya walked into the library and felt the atmosphere of studying. Their eyes were filled with envy.","Their country had been destroyed too severely. Having a library was a dream for them. They didn’t have a library or a complete home. There was only mud everywhere. They couldn’t even find a complete building in their capital city.","Stepping into China’s peaceful land, high floors, rows of trees, Chinese citizens driving cars on the road... This was the country they dreamed of building.","There were no flames of war, no killing, no nightmares... They came with hope and would return with the seeds.","The library became the place where the 12 students stayed for the longest. The Sedoyan students even took out a few books to read. They knew a little Chinese, but it was far from enough to understand what was written.","\"This is our city’s construction plan. This is our country’s international metropolis, Sea City. This is the fastest-growing city in our country...\"","Ye Jian used English, which she was familiar with like her mother tongue, to answer the questions of the two female students. She used a city construction plan book and the iconic buildings of various cities. With just one book, she explained for half an hour.","The four students from Manchester were also participating and chatting happily with the Chinese students. The two arrogant students were already very impatient.","Before they came, they had some understanding of this Chinese military school. They felt that it couldn’t be compared to the American West Point Military Academy. They wanted to go to West Point more. Unfortunately, Lady Luck was not on their side and let another batch of students go to West Point. They could only come here.","Ye Jian and the rest had been entertaining the 12 students the entire morning. They didn’t get to have lunch until it was over.","Chatting with other people was a technical job for Ye Jian. Especially when she had to entertain the two arrogant and picky Manchester students. It was a challenge to her mental endurance.","Fortunately, the challenge was successful and she didn’t have any impulses.","As for whether she would have any urges during the next few days of communication, Ye Jian couldn’t guarantee it.","There were many exchange students from other countries in the National Science University. It happened every year. Similarly, an incident would take place every year.","Soon, it was the middle of June. Ye Jian, who had lost contact with her boyfriend, walked out of the laboratory and rushed to the classroom. It was morning now. She had been busy in the laboratory all night, so she had to rush back to class.","As for physical fitness training, the instructor had already taken care of things for Ye Jian. He knew that Ye Jian would never let her physical fitness training fall behind. The results of every test were the best proof.","\"Ye Jian, Ye Jian...\"","When she went upstairs, Ye Jian heard the familiar voices of the students behind her. She turned her head and saw Song Zhiqiu and Hu Huan walking over side by side.","It was a rule for students to form teams of twos and threes.","Song Zhiqiu, who was walking closer, smiled and said, \"The morning class has issued a notice. Our class needs to send four people to carry out training outside of school. The officer will report your name directly, including the two of us and Wu Bingxian. The officer said that if we find you, we should inform you directly. He won’t give any further notice.\"","The words ’training outside of school’ made Ye Jian frown."]},{"number":4372,"title":"Chapter 4372: Enemy","paragraphs":["On the day of training, Ye Jian would already be a fourth-year student. It was normal for fourth-year students to train. It was fine if she was training a first-year student in the military school, but she still had to go to... another school?","Ye Jian was a little resistant.","Before she could speak, a group of people from the teaching building opposite rushed out in an orderly manner. All of them walked in a hurry, but their formation was very stable. It was as if they were in a hurry to do something important.","\"The officer said that if you have any thoughts, you can talk to him alone. However, the list of people has been confirmed and can’t be changed. It’s the same whether it’s in school or outside. You’ll appear on the list,\" Hu Huan said with a smile. He seemed to have seen the resistance on Ye Jian’s expression. \"So, it’s better to accept it.\"","\"The few of us who are going out of school to train are the envy of everyone else.\"","Why were they envied?","That was because... they could go to other schools to see beautiful girls.","Ye Jian knew what they were thinking. Hearing that, she raised her eyebrows slightly and smiled. \"Sure. I’ll ask if anyone in the class is willing to swap with me. I’d be happy to.\"","She would rather be in school than outside.","She didn’t need to look at beautiful girls or handsome guys. On-campus training was easier for the freshmen to realize that they were no longer students but soldiers.","She was happy to transform the new students to soldiers.","It was quite difficult to carry out training outside the school.","It wasn’t good to be too strict. It wasn’t good to be too flexible either. There was a limit to it. If she met a mischievous guy, it would be a headache. If there was really no way to change it, she would ask to bring a girl with her.","\"Of course, but what’s the use of them being willing?\" As Liu Yang spoke, he saw three physical fitness instructors walking out of the school. Their expressions were a little dark, so he added, \"What’s wrong? The atmosphere is a little tense early in the morning.\"","\"When is the atmosphere not tense? Come, come, let’s go. Class is starting.\" Song Zhiqiu glanced over and took the lead to walk up the steps. He whispered to Ye Jian, \"Outstanding students need to train. I think the officer specially arranged this. It’s good for your graduation next year.","\"After the training tomorrow, there’ll be a training camp. Just listen to the officer’s arrangements. You can’t go wrong with that.\"","Ye Jian smiled as she walked up the stairs. \"Yes, I know. I find out-of-school training troublesome. On-campus training is different. If I’m strict, they can only obey. As long as I’m strict with the new students, even if they have any objections, they won’t be able to do anything about it.\"","Song Zhiqiu understood. It wasn’t that Ye Jian didn’t want to teach. She just found it troublesome.","\"When you’re outside, you’ll still train according to the requirements. If the new students have any objections, the officer will take care of it. Don’t worry, it’s good to visit other schools. We all look forward to that day.\"","The few of them talked in low voices as they walked to the classroom.","The morning was filled with the main lessons. After the classes were over, they moved to the multimedia class and analyzed and discussed the various battles. After discussing, they established the relevant data. The morning passed just like that.","In the afternoon, Ye Jian finally knew why the students from the opposite building were in a hurry in the morning and why the three physical instructors had dark expressions on their faces. Two students from Manchester took the initiative to provoke the students from a class. At the same time, they belittled the class and spoke arrogantly. In the end, they angered everyone.","\"Are they here to interact or to make enemies? Foreign soldiers more or less have some conflicts in the early stages, but none have ever caused such a huge commotion like the two of them.\"","\"Don’t tell me they don’t want to stay anymore and want to pack their luggage and leave?\""]},{"number":4373,"title":"Chapter 4373: Arrogant","paragraphs":["During the after-dinner break, Ye Jian and the rest chose a shady spot and discussed some questions about the morning class. Then, they talked about the Manchester students who came to the National Science University for an exchange.","Ye Jian didn’t know yet. Hearing that, two familiar faces flashed past her mind.","\"One of them is named something like Booth, and the other is Calais...\"","\"Brieth, Cartright.\" Ye Jian, who was lowering her head and drawing an ’attack baseline map’ with He Jing, said their names without raising her head. They were quite long and difficult to remember.","Xu Wen nodded. \"That’s right, that’s right. It’s those two. I heard that the two of them are in the upper echelons of the Manchester hierarchy. They’re even arrogant toward the Manchester students who came with them. Why did the country select such students? Aren’t they afraid of their students making enemies upon their return to the country?\"","After she finished speaking, she rolled her eyes.","Ye Jian picked up her book and gave her a pat. \"Mind your image.\"","\"My mistake. Pretend that it didn’t happen.\" Xu Wen smiled. She continued, \"In the afternoon, we’ll see how powerful they are. They participated in the International Military School Student Competition. They probably have some ability, so they’re proud of their talent.\"","\"Ye Jian participated too.\" Wei Jiaming looked at Ye Jian. \"Have you all forgotten that Ye Jian represented our country’s military school students to participate in the competition in Manchester?\"","...","The air was silent for a few seconds. Xu Wen picked up her textbook and slapped her forehead forcefully. \"That’s right. Jian has participated in it too! I actually forgot about it!\"","She turned her head and stared at Ye Jian. She said in a somewhat blaming tone, \"You’re too low-key. It’s easy to forget. Occasionally, you need to be more high-profile. Do you understand?!\"","\"Do you think everyone’s like you? Everyone knows about all the small achievements you’ve done.\" He Jing put down her pen and finally drew an attack base map. She joined the chat and handed the draft to Ye Jian. \"Have a look. I’ll join in the chat too.\"","Ye Jian took the sketch and laughed. \"What’s there to talk about? They’re here to provoke us, but they’ll only end up miserable in the end. If the situation is serious, we’ll warn and reproach them. If it’s bad, we’ll contact Manchester directly. We won’t let them continue causing trouble.\"","After she finished speaking, the students in the class nodded in unison and continued to talk about the two students. In comparison, the students from Sedoya were many times more humble.","Ye Jian didn’t join in. Holding a pencil, she started to draw the attack point on the attack base and set up a defense and attack plan.","They were commanders. These were all knowledge points.","Now, it was theory. In the future, it would be practice.","The conversation outside the topic didn’t last long. Ye Jian perfected the attack base map and drew a combat map. The few of them immediately threw aside topics that had nothing to do with the matter at hand and devoted themselves to learning.","Ye Jian had been on the battlefield before and had some practical experience. Hence, every time they discussed such topics, it was easy for her to stimulate the other students’ emotions. They could solve related problems in many aspects.","They were commanders. On the battlefield, commanders were the main attackers. If they didn’t have any theoretical knowledge, their four years in the military school would be a waste.","Physical fitness was ranked first, but knowledge was also very important.","The few people who used their afternoon free time to complete the questions from the class dispersed half an hour before the afternoon physical training. They returned to their dormitories to change into their training clothes.","Ye Jian, Xu Wen, and He Jing walked to the gathering point. It wasn’t time for them to gather yet. The students who arrived early were discussing something. When Ye Jian came over, they pulled her over to discuss the topic they were talking about just now."]},{"number":4374,"title":"Chapter 4374: Teach A Lesson","paragraphs":["There were still eight minutes before the gathering time. When she heard the students mention Manchester, Ye Jian raised her head slightly and listened carefully.","After three years in the military school, it was these two students from Manchester who created a new hot topic.","There were exchange students from two countries in the school. The number of exchange students from Sedoya were not as many as those from Manchester.","\"In the morning, two deliberately provocative Manchester students challenged the students of two countries. Just now, the instructor came to inform us that our physical fitness class in the afternoon will be postponed. We’ll go and watch the battle first.\"","A few male students who arrived first conveyed the instructor’s instructions. They rubbed their fists and showed great interest in this.","They were being provoked at their doorstep. If they didn’t retaliate properly, it would make people who didn’t know their place even more unable to distinguish right and wrong.","They couldn’t lose out.","In a competition in the military unit, even if it was a tug-of-war, they couldn’t lose. If that happened, they would lose their dignity.","If they lose their dignity, wouldn’t they be embarrassed?","It was the same in the military unit and the military school.","It was time to gather. The captain finished assembling everyone, and they walked to the sports ground in an orderly manner. Before he reached the training ground, the instructor of the physical training class had already walked toward Ye Jian’s class.","Ye Jian’s class was the last of the four classes. The instructor didn’t wait for her class to walk over. Instead, he quickened his pace when he saw the students.","\"Ye Jian, Song Zhiqiu, step out!\"","\"Yes!\"","\"Yes!\"","As the instructor’s loud and clear voice was heard, Ye Jian’s and Song Zhiqiu’s expressions turned serious as they walked over.","When the two of them walked out, there were two empty spots left. The students following closely behind filled the empty seats one by one. The two of them walked out and stood in front of the instructor. They stood at attention and saluted.","\"There’s a friendly match that was added at the last minute. The two of you, get ready. There are six students from Manchester and six students from Sedoya.\" The instructor went straight to Ye Jian and Song Zhiqiu. He had just learned from the officer that the two Manchester students who had been causing a ruckus recently had participated in the International Military School Student Competition. The instructor immediately thought of Ye Jian.","According to the initial arrangements, they didn’t plan on having Ye Jian participate.","There was no need to use a sledgehammer to crack a nut!","It was different after participating in the International Military School Student Competition. They needed to be careful.","\"There are two people from Manchester’s side who participated in the International Military School Student Competition. No wonder they’re very proud. When you go on stage, attack when you should. Don’t be indecisive. The officer will say a few polite words on stage. The two of you just have to listen.\"","The instructor was looking at Ye Jian. He wanted Ye Jian to show no mercy and crush the opponent directly.","The instructor was a local from Xiang City. From time to time, he would say a few sentences in the Xiang City dialect. It didn’t affect Ye Jian and Song Zhiqiu’s understanding. They knew what he meant.","From the moment Ye Jian saw the two of them, she knew that things wouldn’t be simple. It would be a one-year exchange. Ha, very good. It hadn’t even been one month and they had already become notorious.","\"Having participated in the competition doesn’t mean that one is very strong. However, it’s good to be careful.\" Ye Jian smiled and added, \"I met the two of them during the competition. Their abilities were average at that time. There was nothing outstanding about them. However, after so long, their abilities might have improved greatly. They might no longer be like in the past.\"","\"Let’s see if their strength has increased drastically. We’ll let them see the true strength of the students who participated in the military school’s competition.\" The instructor’s words were meaningful. Ye Jian and Song Zhiqiu, who were participating in the friendly competition later, couldn’t help but narrow their eyes."]},{"number":4375,"title":"Chapter 4375: Profound","paragraphs":["As for the instructor, the words he said off the training ground were opposite to the ruthlessness he displayed on the training ground. His verbal skills were rather artistic. One could find many layers of meaning to the words he said if one were to carefully listen.","Ye Jian and Song Zhiqiu exchanged glances and followed the instructor to the sports ground.","The content of the friendly competition was very simple. There were three courses.","5,000 meters of running, 400 meters of obstacle course, and a round of accurate shooting. As for sit-ups and the like, there was none of that. There were only these three hard subjects.","The physical training class of the four classes was temporarily put aside. The students gathered and sat outside under the sun. The officer went on stage to say a few words. Xu Wen heard someone mutter, \"Friendship first, competition second. Who are you lying to?\"","\"There must be a winner and a loser in a competition. It’s so embarrassing to lose.\"","\"Tsk, tsk, tsk. These words are just said for the sake of it. I wonder if those two fellows can understand it.\"","\"We’ll compete directly. We’ll just have to wait for them to lose. They already issued us a challenge. We have to take them down!\"","Ye Jian wanted to laugh when she heard that. However, as the leader, she had to be more serious.","\"If the leader is speaking, you can’t speak. Do you want to go up?\" This was a matter of discipline. Even though they were in the same dormitory, Ye Jian reprimanded them sternly. \"Run three kilometers after this!\"","Xu Wen was speechless. Disaster had fallen from the sky. Sorrow, sorrow, great sorrow!","With Ye Jian’s criticism, no matter how much Xu Wen nagged, there was no room for discussion when it came to discipline. She could only blame herself for being too talkative!","There were six students from both countries. The National Science University sent six students too.","Ye Jian and Song Zhiqiu stood up and walked to the middle to stand in a line with the other four students. Although the six of them came from different classes, the classes would usually hold small competitions to encourage them. Hence, they were considered acquaintances. They just didn’t know each other’s names.","Of course, Ye Jian was an exception. Everyone knew her.","The six of them nodded slightly as a greeting.","They were standing on the far left. In the middle were the six students from Manchester. On the far right were the students from Sedoya. The scorching sun hung above their heads. They stepped on the grass as they waited for the competition to start.","The rules stated that 18 people would run the 5,000 meters at the same time. They would be ranked first, second, and third.","The 400 obstacle course were relay obstacles. In other words, they needed to run back and forth. The winner was determined according to the shortest relay time.","Accurate shooting meant shooting ten bullets at a fixed point. While moving forward, they had to shoot 20 bullets 30 meters away from the target. All 20 bullets needed to be fired. If one party still had bullets, the team’s score would be invalid. The score would be determined by the total number of shots fired by the various teams.","It was the most basic competition. The difficulty wasn’t increased at all.","The two Manchester students, who were constantly causing trouble, couldn’t hold it in anymore. After the officer finished explaining the rules of the competition, they raised their voices and said a bunch of things. That meant that they understood everything. But did the Chinese and Sedoyan students understand?","The six students from Sedoya frowned at the same time. Their dissatisfaction with the two students from Manchester had reached its peak. They didn’t want to compete with the students in their class, nor did they want to compete with the students from Manchester.","The officer looked at the two Manchester students who were speaking and glanced to the side. A student holding a recorder had already recorded everything."]},{"number":4376,"title":"Chapter 4376: Don’t Hurt The Harmony","paragraphs":["The facial expressions of the National Science University students who were watching the ’friendly match’ turned cold. Their gazes were cold.","Such people needed to be taught a lesson. After teaching them a lesson, they would become obedient.","Xu Wen adjusted her breathing continuously and clenched her fists tightly. She had been in the military for almost three years, but this was the first time she had the urge to hit someone.","She needed to calm down. She had to run 3,000 meters. It wasn’t worth it to add another 3,000 meters for these bastards. She needed to calm down.","The sun was hot, and the sweat kept flowing. The back of their training clothes was already drenched in sweat. In view of the arrogance of the two students, no matter how hot the sun was, it didn’t melt the coldness in the students’ eyes. They all stared at the field, waiting for the two students to be defeated.","With Ye Jian’s appearance, half of the battle was already won!","Then, they looked at the other students who had stepped out. They were all the top soldiers in each class. Even the students in their class wouldn’t have a good time in their hands, let alone those two arrogant fellows.","The strong instructor walked to Ye Jian’s side and reminded her in a low voice, \"The officer is just putting on a show. Remember what I said just now. You have to attack when you need to. You have to attack beautifully.","\"Let them be smug. It’s necessary to let them be smug until they forget themselves. The higher they go, the more miserable their fall. With your experience of torturing us once, you should know how to compete.\"","Ye Jian, who was nodding from time to time, didn’t know whether to laugh or cry when she heard the instructor’s last sentence. \"Instructor, when have I ever tortured you before? I only accepted the challenge because the instructors challenged me first.\"","\"Oh my, are you pretending to be obedient after taking advantage of us? The last time the instructors of the various academies had a meeting, the head instructor directly called us out and said that we were embarrassing. From the first semester onward, we’ve been losing to the female commander, Ye Jian. I still have a 3,000-word self-reflection report in my hands!\"","...","Ye Jian, who had tortured all the instructors in the courtyard, nodded and replied seriously, \"Yes, it’s quite a grievance.\" Wasn’t it a grievance to reflect on themselves?","\"That’s right. I’ll just say it directly. If you can’t win, write the self-reflection report with me. We’ll face this difficulty together and bond as instructor and student.\"","The local instructor spoke Mandarin with his local dialect mixed in. Ye Jian said seriously, \"Don’t worry, Instructor. I promise to complete the mission. I’ll have to trouble you to complete the 3,000-word self-reflection alone!\"","\"Okay, I’ll wait for your success.\"","It didn’t matter if she didn’t suffer with the instructor. With a top student, everything they said was right. Seeing that the competition was about to start, the instructor seized the time and reminded her again, \"Remember, the higher you climb, the worse you fall...","\"Compete well. Friendship comes first. Friendship comes first. Don’t hurt the harmony.\"","From the corners of his eyes, he saw the recorder aimed at the six students from the National Science University. The instructor swallowed his words that were about to reach the tip of his tongue. Instead, he said what he ended up saying.","The first part was for Ye Jian to hear. The last part was for the recorder to hear.","Ye Jian understood everything. \"Friendship comes first. Competition comes second. We encourage each other and coexist peacefully. I remember!\""]},{"number":4377,"title":"Chapter 4377: Appetizer","paragraphs":["The instructor nodded heavily and said with a relieved expression, \"Okay.\"","A good student was a good student. Look at how smart she was. She immediately knew what to say.","It seemed like they were going to hand in the recording of the video. They had to let the leaders who were observing the video know that the students of the National Science University had a tolerant heart toward the students from other countries who came for an exchange with them. The other party was arrogant, but the students from their school just smiled and let it go!","It didn’t matter that the other party said some nonsensical things. They could say whatever they liked. After all, there was freedom of speech.","The Chinese students wouldn’t care about their crazy words, but when it was time to win, they wouldn’t give in just because of their ’generous’ temperaments.","The warm-up match was about to start. 18 students stood on the track. They didn’t go into their running postures. After warming up on the spot for three minutes, the sentry gun shot with a bang. The 18 figures rushed forward like arrows.","The students from Manchester and Sedoya, who came from foreign lands, were talented in running. They were good at explosive sports, such as 100-meter sprints and 300-meter sprints. Running 5,000 meters was not just about explosive power, however. It also required endurance.","5,000-meter run, 3,00-meter run, running with weights, five kilometers of wilderness crossing... There was no day when the students of the National Science University didn’t have to train like that.","They would carry light weights for five kilometers one week and heavy weights for five kilometers in another. After a month, they would carry light weights for 20 kilometers and heavy weights after another month.","There were 12 months in a year and 360 days in a year. They ran every month and every day. 5,000 meters was simply an appetizer.","The students from the two countries with explosive power rushed 100 meters in an instant. Their speed was not exaggerated. They were quite fast. The observing students only saw the shadows of dozens of legs. They rushed forward like monkeys.","The students from the two countries completed their sprints. The six third-year students from the National Science University didn’t sprint directly. After the first round, the six students from the National Science University fell behind the students from Manchester and Sedoya.","The most active person who issued the challenge was the Manchester student, Brieth. He was running in first place, followed closely by Cartright. After one round, they turned their heads to take a look. When they saw that the six students from the National Science University were lagging behind the students from the military schools of their two countries, their noses were almost in the air.","Look, this was the skill of the Chinese military students!","Why didn’t they want to come to China’s military school for an exchange? It was because the military school students of this country couldn’t win against them at all.","\"Brieth, whether we can go to West Point today will depend on today. Come, Brieth, let’s defeat these weak students and let them see how powerful we are!\"","It was as if he could already see victory and knew that they would definitely win.","\"Hahaha, of course, we’ll win. We’ll win beautifully so that the students here will remember my name from now on! Come, buddy, let’s defeat them!\"","Brieth, who was laughing, stretched out his hands in a victory hug. His Achilles tendon was tense, and the muscles in his arms and legs contracted even more. Every time he ran, it was as if his heels didn’t land on the ground. He led the way.","Cartright laughed too. That was right, they would defeat these weak Chinese students! The only thing they respected was the American military academy at West Point.","That world-class military school with countless outstanding students was the military school they wanted to go to."]},{"number":4378,"title":"Chapter 4378: Laugh Until The End","paragraphs":["They should go to the most powerful country and the most powerful military school. They shouldn’t go to a Chinese military school where they could easily defeat the students.","They had had enough of life here. Even breathing in the air made them feel uncomfortable. That was right, it was uncomfortable. It was so uncomfortable that it was torture for them to stay for another minute.","\"Come on, Chinese students. Don’t let us look down on you. Hahaha!\"","Brieth threw his arms and shouted loudly. The short lead fueled his arrogance. His arrogant attitude made the Chinese students sneer.","Arrogant! Just continue with your arrogant ways, then!","The higher you climb, the worse you fall. No matter how proud you are now, I’ll make you miserable later.","The entire sports ground was 1,000 meters. After running five rounds, it was exactly 5,000 meters. The six Chinese students in the first round fell behind, while three of the six students from Sedoya surpassed two students from Manchester.","Currently, the first and second-ranked students on the field were Manchester students. The third and fourth-ranked students were Sedoyan students. The fifth, sixth, and seventh-ranked students were Sedoyan students. The eighth-ranked student was a Sedoyan student. The ninth-ranked student was a Manchester student. The tenth, 11th, and 12th-ranked students were from Sedoya.","Ye Jian, who was breathing evenly, maintained her initial speed. She led the five students to run the first lap. After the second lap, Ye Jian said in a low voice, \"Accelerate evenly. First, surpass the Sedoyan students. Then, we’ll surpass the Manchester students in the fourth lap. Then, we’ll increase our speed in the fifth lap and surpass the Manchester students who are currently ranked first and second.\"","The five students nodded to show that they understood.","As the six of them spoke, they passed by Ye Jian’s class. Xu Wen, who was sitting at the front and observing, didn’t hear what Ye Jian said. However, she saw the five students nodding in unison. The moment they nodded, Xu Wen knew that the exciting moment was about to begin.","She whispered to He Jing, \"Don’t blink. The show is about to start. If you blink, you might miss the most exciting part.\"","\"Because Song Zhiqiu and the other five nodded?\" He Jing saw it too. Her gaze landed on the students who were starting to accelerate. She nodded thoughtfully. \"The show is about to start. With Anchor Ye Jian around, all the soldiers will retreat to the side.\"","Ye Jian’s nickname was Anchor Ye Jian.","The six students from the Chinese Academy of Sciences increased their speed evenly one after another. At 1,500 meters, they surpassed the Sedoyan students. They still maintained their speed and didn’t sprint too hard. At the second and a half round mark, Ye Jian and the other six overtook the Manchester students.","At this moment, Brieth and Cartright were at least 100 meters ahead.","After the third round, the two of them turned around again with relaxed facial expressions. Good, excellent. They liked the current ranking.","Although the weak Chinese students had surpassed several students, so what?","Hahaha, they were still in first and second place!","Brieth was very sure that he had won. In order to humiliate Ye Jian and the rest, he whistled and retreated until Cartright caught up with him.","\"Well done, Breith!\" Catright whistled and praised Brieth for his arrogant behavior. Look, even if they retreated, the Chinese students wouldn’t be able to catch up.","\"There are still two laps left. We’ll definitely win!\" Brieth said confidently. \"I look forward to seeing the interesting expressions on the faces of the Chinese students later. It’ll be quite interesting!\"","After the fourth lap, Brieth and Cartright retracted their gazes proudly. The moment they retracted their gazes, Ye Jian made an ’advance’ gesture. The students of the National Science University smiled when they saw her action.","The students of the National Science University started to perk up. They would see who would have the last laugh!"]},{"number":4379,"title":"Chapter 4379: I Will Decide The Result","paragraphs":["This was the home ground of the National Science University, not the home ground of the two students from Manchester. They were presumptuous, arrogant, and provocative. Fine, they could do whatever they wanted. They could enjoy the process, but they would not get the final laugh.","Seeing this, Xu Wen said to He Jing, \"I’ll go over and talk to the instructor.\"","\"What are you gonna say? Don’t go. Everyone is watching you closely. You’re the only one moving.\" He Jing subconsciously stopped her and grabbed Xu Wen’s wrist. \"Just watch carefully. Don’t run around.\"","Ye Jian started to surpass the others at lightning speed. Under her lead, the other five students started sprinting at the same time. It was time for the students of the National Science University to race.","\"I just have a suggestion to make.\" Xu Wen glanced at the situation and lowered her voice. \"The instructor is in front. I’ll go over and say a few words.\"","He Jing looked at where the instructor was and let go of her hand. She whispered, \"Don’t make a fuss. Just clap. The officer said that friendship comes first and competition comes second.\"","\"Understood, understood. I’ll go over first.\"","Xu Wen bent over and slowly moved to the instructor’s side. She whispered, \"Report.\" She squatted down under the instructor’s gaze and said to the instructor, \"Instructor, our school is a little benevolent to them. This is a competition, but they’re still running normally. It’ll be hard to determine each party’s strength.\"","This 5,000-meter run was no different from normal running. It was completely because the other party were exchange students.","If there was really a competition, they needed to add more challenges to the 5,000 meters.","A 5,000-meter run or 3,000-meter run in a competition was very different from ordinary training.","Tactictical 1: Encounter a drug-stained area during the raid. Students would be required to wear a gas mask and pass quickly.","Tactical 2: A malfunctioning ammunition truck. The students need to manually move the ammunition. During the transportation, the students could not drag or collide.","Tactical 3: If one person is seriously injured during the raid, they must be transferred immediately. The injured must be carried.","Tactical 4: If the students encounter obstacles during the raid, they have to think of a way to pass. Usually, it’s high bars and low bars. They have to use high drills and low strides to pass quickly.","Tactical 5: During the raid, they have to find enemy bunkers on both sides of the road and suppress the enemy with grenades.","This was what a 3,000-meter or 5,000-meter run during a competition in the National Science University usually entailed.","It was also the combat run that Xu Wen mentioned.","The instructor smiled and looked at the female student who usually had many ideas. He smiled and said, \"They can’t even beat us in normal running. It’s enough for them.\"","They couldn’t even win such a simple competition. How could they still have the cheek to say that they were amazing? How could they still have the cheek to be arrogant?","Xu Wen immediately understood the deeper meaning behind the instructor’s words and chuckled. \"Both you and the officer are wise! Let’s teach them a lesson so that they won’t think so highly of themselves in the future.\"","\"Alright, alright. Stop sucking up to me. The physical fitness exam is coming at the end of the year. Hurry up and train. It’s useless to suck up to me. Do you understand? Go back to the team and don’t think too much. The officer knows what to do.\"","Although her brain was quick, that was pretty much it. In view of Xu Wen’s experience in the first year, the instructor simply warned her in advance.","Xu Wen was upset. She was just giving her opinion.","He Jing was amused. \"I told you so. I told you not to run around, but you didn’t listen. Do you understand now? You have a stained record, after all. If I were an instructor, I would think the same way.\""]},{"number":4380,"title":"Chapter 4380: Strength","paragraphs":["The atmosphere on the running ground became more and more tense as Ye Jian led the team to surpass the others. The six students from Sedoya were completely left behind by the students from the National Science University. After four and a half laps, three students from Manchester were surpassed by the students from the National Science University. They had already run 4,500 meters. There were only the last 500 meters left.","Brieth and Cartright turned around. The relaxed expression on their faces disappeared instantly.","What?","What was going on?","Why were the Chinese students so close behind them? They had even surpassed the three students from Manchester!","\"Brieth, they’re catching up. We need to accelerate. If not, they’ll catch up. Damn it, we can’t let them catch up!\"","Cartright only looked back once. He didn’t dare to look anymore. He was a little anxious.","They thought that the Chinese students would always be lagging behind. They didn’t expect them to sprint so vigorously in the last lap.","They really thought that all of them would surpass the six Chinese students. In the end, there was a huge change. They might even surpass him and Brieth. If the Chinese students won... No, no, he couldn’t think about it. It would be a competition that he never wanted to remember!","At this moment, the smile on Cartright’s face was gone. He couldn’t smile anymore.","Brieth pursed his lips in contempt. How could he be defeated by the Chinese students? There were still 500 meters left. It was his turn to sprint.","Without speaking to Cartright again, Brieth started sprinting too.","The atmosphere in the venue was tense, and it was the same among the spectators.","It was the last 500 meters.","400 meters. There were still four hundred meters left!","After Ye Jian, Song Zhiqiu, and the other two students surpassed Cartright, they targeted Brieth and chased after him.","At 300 meters away, the six top students from the National Science University surpassed Cartright. They were getting closer and closer to Brieth!","Ye Jian’s breathing was a little rapid as she stared at the figure running in front of her. She sprinted with all her might for the last 200 meters. The distance got smaller and smaller. She was about to surpass him!","During physical training, the instructor would constantly use the words ’explosive power’ to describe her. The 100-meter sprint was the best way to show explosive power. After running 4,800 meters, Ye Jian treated the last 200 meters as a 100-meter run.","A soldier professor once said, \"A soldier who isn’t good at sprinting 100 meters is an unqualified soldier. A soldier whose strength isn’t up to standard is an unqualified soldier too.\" In the past, Grandpa Gen and Uncle Chen had said similar words.","Ye Jian, who was trained as a sniper, had a terrifying explosive power. The students from Sedoya had an innate advantage, but Ye Jian made up for it with her skills and defeated the innate advantage of the Sedoyans.","The wind blew past like a knife. It was sharp and powerful. It was like a wall that couldn’t be seen but could be felt. It pushed forward quickly from behind. Brieth, who was still 100 meters away, felt the power of this ’wall’. It only took a few seconds to destroy his confidence in winning.","\"Oof...\"","The transparent and pressurized wall got closer and closer to him. Finally, it brushed past his ear. A shadow that was much shorter than him surpassed him.","With Ye Jian as their goal, the five students behind started their final sprint.","Song Zhiqiu was the second to surpass him. His aura was like a mountain pressing down on Brieth, causing his facial expressions to stiffen.","If there was a first, there would be a second. If there was a second, there would be a third...","The five-kilometer sprint ended. Ye Jian slowed down her footsteps. In the end, she walked slowly. Song Zhiqiu and another male student followed closely and completed their sprint."]},{"number":4381,"title":"Chapter 4381: Well Done","paragraphs":["The students from the National Science University won first, second, and third place. Fourth place was Breith, whose expression was completely stiff. As for Cartright, he had only completed his sprint now.","The afternoon sun was scorching hot like an oven. The students sitting on the ground were all drenched in sweat, and their faces were red. Their eyes that were staring at the competition ground were so bright that it was as if they contained sunlight. They did not feel hot and were all energetic.","They won! They won beautifully.","Applause sounded like a tide. There were no shouts or cheers. There was only an orderly applause that reflected the discipline of the soldiers.","The applause didn’t last long. After a few seconds, the applause disappeared like a tide. In the venue, Cartright and Brieth from Manchester stood together. Their arrogance was gone. There was only unwillingness.","Now, the two of them were in an extremely bad mood. It was so bad that they didn’t want to talk to anyone, including the students from Manchester.","The students from Sedoya had already shaken hands with Ye Jian and the rest. The students from Sedoya were much more humble than the students from Manchester. They congratulated Ye Jian immediately.","The other four Manchester students were a step behind. They mainly went to comfort Brieth and Cartright. Unexpectedly, the two of them didn’t appreciate it at all. They used their eyes to signal the students who wanted to comfort them.","They didn’t need the comfort of these poor people.","\"We just haven’t adapted to their competition. We’ll definitely win the next round!\"","Cartright held his head tightly and bit his thick lips. The whites of his eyes were especially white because of his tanned skin. His eyes, which were slightly protruding, looked especially ferocious because he was speaking forcefully.","They should be the ones winning. They should be the ones defeating the Chinese students!","They lost just like that. They were very unwilling and could not accept it at all.","\"We participated in the International Military School Student Competition. We were ranked sixth. These Chinese students can’t beat us!\"","He pointed his finger at his chest even harder. He couldn’t accept the results of the competition at all. \"We should be the ones winning! They can’t beat me and you!\"","\"Shut up!\"","Brieth glared at Cartright, who kept talking. He couldn’t accept it either, but the result of the competition was that they lost.","They lost!","\"Damn it!\"","He didn’t expect to lose!","Cartright, whose chest was still heaving up and down, shut up. Without his interference, Brieth took a deep breath and pointed at Ye Jian. \"Look at that Chinese student now. Did you notice anything? Have we seen her before?\"","\"Who?\"","\"She’s a Chinese female student. Have we seen her before? I think I’ve seen her before. Where have I seen her before?\"","Brieth was breathing heavily. His gaze was fixed on Ye Jian. He kept searching his mind for where he had seen her.","He was sure that he had seen her somewhere before!","\"Of course, we haven’t seen her. This is the first time we came to this military school. She was the one who received us.\" Cartright turned around and relaxed his ankle. He stared at the Chinese student who was talking to the students from Manchester and Sedoya.","\"No, no, we’ve seen this woman in other places. Think about it carefully. We’ve definitely seen her before! You and I have seen her before!\"","\"You and I have seen her? A Chinese student? We only saw Chinese students together once. We only saw Chinese students during the International Military School Competition!\""]},{"number":4382,"title":"Chapter 4382: Recognized","paragraphs":["Yes, yes!","He remembered. He finally remembered.","That was right. They had seen her at the International Military School Competition!","Brieth’s gaze turned even darker. He pursed his thick lips, and his voice became gloomy. \"The Chinese student beat us in that competition. Now, we’re competing with a student who beat us in the past. Will we win?\"","\"Wait, wait, Brieth, why are you so sure that it’s her? I’m sorry, I’m not suspecting you. It’s just that I don’t have any impression of her. During the martial arts competition, was she in the Chinese team?\"","Cartright realized that he had no impression of Ye Jian at all. When he thought about it again, he still had no impression of it. The facial features of Asians seemed to be the same. His memory was vague.","\"It’s her. I’m sure it’s her. There’s no mistake. Next, we need to think about how to defeat her. We need to think about it carefully.\"","Brieth was certain because he had heard every student from Japan talking about a Chinese female student.","Later, when Manchester lost to the Chinese students, he specially asked the Japanese students which student was it that they kept praising. If he remembered correctly, it was her!","Brieth’s affirmation made Cartright’s mood even worse.","There was no time for them to think about how to win against the Chinese students. The second round of the 400-meter obstacle course was about to start. Whistles sounded, and the 18 people gathered.","The 400-meter obstacle course was the most challenging part of the military basic skills training. It tested the physical fitness and willpower of the soldiers. At the same time, it was the most difficult and dangerous course.","There were a total of eight sets of obstacles and 18 obstacles.","China wasn’t the only country that had this basic military course. Other countries had it too, but the content of their training was different.","Now, Brieth regretted it.","He regretted that when the Chinese officer asked him if he had any objections to the content of the competition, he had shaken his head and replied, \"No.\" He said he had no objections.","Now, he had objections.","That was because there was a Chinese student from the military school who had participated in the competition and won against Manchester.","It was useless even if he regretted it. He couldn’t ask for that female Chinese student to be replaced!","\"All the best, Ye Jian! Take them down. Don’t stand on ceremony!\"","When Ye Jian walked past the students from her class, she heard a few voices cheering for her secretly. Friendship was the most important thing. How could they shout for her to take down the other party?","They had to be civilized and polite. They didn’t want to embarrass themselves in front of others.","Ye Jian nodded and smiled, indicating that she would do her best.","The other party had already stepped on their dignity. How could the Chinese let them do whatever they wanted?!","The 400-meter obstacle course in the National Science University wasn’t too difficult. The 400-meter obstacle course that Ye Jian had trained in was specially set up for special forces soldiers. The difficulty and danger increased exponentially.","Hence, every time there was a 400-meter obstacle course training in school, Ye Jian would always be far ahead of the students.","The 400-meter obstacle course required soldiers to be able to run, jump, climb, support their balance, and climb. Not only did they have to have explosive power, but they also had to have endurance, coordination, and agility. Now, it was a relay competition. The students in the competition had to be faster to improve the overall results of the team.","The students from Manchester and Sedoya, who had been here for almost a month, had all undergone a 400-meter obstacle course. They had similar training in their country. The three groups of participants stood in teams, and the instructor at the starting point whistled.","Ye Jian wasn’t the first runner. She was the last."]},{"number":4383,"title":"Chapter 4383: Start The Brilliant Show","paragraphs":["The whistle of the competition sounded. The 100-meter sprint was completed in an instant. This was the start. It was also the easiest part of the entire 400-meter obstacle training. The students from Manchester and Sedoya completed the 100-meter sprint with the Chinese students.","The atmosphere of the competition in the venue reached its climax as the distance between the students from the three countries widened. Three students had already passed. The students from Manchester were currently two obstacles ahead of the Chinese students. The Sedoyan students took three tries to pass. In an instant, the distance widened. They were four obstacles behind the Chinese students and six obstacles behind Manchester.","The 400-meter obstacle course consisted of a 100-meter sprint, bypassing the flag, crossing the trench, jumping over a low wall, jumping over a high-plank jump platform, crossing a ladder, crossing a wooden bridge, climbing up a wall, crawling through a low-pile net, passing the low-pile net, circling the wooden bridge, and standing on a pillar.","This was the 400-meter obstacle course in the National Science University. It was also the 400-meter obstacle course in the military unit.","The Xueyu unit and Storm Commando Brigade increased the difficulty of the original 400-meter obstacle course. For example, when you jumped over the short wall, you had to grab something on the short wall. When you jumped over the high platform, you had to take out your gun and shoot. Another example was that there were flames on the low pile net. It could be said that every obstacle was more difficult than the 400-meter obstacle course of the National Science University.","This was one of the differences between the special forces and ordinary military unit training.","The students from the four classes of the National Science University weren’t nervous just because their team was temporarily behind by two obstacles. They knew the team would catch up and do their best.","The third relay was completed. The Chinese student who was two obstacles behind was only nine seconds behind the Manchester student who ran back. Song Zhiqiu took the relay. When they reached the ladder, Song Zhiqiu was already parallel to the student from Manchester. By the time they reached the high wall, Song Zhiqiu was already in the lead.","China became the first in the fifth relay, surpassing the Manchester students by three obstacles.","Cartright had already completed the relay. When he saw the Chinese students surpassing them again, a few of his teeth, which were especially bright because of his tanned skin, almost shattered.","The sixth person was Brieth. He was originally the first, but when he saw that Ye Jian was the last, he immediately requested to change the order. The officer and instructor satisfied his request, so he went from the first to the last runner.","Standing at the side, Cartright gritted his teeth and said, \"Anselm might not be able to surpass the Chinese students. Brieth, you’re our hope of defeating the Chinese!\"","They wanted to win. They really wanted to win. Only by winning would they be able to leave this extremely bad place and go to West Point which they yearned for the most.","They couldn’t wait any longer!","If possible, they really wanted to leave today!","Song Zhiqiu climbed over the wire fence. As he crawled forward, his sweat dripped on the dust on the wire fence. His face was all sweaty as he climbed over with dust all over his body.","After the fifth relay, it was Ye Jian’s turn to appear. Brieth provoked Ye Jian silently. He was tall. As long as he raised his chin and looked down, he would have a disdainful expression.","The hostility was too deep. It was difficult for Ye Jian to ignore it."]},{"number":4384,"title":"Chapter 4384: Chinese Youth","paragraphs":["Ye Jian, who had been exposed to the sun and was wearing a training cap, had sweat on her face. Even her eyebrows were drenched in sweat. She returned the other party’s faint but contemptuous gaze.","From the moment Brieth came to the school to now, the students of the National Science University had never argued with him. Every time he provoked them, they would ignore him or smile.","This made Brieth even more arrogant. He thought that the students of the National Science University were weak and easy to bully.","He was used to being polite. Now that he was suddenly provoked by Ye Jian, his first reaction was disbelief. He couldn’t believe that he would be provoked by a student from the National Science University.","In an instant, Brieth exploded.","He clenched his fists so tightly that his knuckles were cracking. He was declaring war on Ye Jian.","What was there to be afraid of?","Song Zhiqiu was getting closer and closer to Ye Jian. Finally, he returned to the starting point. Ye Jian glanced at Brieth coldly. Her figure was like a whirlwind as she completed her 100-meter sprint. She used her fastest speed to go around the flag that marked designated spot.","The 100-meter sprint was just the beginning. The real difficulty lay in the 200-meter and 300-meter sprints in the middle.","At the beginning of the 200 meters, there was the five-step pile. The students had to step firmly while maintaining their center of gravity. The instructor would point out that if they wanted to pursue speed, they had to remember to step firmly or they would sprain their ankle.","This was the first time the new students were completing the 400-meter obstacle course. There were definitely many people who failed the five-step pile. They sprained their ankle until it was as big as a swollen egg. It was so painful that they needed their comrades to carry them into the infirmary to bandage it.","They had to be fast and accurate. While aiming at the target, they had to land accurately. They couldn’t think about acting cool. They had to stand stably and walk quickly. From the first to the third year, as long as the students encountered a 400-meter obstacle course, the instructor would always remind them of these things.","It was unknown how many times Ye Jian had done this from junior high to now. The 400-meter obstacle course wasn’t difficult for her.","In Ye Jian’s freshman year, it was the first time for the new students to complete the 400-meter obstacle training. They were clearly in their prime, but they became no different from old, weak, and crippled soldiers.","Ye Jian had trained five years earlier than the students. When she was still in the military unit deep in the mountains of Shuikou Village, she had been fighting with the soldiers. Hence, she didn’t feel like it was her first time completing the obstacle course despite being a freshman. She completed the 400-meter obstacle course in one go, making for an eye-catching sight.","Even though she didn’t think so, the instructor had his eyes on her from then on.","In the blink of an eye, three years had passed. The memories of her freshmen year were still vivid in her mind. It was as if it was just yesterday.","The students from Manchester and Sedoya were also quite agile. To be able to become exchange students and come to other military schools, their military qualities were quite good. They wouldn’t be lacking. It was difficult for the students from the National Science University had to win every subject.","This was why the instructor looked for Ye Jian at the last minute.","If they lost, they wouldn’t just be losing their reputation.","After the five-step pile, the ’deep pit’ was waiting 200 meters ahead.","There were two forms of passing through the deep pit.","One: Jump into the pit and jump directly over.","Two: Jump into the pit and climb up.","This friendly match was the second.","If the highest difficulty of the 400-meter obstacle course was five stars, then this subject had three stars."]},{"number":4385,"title":"Chapter 4385: As Strong As The Country","paragraphs":["The walls of the deep pit were two meters, and they were vertical. There were no stepping objects inside. If you jumped down, you would have to climb out of the two meters high wall.","The students from Manchester and Sedoya suffered in the pit.","Ye Jian jumped down into the two-meter-deep pit without blinking. Then, as if her feet were springs, she jumped out of the pit with a whoosh. The entire tactical action was so exciting that the officer and instructor took the lead to clap.","Her actions were handsome, agile, and filled with the sharpness of courage. The students’ hearts were burning with excitement.","So cool!","Brieth only started his 100-meter sprint now!","Ye Jian came out of the deep pit with a whoosh and rushed to the short wall.","The short wall was two meters wide, 1.1 meters high, and 20 centimeters thick. The pit was 50 centimeters wide and 40 centimeters high. The lower edge was 60 centimeters from the ground. It needed to be completed in one leap.","With the help of the explosive force from the deep pit, Ye Jian looked like a small rock that was shot out of a slingshot. Before the instructor and officer could take a breather, she had already rushed to the low wall.","She placed one hand on the low wall and kicked it forcefully. At this moment, all the focus of her body was on her right hand that was supporting the low wall. She used the momentum of her body to jump forward. The slender and fearless figure in the camouflage uniform was like an eagle spreading its wings and flying high. Her tactical actions were done in one go. She jumped over the low wall with instantaneous strength.","\"Good job!\"","Thunderous applause sounded. This was the 400-meter obstacle course. Even the instructor had to admit that he was already behind Ye Jian.","Her textbook-level actions and speed were so exciting that people couldn’t help but applaud her.","Xu Wen, who was clapping hard, felt a burning pain in her palms. However, what did it matter? She didn’t feel any pain.","She was proud!","He Jing’s palms were hurting too. She, who had always been steady, tilted her head and said to Xu Wen, who kept cheering, \"She’s so cool! If I were a man, I’d definitely woo her!\"","\"Stop dreaming. You’re in no position to go after her. If I were a man, I would’ve done it long ago. That fellow is lucky. Even if he’s handsome, he’s not as cool as our Little Jian!\"","Xu Wen clapped her hands as she spoke. That ’fellow’ was none other than Lieutenant Colonel Xia Jinyuan, who was training a group of soldiers in a certain base.","Ye Jian’s tactical actions pushed the entire competition to the highest point. Every student’s blood boiled. All their emotions were affected by Ye Jian. They cheered and applauded for her.","The officer turned around and looked at the students who were clapping. He smiled at the instructor beside him and said, \"Impressive. I’m a Chinese youth. Our country is boundless!\"","Facing the hot-blooded young students and the future officers of the military unit, the officer thought of a national saying.","’I’m a young Chinese. I’m not old! I’m a Chinese youth. I’m as strong as my country!","They had their passion and their fearlessness. Chinese youths were as strong as their country!","The instructor, who didn’t even blink, stared at the slender figure on the field and replied to the officer, \"How many Ye Jians will there be in the future? How many times will today’s events be recreated? Will we see people like her in the generations to come?\""]},{"number":4386,"title":"Chapter 4386: A New Genius","paragraphs":["The applause behind them was endless. The scorching sun didn’t make the students flinch. It was like a fire that ignited all the hot blood in the students’ hearts and burned their youth and sweat.","At that moment, their applause was for Ye Jian. The fire in their eyes burned brighter because of Ye Jian.","Listening to the applause and looking at the valiant female student on the field, the officer smiled brightly. \"There will definitely be more rising stars!","\"The power of a role model doesn’t just affect one generation. Ye Jian’s four years in school directly affected her batch and the next three batches. The next three batches can influence generation after generation. This is what Chinese youths should be like!\"","The officer’s reply made the instructor laugh. That was right. What happened today would definitely happen in the future!","The difficulty level for this obstacle was five stars. The high wall was 1.8 meters high, two meters long, and 50 centimeters wide. The high wall was in front and the low wall was behind. Ye Jian’s eyes were cold and sharp. Her arms and legs were filled with strength. Kicking the ground, she jumped. The moment she jumped, she grabbed the edge of the high wall with her hands. Then, she used the combined strength of her legs and arms to knee the high wall. She held her breath and climbed up.","She was fast and stable. The students watching were dazzled. One second ago, they were still immersed in the excitement of her jumping over the short wall. Before they could pull themselves away, she had already climbed up and jumped to the low wall!","\"F*ck! She’s brilliant! She clearly showed mercy to us in the past!\"","When the male students in their class saw this, they accidentally blurted out the words they usually kept to themselves in school.","Ye Jian climbed over two low walls and jumped down from the last low wall. She had already left Brieth far behind. There was no need to say anything about the Sedoyan students.","\"Come on, Ye Jian. Come on, Ye Jian!\"","\"All the best, Ye Jian! Work harder to break the record! You can definitely do it!\"","\"New record, new record. Ye Jian, all the best! All the best!\"","It was unknown who shouted first, but in an instant, every student who was watching the competition was affected. Not only that, but the fourth-year and first-year students from a few classes also ran over in an orderly manner to watch the battle.","An instructor in charge of training had passed by unintentionally. He then hurriedly ran over and called the students who were training over. He alerted the other classes. Hence, the students from the fourth and first years came.","They came at the right time to see Ye Jian leading the 400-meter obstacle course.","Before they could approach, they suddenly heard the third-year students shouting, \"Ye Jian, all the best!\" The fourth-year and first-year instructors shouted at the top of their lungs, \"Maintain the formation and speed up! Run!\"","Whoosh... Whoosh... Whoosh... The sound of orderly and rhythmic footsteps could be heard. Almost 200 students sped up and ran over.","Ye Jian reached the ladder obstacle with a difficulty level of four stars.","15 steel round pipes formed a horizontal ladder. Each one was three to four centimeters in diameter and was 2.5 meters in height. Ye Jian, who was running in front of the ladder, jumped up and grabbed the second horizontal bar with both hands. She used the momentum of her body to quickly cross her hands and move forward.","Liu Yang couldn’t help but swallow his saliva when he saw this. In his first year of university, he had failed to complete the ladder obstacle.","When he was hanging with his hands crossed and moving forward, his whole body was not coordinated properly and he suffered a shoulder joint dislocation on the spot. For a while, he was afraid of the ladder.","They were classmates for three years but he never saw Ye Jian fail during training."]},{"number":4387,"title":"Chapter 4387: Myth","paragraphs":["Ye Jian had always been in the lead in the class. If any students had any problems during training, she would be the first one they looked for. The instructor would be the second.","Every time this happened, the instructors would say that Ye Jian’s class was the easiest.","If there was a problem, the students could look for Ye Jian. If not, they could look for the instructor.","Ye Jian had been worshiped by her classmates for the past three years.","Some male students didn’t want to admit defeat. They were men, after all. How could they not be able to defeat the female students? The male students who didn’t want to admit defeat worked hard in private. They even formed a small team with the goal of defeating Ye Jian.","What was the result?","Yes, the result was that... they were still defeated by Ye Jian unintentionally. Moreover, Ye Jian never felt that she had been challenged by male students.","She had never noticed it and continued to do her best to help the students in her class. As time passed, the male students who refused to admit defeat were convinced.","They admired Ye Jian’s character and ability.","How did Liu Yang know that such a small group existed in the past?","That was because... he was once a member of this small group.","Looking at the valiant figure on the field and then looking at the stopwatch in his hand, Liu Yang once again felt pity for his ignorance.","Ye Jian wasn’t someone who could be defeated easily.","Normally, she was at the top of the ranks in school when it came to physical fitness. Now that she was competing, she was so strong that people kept swallowing their saliva.","The students from the first and fourth years watched the competition. The applause was even louder and more enthusiastic. The voices were like surging tides, wave after wave.","\"All the best, Ye Jian! All the best, Ye Jian!\"","They were all shouting ’Ye Jian, all the best’. The instructor leading the team was afraid that the students from Manchester and Sedoya would feel unhappy, so he laughed and scolded them, \"Bastards, do you want to cause trouble? Cheer for the students from Manchester and Sedoya too. Don’t be so clueless.\"","While Liu Yang was still swallowing his saliva, he heard the cheers for the students from Manchester and Sedoya. Wu Bingxian, who was sitting with him, asked in a low voice, \"How many seconds have passed? Can you break the record?\"","Looking at the stopwatch and the time on it, Liu Yang swallowed his saliva with difficulty and said in a low voice, \"If I say that Ye Jian will break the record and complete the 400-meter obstacle, would you... believe me?\"","\"Yes! Why not? I believe that she can break the record now!\"","Wu Bingxian didn’t suspect anything and replied with certainty.","\"In that case, she can break the record...\" Liu Yang nodded and replied seriously.","Wu Bingxian, who had been staring at the competition ground, smiled. \"I knew she would break the record! She’s too good!\"","He had no reason to doubt that Ye Jian couldn’t break the record. While he was talking to Liu Yang, Ye Jian crossed the wooden bridge and climbed over the high wall. Her speed was so fast that his heart was beating very fast!","Low posture and agility were the skills of the ’low pile net’. The 12 pillars were formed into two rows. The rows were two meters apart and the distance was one meter. The piles were 50 centimeters above the ground.","If the highest difficulty of the 400-meter obstacle course was five stars, the ’low pile net’ would be two stars. A two-star low pile net wouldn’t be difficult for Ye Jian.","She bent her knees and pounced down. Her slender body dived forward. She reached out her hands to the ground and used the force of her kicks to enter the net."]},{"number":4388,"title":"Chapter 4388: Showing Off","paragraphs":["\"Good! Beautiful!\"","The instructors were all cheering. This action was so perfect that it could be turned into a video to be taught in classes!","Ye Jian didn’t hear how loud and enthusiastic the cheers were. She only had eyes for every obstacle that needed to be passed. All her attention was on the competition.","The 400-meter obstacle course in school was not a difficult thing for her. Even so, it was a competition, and she would not be careless because of this. She would only give it her all and make Brieth and Cartright unable to raise their heads because of their arrogance!","They could leave, but they could not do so feeling contempt for the students of the National Science University.","They could leave, but they had to tuck their tails between their legs. In the future, when they saw Chinese soldiers, they would know be too embarrassed and wish to avoid them!","Chinese youths were as strong as their country. Chinese soldiers were sacred and inviolable!","Ye Jian crossed her arms and kicked with her left and right legs as she moved forward. She was even more agile and faster than the rattlesnakes slithering in the desert.","When she got out of the net, she didn’t stop at all. She propped herself up with her arms and stood up in the blink of an eye. She quickly moved forward with dust on her body.","Her knees and elbows were especially dirty. Her face... was even dirtier. She was sweating, and her sweat was stained with dust. It was black and gray as if she had just returned from scavenging.","Who would stare at her face? Who would care how dirty she was?","No one.","They could only see Ye Jian’s agile figure and her strong stamina. Every time she passed through obstacles, no one could compare to her. No one dared to compete with her.","Ye Jian displayed a sharpness that she didn’t usually show in school. She was like a general who fought on the battlefield and subdued the opposing country.","She let the students see a side of her that she had never shown before.","They were cheering for her again. Their blood was boiling.","Cartright felt very dizzy and heavy. He started to lose his balance and panic. He couldn’t help but worry.","They might lose.","It seemed like they would really lose!","Brieth was too far behind!","The Chinese woman had gone around the flag and started returning. Brieth had yet to complete the obstacle course!","\"Damn it!\"","They would really lose!","Cartright became anxious. He looked around, and his eyes kept moving as if he wanted to do something.","He had to do something because he didn’t want to lose!","What could he do?","Cartright was panicking and thinking wildly. Brieth, who was competing, was panicking too, especially when he saw Ye Jian returning. Brieth made a huge mistake in his hurry. He climbed up the wall and didn’t manage to pass it in one go. Ye Jian passed by in an instant and went around the wooden bridge in front of him.","At this point, the outcome was already decided. It was irreversible.","Although the ending was decided, the officers and instructors no longer paid attention to the ending. They focused on whether Ye Jian could break the record set by a student with the surname Xia!","\"Faster, faster! Very good, very good! Steady, steady, don’t panic. You must be steady!\"","\"Okay!\"","\"Good! Hurry! Hurry! You still have time!\"","All the instructors weren’t standing on the same spot anymore. They didn’t realize that they had taken a few steps forward. Their eyes were shining as they stared at the female student, Ye Jian, who was sweating and fighting for glory."]},{"number":4389,"title":"Chapter 4389: Breaking Records","paragraphs":["This was Ye Jian’s moment. The faster she ran, the more attention everyone would have on her. As for Brieth’s mistake, she didn’t notice it.","The glaring white sunlight enveloped everyone. They couldn’t open their eyes because of the light, but because of the agile figure on the field, they widened their eyes. Everyone’s gaze was focused on one person, and all the shouts were for her.","At that moment, the field was boiling with passion.","After passing through the high-plank jump platform, crawling through the short hole, and flying over the trench, the 400-meter obstacle course was about to be completed.","The sixth student from Sedoya knew that he couldn’t beat the Chinese student. Although he still tried his best to complete the competition, the shouts in the field were too shocking. He couldn’t help but look at the fast-moving Chinese female student.","She was too fast. Every obstacle was like flat ground to her. She was just running on flat ground. It was not difficult at all.","If he hadn’t seen it with his own eyes, he wouldn’t have believed that someone could run so fast. He wouldn’t have believed that it was a female student.","Ye Jian didn’t know how fast she was. She bypassed the flag and turned it. The 100-meter sprint started.","Liu Yang stared at the stopwatch and then looked at the sprinting figure. His breathing was already tight.","Soon, soon, soon!","Come on!","Come on!","Ye Jian!","After completing their sprint, the applause and shouts of the spectators were pushed to a peak again. All the students stood up and applauded and cheered for the figure that brought them a visual feast.","Ye Jian didn’t look away until she finished her sprint. She didn’t know that the audience was so excited.","Song Zhiqiu and the other five students looked at Ye Jian with burning eyes.","\"Ye Jian, you might be able to break a new record.\" As she walked closer, Song Zhiqiu spoke to her in a low voice. \"The officers and instructors are so nervous that they’ve been standing there the entire time. Look, they’re watching the time now.\"","Hearing this, Ye Jian, whose back was wet, smiled and shook her head. \"That’s impossible. Our senior’s records won’t be broken so easily.\"","\"Not necessarily. Look at the officer’s expression. He’s very excited.\" A student from another class whispered. He heard their conversation and couldn’t help but join in.","The two of them thought that Ye Jian had broken the record and knew who the senior who had set the record was.","Because Ye Jian knew who it was, she calmly thought that it was impossible.","It was impossible to break the record Captain Xia set.","He was an invincible legend in the Xueyu unit. There was still a huge gap between their abilities. How could she break the record he set?","The other three students didn’t hear the conversation. All of them smiled for Ye Jian. Ye Jian did a good job! She crushed the two most arrogant students today. How refreshing!","\"That Mr. Pride hasn’t finished running. I can already see how dark his expression is now.\"","The last student chuckled and gestured for the students to look at Cartright who was finishing the competition.","Perhaps it was because he had been staring at Ye Jian, who had returned to her team, but Cartright instantly caught the gaze of the Chinese students. Seeing this, he retracted his gaze in a sorry state. He instantly realized that what he was doing was inappropriate and glared back fiercely."]},{"number":4390,"title":"Chapter 4390: Angry","paragraphs":["The Chinese students in the competition pursed their lips in unison and gave a half-smile. It was enough to make Cartright so angry that he was about to go crazy.","Cartright was so angry that his chest was about to explode.","As this went on, he seemed even more guilty and lacking in confidence. No matter how wide his eyes were, he had no aura.","These Chinese students clearly didn’t take him seriously!","As for Ye Jian, she didn’t look at the other party at all. Instead, she walked toward the instructor who was waving at her.","Something seemed to have happened in her class. It was a little restless. A few students stood beside the instructor and spoke in low voices.","The stopwatch in Liu Yang’s hand was in the instructor’s hand. A few students stared at the numbers on it. Liu Yang asked, \"Instructor, did she break the record?\"","The instructor, who was holding the stopwatch tightly, glanced at Liu Yang. The instructor, who had always been ruthless in training and only ever showed a serious expression, seemed a little excited now. He asked, \"You started the time from the moment Ye Jian started running? Did you make a mistake?\"","\"That’s right. I only pressed it when Ye Jian started running. Even if I wasn’t accurate, I must’ve pressed it one or two seconds later,\" Liu Yang replied firmly. \"There’s no mistake.\"","The instructor took a deep breath before replying, \"That’s right... She broke the record.\"","Although they already knew the result, they were excited again when the instructor confirmed it.","Since the instructor said that she broke the record, that meant she really broke it!","It was indeed broken.","The students accepted Ye Jian’s record easily because they felt that Ye Jian could break the record.","However, she was suspicious.","\"I really broke it? Did you make a mistake? I’m a little suspicious. That’s impossible. How could I break our senior’s record?\"","She doubted herself. Even though the stopwatch clearly recorded the time, she didn’t immediately believe that she had really broken the record.","She had never thought of breaking Captain Xia’s school record.","Ye Jian thought that it was impossible. She thought that the difference in strength between her and Xia Jinyuan was huge, but she forgot that she had broken Xia Jinyuan’s record in the past. Xia Jinyuan wasn’t as powerful then as he was now.","In the past, Xia Jinyuan personally admitted that he wasn’t as powerful as the current Ye Jian.","In that case, it was normal that she could break his record.","The officer was amused by her reaction.","Breaking the record was a good thing for other people. Why was she suspecting it again and again?","\"Are you saying that you don’t believe in your own capabilities?\" the officer asked back. If it weren’t for the competition, he really wanted to have a good chat.","Why did she have so little confidence in herself?!","That wouldn’t do.","Ye Jian held her head high and shook her head. She smiled and said, \"It’s not that I don’t believe in my own ability. I just don’t believe that I could break the record.\"","\"That’s more like it.\" The officer waved his hand and said, \"Let’s talk about it later. Let’s finish the competition first. The Manchester students are back. You can return to the team first.\"","At this moment, Ye Jian knew that she had really broken the record set by Xia Jinyuan. She smiled and replied clearly, \"Yes.\" She stood at attention and at ease. Then, she turned back and returned to the team.","\"She thought I was lying to her...\" The officer shook his head helplessly. However, the smile on his face was deep.","Before he could speak, the head instructor said, \"Give me a chance to speak later, thank you.\"","The officer left with a smile.","Ye Jian, who turned around and returned to the team, couldn’t help but smile. She had really broken Captain Xia’s record. This feeling... was really good. It was so good that... Yes, she really wanted to call him and tell him."]},{"number":4391,"title":"Chapter 4391: Coward","paragraphs":["Ye Jian broke the record that Xia Jinyuan set when he was in school. Ye Jian’s excitement was completely different from the students’. The reason why she felt good was because she had gotten much closer to him.","Brieth completed the 100-meter sprint. Sweat dripped down his face. He gritted his teeth and clenched his fists.","When the instructor in charge of their class saw this, his eyes turned very cold and dark. It was not good to stay for long. They should complete the exchange and return to the country in advance.","\"Damn it, they’re all mocking us for losing to the Chinese students! Brieth, we’ll leave this rotten place, but we can’t leave in defeat!","\"But we’ve lost!\"","Brieth didn’t need to be reminded. He initially had the same thoughts, but they had already lost!","Damn it, they had already lost!","\"We have to win before we can leave! We can’t become a joke in the eyes of the Chinese students!\" Cartright told Brieth his plan. \"...We’ll postpone returning to the country until we win.\"","The gathering whistle sounded, not giving Brieth a chance to answer or consider.","This time, the two of them didn’t dare to do anything to show that they were special. Even their arrogance had subsided a lot. In Xu Wen’s words, they were cowards.","\"Gather!\"","The whistle sounded. The 18 contestants gathered and lined up. The students were already quiet. Although they didn’t say anything else, they were all very excited, especially the students from Ye Jian’s class. They were so excited that they couldn’t calm down for a long time.","Xu Wen was so excited that her face was red. She secretly pinched her arm to prevent herself from screaming.","She was very excited and happy.","Ye Jian broke the record.","\"Calm down. Why does it look like you’re the one who broke the record?\" He Jing, who couldn’t stand it anymore and had no choice but to remind her. \"Look at how you’ve pinched yourself. When did you like to hurt yourself?\"","\"I’m happy. Hehe, I’m really happy. When I go back during the holidays, I can have a good chat at home about my most powerful comrade.\"","\"You’re thinking too much. You won’t have the chance to go home if you leave the company during the summer vacation.\"","...","Xu Wen remembered that she needed to be transferred to the company during the summer vacation this year!","The last round of accurate shooting competition was about to begin. The 18 students needed to check their equipment when they went to the competition venue.","It was unknown if it was intentional or not, but the students from Sedoya, who were standing in the middle of the line, became the farthest away from the competition venue. The students from Manchester were in the middle.","The Manchester students walked in a line. On the left were the Sedoyan students, and on the right were the Chinese students.","After changing their positions, Brieth stared at Ye Jian with a dark gaze. His cold voice floated over. \"I know that you’re very happy now. But don’t think that you’ve defeated us! There’s still one more match. Just wait!\"","Ye Jian glanced at him from the corners of her eyes, looking beautiful.","\"There’s one more match. Even if you win, you’ll still lose to us overall,\" Ye Jian replied lightly. She didn’t waste any time. One sentence was enough.","Behind her, Song Zhiqiu pursed his lips and held back his laughter.","Ye Jian had always been refined when she spoke. Being refined didn’t mean that she didn’t have any offensive power. Brieth wanted to show off in front of her and be arrogant. He had found the wrong person.","Brieth was so angry that his chest hurt. His breathing became exceptionally rapid. His humiliated self-esteem didn’t allow him to lose. He gritted his teeth and shot back once more.","\"You participated in the International Military School Student Competition in the past. You can beat us, but do you think they can beat us?\""]},{"number":4392,"title":"Chapter 4392: Lesson","paragraphs":["He recognized her?","Ye Jian raised her eyebrows slightly and tilted her head. She looked over as if she was looking at a clown. \"Isn’t it already enough for me to beat you and Cartright?","\"Stop trying to put up a fight. You can’t beat me or my comrades. The losers are provoking the winners again and again. What do you want to say? Do you want to remind us that you’re always losers?\"","\"F*ck you!\"","Brieth was completely enraged and started cursing. His voice was not low. Even the instructor heard him clearly.","Song Zhiqiu’s expression turned cold. He said viciously, \"Brieth, know your place!\"","\"Of course, I know. And you can only listen!\"","Brieth, who was not as powerful as Ye Jian, seemed to have a newfound surge of arrogance. He even raised his middle finger.","He thought that everything was fine. Before Song Zhiqiu could do anything, the instructor who had his eyes on him rushed over and grabbed his erect middle finger.","\"Ahhh... F*ck, f*ck! Let go, let go!\"","Brieth, whose finger was about to break, screamed. He knew that the Chinese students wouldn’t dare to do anything to him, but he didn’t expect the instructor to dare to do something to him.","So what if she was an exchange student?","Here, they had to abide by the rules and discipline.","And the instructor had the absolute right to educate him!","The instructor couldn’t speak English, so he said in Chinese, \"If you don’t want your finger, I can snap it off immediately.\" Then, he said to Ye Jian, \"Translate the original words so that he can understand.\"","Brieth even cursed. If the instructor didn’t teach him a lesson, would he think that the instructors here were just mascots?","Brieth could provoke the Chinese students, but he didn’t have the guts to face the instructor.","Especially after listening to Ye Jian’s translation, his expression froze.","The instructor let go and turned to Ye Jian. \"Find an opportunity to deal with him openly!\"","\"Yes!\"","Song Zhiqiu agreed quickly and suggested softly, \"You can arrange free combat from time to time. The opportunity is just right.\"","\"It’s a compulsory course. There’s no need to make too many arrangements. There’ll be one tonight.\" The instructor glanced at Brieth, who was swearing continuously. He didn’t ask him to apologize to Ye Jian and Song Zhiqiu. There was no need for an apology from such a person. They would settle it with force!","Brieth didn’t know how sad he would be in the days before he left China.","The competing students had to shoot ten bullets at a fixed point and then 20 rounds of bullets while searching and moving forward. They would first complete the shooting at a fixed point. Then, they would shoot while searching and moving forward. All 20 bullets had to be shot 30 meters away from the target.","There were two magazines. One magazine had ten bullets and one magazine had 20 bullets. Ye Jian checked the rifle and the contents of the two magazines.","Brieth, who was a few meters away, finished his inspection and glanced in the direction of the Chinese students. Seeing that she was still inspecting slowly, the habitual contempt on his face appeared again. He didn’t maintain it for long. The contempt turned into gloominess, and he tightened his grip on the rifle in his hand.","He was really unwilling to lose to the Chinese students!","\"If we shoot later, we’ll fire blank cartridge bullets at the Chinese students. Brieth, what do you think will happen?\"","\"Do you dare?\"","Hearing this, Brieth retracted his resentful gaze and stared at Cartright with his protruding eyes. \"But I know that the Chinese don’t have the right to punish us.\"","\"So...\"","\"So...\"","The two of them communicated silently and understood the madness in each other’s eyes.","The Chinese didn’t have the right to punish them. They wanted to fight, but it was just a thought. There were still six students from Sedoya in the middle. Even if they wanted to create an accident, they didn’t have a chance."]},{"number":4393,"title":"Chapter 4393: No Suspense","paragraphs":["However, the seeds of madness had been planted and could germinate at any time.","The three-minute inspection time was up. The 20-round magazine had been clipped properly. The ten-round magazine was loaded into the rifle. Brieth and Cartright, who were standing at the shooting position with their chins slightly raised, looked at each other. They were very confident.","The first whistle was blown, and all 18 students laid down and set up their rifles.","The second whistle sounded. The bullets were loaded, and the competition started.","Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang!","The fixed shooting distance was 150 meters away from the target. There were a total of ten bullets. Brieth and Cartright fired very quickly. Their shooting skills were top-notch. They had always been confident in their shooting skills.","Brieth was not afraid of death and provoked the Chinese students again.","The middle finger of his left hand was still hurting. The instructor didn’t break his middle finger because he was a foreign exchange student.","Brieth wanted to compete with the Chinese students, so he used his best ability. He carefully calibrated every bullet and maintained his speed at the same time. All ten bullets hit the chest targets. As for the number of points, those had to be confirmed later.","Cartright fired very quickly too. He fired continuously without stopping.","In the 150-meter chest ring target shooting match, the entire shooting range was filled with gunfire. 18 people fired at the same time. All of them wanted to hit the ten-ring. Their eyes gathered on the target. Their gaze passed through the bright white sunlight that made it impossible for them not to blink. Then, they landed on the target and completed their shooting. Due to the interference of the sunlight, the target was a little blurry.","It was very difficult to make ten shots when the light was bright and the target was a little blurry.","Assault rifle target shooting training was usually conducted at 100 meters and 200 meters. Today’s 150-meter shooting was for the competition as the students from Manchester and Sedoya were not familiar with the environment.","In some aspects, the school still tried their best to consider the exchange students of other countries. It could be said that the students from other military schools who came for the exchange could quickly adapt and had fond feelings for the school. However, Brieth and Cartright, who came with discrimination and dissatisfaction, would be dissatisfied regardless of what the school arranged.","They didn’t place themselves in good positions, nor did they recognize that as exchange students, they were just exchange students. They thought that they were better than others and came with arrogance. They ignored the national conditions of other countries and the rules and discipline of the school. They provoked the students in school, ignoring the rules and regulations. They emphasized their identity and noble bloodline. Their starting point was wrong. It was impossible for them to stay in the school for long. It was also impossible for the Chinese students to give in to them.","Due to their usual misdeeds and the fact that the competition was specially held because of their provocation, the six Chinese students couldn’t be humble.","Ye Jian fired her first bullet. Right on the heels of that, Song Zhiqiu fired. The six Chinese students held their rifles tightly. Their calm gazes focused on the door. Then, they locked onto the chest ring. Half of the ten bullets were fired in an instant.","Ye Jian, who was the first to complete her shooting, had already raised her head. The small red flag on the right was inserted into the soft soil to show that she had completed her shooting.","After recording the time, they would check the number of rings.","Brieth finished shooting. He inserted the little red flag that meant that he had finished shooting. A disdainful sneer appeared on his face as he stood up confidently."]},{"number":4394,"title":"Chapter 4394: Stupid Act","paragraphs":["Brieth stood up with an arrogant facial expression. He subconsciously looked at the Chinese students, and the cold smile on his face froze.","He thought that he would be the first to complete it, and that the person beside him would be second. But in fact... someone had completed the shooting before him.","Brieth, whose face and muscles had stiffened, was so angry that his chest hurt again. Even his middle finger, which had been twisted by the instructor, was hurting.","Damn it, the Chinese student had stood up!","When did she stand up?","Did she finish firing all ten bullets?","Another Chinese student stood up. Brieth thought Cartright would be the second one to stand up, but Cartright planted the little red flag about 15 seconds after the Chinese student.","Brieth, who had been given another severe blow, heaved up and down. It took him a lot of effort to retract his gloomy gaze from the Chinese students.","It didn’t matter. The results of the competition were based on the chest targets. So what if Ye Jian was the first to complete the shooting? The results didn’t have much to do with time!","Brieth, who failed again and again, couldn’t accept the fact that he had failed. He couldn’t face the fact that his skills were inferior to others. In the end, he used his ridiculous so-called identity and the nobility of his bloodline to protect his remaining arrogance.","At this moment, Cartright was in a bad mood too. He had always been confident in his shooting skills and speed. He thought that he would only fall behind the outstanding Brieth, but reality slapped him hard.","When they counted the chest rings, especially Ye Jian’s chest rings, he questioned her on the spot, \"No, that’s impossible! I need to check her chest rings! I raise my doubts!\"","Apart from Brieth, the other four students’ expressions turned ugly.","No matter how noble their identities and bloodlines were, they couldn’t be acting so stupidly!","They were ashamed of their stupid actions!","A Sedoyan student who happened to be very close to Cartright took a few steps away from him, putting distance between the two of them.","He was so stupid that even the students from his own country started to feel disgusted. Why didn’t he realize it?","The students from Sedoya could not understand this.","In the face of Cartright’s doubts, the instructor readily agreed.","He wouldn’t give up until he reached the end of his rope. He wouldn’t cry until she saw the coffin. Would he become obedient after being taught a few more lessons?","The students from Sedoya said that they didn’t have any doubts and that they didn’t need to check the target together. The other four students from Manchester didn’t want to go over either, but they didn’t have the chance to refuse. They could only follow.","Song Zhiqiu was the representative of the Chinese students. He followed the instructor and brought the Manchester students to check the targets.","The bullets fired by Ye Jian were concentrated in a circle on the chest target. The center circle was empty. When Cartright saw the empty center circle, he understood.","\"Do you still have any objections?\" Song Zhiqiu spoke on behalf of the instructor with a cold facial expression. \"Can we continue the competition? I hope you can perform well and don’t let such a situation happen again. Thank you.\"","The ’thank you’ was full of sarcasm. It made Cartright’s face burn with pain. He was in a sorry state.","Any objections?","Of course not.","Due to this objection, reality slapped him in the face a few times again. Those who with thin skin would have been too embarrassed and would’ve escaped from here. However, the two of them were shameless and could still stand."]},{"number":4395,"title":"Chapter 4395: Shameless","paragraphs":["Brieth pulled away the disgraced and ridiculed Cartright. He just pulled Cartright away without making an apology.","Of course, Song Zhiqiu didn’t need their apologies. The apologies of such people weren’t sincere either. They wouldn’t really realize what mistakes they had made.","There was no need for them to apologize.","It would be satisfying to use their strength to crush these two people until they lost their dignity and left like stray dogs!","Seeing this, Song Zhiqiu sneered and turned to leave.","The four students from Manchester felt their faces burning because of the two of them. A male student stood up and walked to the two of them. He said angrily in a low voice, \"Alright, Brieth and Cartright, listen! We don’t want to continue standing here and be watched like monkeys!\"","The two had made so many mistakes, but they still hadn’t realized their mistakes. It was a wrong decision for Manchester to send Brieth and Cartright to the Chinese military school!","In order to let everyone know that they had noble status and bloodline, they always liked to do stupid things in the eyes of the Chinese students!","The most infuriating thing was that they never thought that they had done anything stupid and laughable!","The student’s shout made Cartright feel like he had lost his reputation even more.","The Chinese students weren’t around, and even the school’s instructors had left. In an instant, with a ferocious look on his face, Cartright vented all the anger he couldn’t vent on this male student. \"Remember your identity! Lowly fellow!\"","The male student’s expression changed. He clenched his fists and used his eyes to express his anger.","That was right. In the eyes of Cartright and Brieth, they were all low-level fellows. They didn’t have the right to criticize these ’noblemen’!","The other three male students held back the student who was so angry that he was clenching his fists. They said in a low voice, \"We still have to compete. Let’s go, buddy.\"","The students who first spoke up was pulled away by the others. When he left, he stared at the two of them with anger in his eyes. There was deep unwillingness in his eyes.","Cartright raised his fist and said something insulting. The student’s eyes turned red. The veins on both sides of his temples bulged.","After returning to the shooting position, Song Zhiqiu said to Ye Jian in a low voice, \"They saw it and didn’t say anything for a long time. They can’t hold it in anymore. We’ll teach them another lesson tonight, then it’ll end soon.\"","Ye Jian heard the emphasis on ’teach them another lesson tonight’. She smiled and said, \"When we do it, let’s not cause an international dispute.\"","\"What international dispute can there be during combat training at night?\" Song Zhiqiu smiled. The smile in his bright eyes under the brim of his cap was deep.","He was very handsome. When he smiled, he was as happy as the sun. Ye Jian looked at him silently for a few seconds before turning her head to look in a certain direction.","She saw Xu Wen wiping the sweat off her face with her sleeve.","\"Don’t look at her. She’s usually quite smart, but she can’t tell what I’m thinking.\" Song Zhiqiu noticed it and rubbed his forehead resignedly. \"I’ll find a chance to confess during the summer vacation. I hope she won’t scream so loudly till everyone finds out.\"","\"Find a good place to confess so that she won’t have a chance to scream.\" Ye Jian thought highly of the two of them. Xu Wen had a carefree personality and would occasionally be clueless. She needed a man like Song Zhiqiu who could tolerate her.","\"I have the same intention. I’ll do it during the summer vacation.\" Song Zhiqiu looked at the woman he had a crush on. The gentleness in his eyes could be seen. He had a feeling that... Xu Wen knew about it and was just pretending."]},{"number":4396,"title":"Chapter 4396: Despicable","paragraphs":["As for Ye Jian, she really thought that Xu Wen didn’t know that Song Zhiqiu liked her.","It didn’t matter if she was pretending to be clueless. He had his own way of making her unable to continue pretending.","The students from Manchester had already returned. The instructor who was talking to the Sedoyan students, giving them a few more words of encouragement while waiting for the students from Manchester to arrive.","Carright dared to be impudent in front of the students, but he didn’t have the guts to go up against the instructor and officer.","When the total shooting points of the three parties were announced, the officer specially asked Cartright and Brieth if they had any questions. Both of them said no.","Brieth didn’t lash out this time. The truth was in front of them. They had nothing to say.","Before the shooting competition had even started, the students already knew who would win. With Ye Jian around, it would be difficult for anyone else to win!","Moreover, the six students who participated in this competition were all students with high military comprehensive skills. They stood there calmly. How could they lose?!","Besides Brieth and Cartright, the other students from Manchester and Sedoya had calmed down. This was a friendly match in itself. Now that the outcome had been decided, it was better to relax and complete the last match.","It was not surprising that they lost to the Chinese students. There was no need to be angry.","In the last match, the spectating students were not watching the competition. They were watching how the six Chinese students crushed the two overly arrogant fellows.","Cartright gripped his rifle tightly and glanced at the Chinese students with a dark gaze. The viciousness in his eyes was like a spider web.","He would teach the Chinese students a lesson and tell them what the consequences of disrespecting him were!","In order to prevent Brieth and Cartright from causing any accidents to the Chinese students, the officer and instructor specially arranged for the Sedoyan students to stand in the middle to separate the Chinese students and the students from Manchester. It was a wise arrangement.","Now, it was the last match. Due to the fact that Brieth and Cartright had lost too badly, the Chinese students could still feel their hatred from a certain distance. To be safe, the officer arranged for the instructor to keep an eye on the two of them who seemed like they would cause trouble at any time. He also secretly instructed Ye Jian, Song Zhiqiu, and the other students to be careful.","It was better to be careful.","The magazine containing 20 bullets was loaded into the rifle. As the whistle sounded, the 18 students loaded their bullets and quickly moved forward to shoot.","The total shooting range was 100 meters. After reaching 30 meters, all 20 bullets needed to be fired within three minutes. They needed to pick up their pace and speed of shooting. At the same time, they needed to ensure shooting accuracy. Naturally, the difficulty would increase.","Xu Wen widened her eyes that were red from sweat and stared at Ye Jian. She couldn’t shout for the time being. She held it in with all her might until her neck was red. She couldn’t help but pinch her thigh again. He Jing frowned and grabbed her arm.","The gunshots in the arena were very intense. Suddenly, the fast-moving Cartright seemed to have kicked something and was falling forward. He lost his footing and staggered a few steps before falling.","The students continued to shoot. Cartright, who fell, probably twisted his ankle. The first time he got up, he fell again. The instructor who was keeping an eye on him was running over.","Cartright climbed up the second time and stood still. The students in the competition had already surpassed him, and he was at least two bullets behind. He became the last, which was equivalent to standing behind all the students in the competition.","The instructor who ran over saw this, and his eyebrows jumped furiously. He seemed to have thought of something, and his pupils constricted instantly.","Danger! The Chinese students were in danger!"]},{"number":4397,"title":"Chapter 4397: Critical Hit","paragraphs":["As this thought flashed past his mind, the instructor saw Cartright, who was standing up with a gun in his hand, swaying his steps like a drunkard. The cold and pitch-black muzzle was also aimed at the Chinese student...","The instructor from before wasn’t the only ones who noticed something amiss. The instructors who had been staring at Cartright, Brieth, and several other teachers had also noticed it.","The students who were competing in front didn’t notice it. Although Ye Jian, Song Zhiqiu, and the other Chinese students were reminded in advance, they didn’t expect Cartright to be so bold. He dared to play tricks during the competition and wanted to hurt the Chinese students.","No one expected him to be so stupid.","Brieth, who was equally arrogant, didn’t expect him to really do this.","Cartright seemed to be swaying and unsteady, but his eyes were fixed on the Chinese student. He knew that it was dangerous for him to do this, but he wanted to do it!","After the accident, the Chinese military school would have no right to punish him. They would only hand him back to the country. Hahaha, he liked that!","\"What does he want?!\"","\"He’s targeting Ye Jian and the rest!\"","\"Instructor, Instructor...\"","The students had already reacted. Ye Jian’s classmates were the loudest. Xu Wen’s high-pitched voice was deafening.","The students who realized that there was a problem with Cartright were furious.","The instructor, who was running over, rushed over like a hungry tiger pouncing on its prey. He grabbed the barrel of the rifle facing the Chinese student and lifted it into the sky...","Bang!","A blank cartridge was fired into the air during training. At the same time, the instructor had a cold expression on his face as he grabbed Cartright’s arm and used one leg to hook Cartright’s leg. Cartright didn’t have time to react and was thrown over his shoulder by the instructor...","\"Ah...!\"","Amidst the ceaseless gunfire, the miserable screams of Cartright rose from the ground.","Not only did the instructor swing him over his shoulder, but he also dislocated Cartright’s right arm. From his wrist to his elbow, then to his shoulder, all three joints of his right arm were dislocated.","Screams were heard continuously. The gunshots didn’t cause any ripples in the company. Students in front didn’t know that something had happened to Cartright. They just wanted to end this competition as soon as possible. As for what was happening behind them, they didn’t pay attention.","Ye Jian didn’t notice it either.","17 rifles were fired at the same time. The gunshots shook the entire competition venue. There was also the sound of someone screaming, but there was nothing else other than that.","\"Don’t move. If you move again, I’ll break your neck!\"","The ruthless instructor quickly dislocated Cartright’s arm and turned a deaf ear to his screams. ’Bastard, how dare you play dirty under my eyes? Heh, if I don’t teach you a lesson, you’ll think you’re in Manchester!","’If you want to do whatever you want, you have to have the ability first!’","In the past 20 days in the National Science University, Cartright had never suffered so much. When he realized that he couldn’t escape, he started cursing.","\"Damn you! Get lost! Get lost!\"","Insults kept popping out of his mouth. Three minutes had passed. The gunshots stopped instantly. The 18 participants were 30 meters away from the target and had fired 20 bullets. They were just waiting to unload their magazines for inspection.","There were no more gunshots. Cartright’s screams and curses could be heard clearly.","The six students from Sedoya and China didn’t turn around. The sound of countless magazines being unloaded could be heard. They unloaded almost at the same time.","The four students from Manchester turned around and saw that Cartright was pressed to the ground. They didn’t say anything and continued to complete the last step of the match."]},{"number":4398,"title":"Chapter 4398: Exposed","paragraphs":["Brieth, who had also turned around, didn’t just turn his head like the other four students. Holding his rifle, he maintained his shooting posture and turned around. He aimed his muzzle at a certain spot...","Before he could see Cartright, a pair of strong hands grabbed his wrist and instantly pressed his arms down. \"This is against the rules. Run 3,000 meters.\"","The person’s cold gaze seemed to have seen through what Brieth wanted to do. A look of surprise flashed past Brieth’s eyes. He immediately put down his gun. A Chinese instructor? When did he stand behind him?","\"I don’t think that I violated the rules. I just want to see what happened to my comrade. So, I can’t accept punishment.\" He tried to quibble and struggle. His hand was hurting from the instructor’s grip. He couldn’t even lift his arm.","The instructor in charge of the daily training and communication of the exchange students was a graduate of the National Science University. His English was not bad, and he could usually act as an interpreter. Hearing that, the instructor held Brieth’s rifle tightly and said coldly, \"After shooting, students are required to unload the magazine immediately to prevent any accidents. This is the rule of the competition. You violated the rules.","\"Don’t try to quibble. Every move of all the students in the competition is recorded. We can watch what you did just now through the captured footage.\"","Were they being filmed?","A trace of panic flashed past Brieth’s eyes. He stopped talking and shrugged. He released his grip on his rifle. There were no bullets in his magazine. He just wanted to scare the Chinese students.","Knowing that he couldn’t escape punishment, Brieth became obedient for the time being. He looked at Cartright, who was still screaming and shouting crazily. His eyes widened as he shouted, \"What are you doing?! Damn it, let him go! Let him go!\"","What did he see?","He saw a Chinese instructor pressing down on Cartright. He saw his comrade being tortured by the Chinese instructor!","Brieth’s facial features twisted.","F*ck! F*ck!","Just now, he thought of using the last blank cartridge to teach the Chinese students a lesson. In the end, he gave up. Now, he regretted giving up!","He shouldn’t have given up!","If he hadn’t given up, he could have used the last blank cartridge to shoot the instructor who was mistreating Cartright!","Brieth, whose facial features were distorted, wanted to rush over and save Cartright. The instructor, who was staring at him, blocked his path. \"Brieth, I don’t mind treating you the same way. Are you sure you want to rush over?\"","How could he let the Chinese students see him get taken down by an instructor? Brieth looked around. He saw the six Chinese students participating in the competition staring at him coldly. He saw the students from Sedoya looking at him coldly and mockingly...","Seeing the viciousness in the instructor’s eyes, Brieth chose to stay where he was. He gritted his teeth and said, \"I’ll sue you. I’ll definitely sue you!\"","Seeing the viciousness in the instructor’s eyes, Brieth chose to stay where he was. He gritted his teeth and said, \"I’ll sue you. I’ll definitely sue you!\"","The instructor spoke calmly and ignored the so-called ’accusation’.","Ye Jian carried her rifle on her back. There seemed to be coldness in her pitch-black eyes. Before the competition, the instructors paid attention to their surroundings in advance. It seemed that when they were shooting, Cartright attempted to pull a trick. However, the instructor who had been keeping an eye on him stopped him in time.","What kind of tricks would he do with a gun?","There was no need to think too much about it. They just needed to think a little.","Blank cartridges were lethal within five meters too.","What was Cartright trying to do?","He wanted to use blank cartridges to shoot the Chinese students.","\"They’ll be sent back to Manchester tomorrow at the latest.\" Song Zhiqiu’s voice was cold. His expression was as cold as his voice."]},{"number":4399,"title":"Chapter 4399: The Seniors Are Amazing","paragraphs":["Ye Jian didn’t care if the two students would return tomorrow. She didn’t even care about the final result of this friendly competition.","It was expected of the Chinese students to win. The six students from the National Science University were very capable. How could they be trampled on by the students from other military schools? If they didn’t show their skills to deal with these arrogant fellows, they wouldn’t be worthy of being students of their school.","In the end, it was announced that the Chinese students had won all three matches. Fortunately, Brieth was tanned, so no one could tell what his expression looked like. He tried his best to control his expression so that no one would see what a sorry state he was in.","As for Cartright, his mistake was not an ordinary one. He did not even have the right to stand here and listen to the results of the competition. He was taken away.","Without Cartright by his side, Brieth had lost a partner who could support him. He was fighting alone, so no matter how unwilling he was in the heart or how noble his bloodline was, he had to stay down obediently in front of the Chinese student who defeated him.","The continuous applause of the Chinese students landed in Brieth’s ears, making his face burn with pain. The applause became a slap to his face.","He overestimated himself and didn’t know it. He was arrogant and thought that he was amazing. He provoked others all the time.","Even breathing became torturous.","The Chinese students watched the embarrassed Brieth as they applauded. They wanted to see how shameless he was and how long he could maintain his composure.","Brieth didn’t ask where Cartright had been taken. As a military school student, he knew very well how bad the mistakes he made were. But so what?","The Chinese military school didn’t have the right to punish Cartright. Even if he was punished, he would only return to Manchester.","The applause finally ended. The friendly competition that suddenly started ended. The freshmen and fourth-year students who were watching the competition left with their teams and returned to the training ground.","The students from the three or four classes still led the way back to the training ground. At this moment, every student’s arms were drenched in sweat from the sun. Their faces were also red from the sun. Their skin was burning, but no one cared about this. Every young face was smiling. It was brighter and hotter than the sun.","\"She broke the record. She really broke the record. I heard the instructor confirm it with the officer. It can’t be wrong!\"","\"Didn’t the students from Ye Jian’s class say that she broke our senior’s record? She was four seconds faster than our senior!\"","\"Four seconds! That’s amazing!\"","The 400-meter obstacle course was not to be underestimated. That was why the students were surprised.","\"She has always been powerful. From her first year to her third year, when has she not been powerful?\"","\"That’s right. But she broke our senior’s record today. I’m still quite shocked. Our senior isn’t an ordinary person.\"","\"Our senior isn’t an ordinary person, and Ye Jian isn’t either.\"","In a certain military base, Lieutenant Colonel Xia caught a cold for the first time. His nose was seriously stuffed. As he trained the soldiers, he sneezed non-stop. Even his voice was hoarse.","He kept using and tossing out tissue papers. But his nose was still too itchy and uncomfortable. Lieutenant Colonel Xia simply used a tissue paper and made it into a long strip, stuffing it into his nose. The sight hurt G3’s eyes. \"You took four to five cold showers in the middle of the night and even went crazy, wearing a pair of sports shorts to run laps. How could you not catch a cold?\""]},{"number":4400,"title":"Chapter 4400: Young And Insatiable","paragraphs":["\"Ah-choo!\"","Xia Jinyuan sneezed again, and the tissue paper that was stuffed into his nose came shooting out. He reacted quickly and grabbed the tissue paper. Then, he stuffed it back into his nose. He turned his head and said to G3, \"Comrade, I’m filled with hostility toward married men now. In order to avoid hurting our friendship, please stay away from me immediately.\"","At first, G3 didn’t understand the deeper meaning. When he realized what was going on, he burst into laughter.","\"Why don’t we roll in the mud with them and expend our energy? You sure are young and energetic.\" As comrades, G3 felt that he show still show some concern to his captain. Young people were too energetic. If they were not careful, it would hurt their bodies.","The wearer knew the best where the shoe pinches were. Hahahaha, G3 looked at the young captain sitting in the front row. He was sitting on the seat cushion and stepping on the car door with one leg. Hahaha... Why did he want to laugh so much?","The two of them sat in the mountain car. It was early to dry themselves in the mountain. Although it was hot at 3:00 pm, Xia Jinyuan drove the mountain car under the shade of a tree. It was shady above his head and the mountain breeze blew on his body. He didn’t get exposed to the sun, and there was a cool breeze.","G3, who was sitting in the back row, laughed until he fell backward. Xia Jinyuan, who was sitting in the front row, turned his head and glanced at the fellow who didn’t have any sense of camaraderie. He stepped on the pedal of the mountain car with his long leg and shook the other in a roguish manner. \"As the vice-captain, shouldn’t you go down and guide them?\"","Xia Jinyuan had long arms and legs. Even though he was sitting in the spacious mountain car, he had nowhere to stretch his limbs. He needed to curl up a little. Hence, every time he parked the car, he would climb onto the seat. That way, his limbs would be more comfortable.","He was comfortable. The special forces soldiers who were hugging logs in the mud and shouting for training were not. Especially when they saw the two captains sitting in the car and chatting. They felt so aggrieved!","They wanted to beat them up!","Sitting in the car and enjoying the cool weather... Why were they so good at enjoying themselves?","\"Captain, Captain, come, come. There’s freshly cut watermelon from the cooking team! The watermelon is still dripping with juice. Hurry up and try it!\"","Before the grievances in the hearts of the special forces soldiers during training could dissipate, the second wave of grievances came right on the heels of that. There was actually watermelon to eat!","They were drinking muddy water, but the captain could eat watermelons!","The eyes of several special forces soldiers started to spit fire. What kind of lousy captain was he? They hadn’t seen him for a year. It wasn’t easy for him to show his face and teach them something. They really wanted to put a gunnysack on him and beat him up.","\"What are you guys doing? Didn’t you eat? Don’t you have any energy? Pick them up. Don’t let me see you putting them on your legs! Pick them up! Water cannon, water cannon!\"","Beside the mud pit, T6 was holding a loudspeaker in his hand. His delicate baby face was no longer as soft as usual. His eyes were as sharp as arrows as he stared at the 30 special forces soldiers in the mud pit. No one could relax.","Beside him was V8, who was holding a high-pressure water cannon. The two of them were partners and cooperated seamlessly. T6 shouted, \"Water cannon!\" V8 unscrewed the lid, and a column of water spewed into the mud like a dragon.","He wasn’t spraying the water on the mud. He was spraying the special forces soldiers who were undergoing cruel training.","The water pressure was very high. When it sprayed on the body, it hurt. Their stamina was high, but after being sprayed by the high-pressure water cannon, it became harder for them to sit up while hugging the log. They couldn’t sit up a few times. Even so, they persevered and didn’t give up."]}]);
